msgstr "夺取圣火权杖"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/00_The_Great_Continent.cfg:550
msgid "Choose a path and escape the rising lava"
msgstr "选择一条路线，逃离不断上涨的岩浆"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/00_The_Great_Continent.cfg:563
msgid ""
"Prepare to fight Asheviere ($( $bm_milestone_finale - $bm_turns ) battles "
