"都就位了吗？"

#. [message]: speaker=Warven
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:784
msgid "Northern company ready and reporting, ma’am."
msgstr "北方连队准备就绪，前来报到，长官。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:788
msgid "Yrridyn"
msgstr "伊里丁"

#. [message]: speaker=leader6
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:800
msgid ""
"We’ve burned the trolls out of the eastern tunnels. Our way forward is clear."
msgstr "我们已将巨魔从东部隧道中烧了出去。前路畅通无阻。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:804
msgid "Arynnoc"
msgstr "阿林诺克"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:805
msgid "Gwytharyn"
msgstr "格维萨林"

#. [message]: speaker=leader7
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:817
msgid ""
"My bowmen and I are ready and waiting at the far passage. They won’t get "
"through us, Your Highness."
msgstr "我和我的弓手已在远端通道准备就绪，严阵以待。他们休想越过我们，殿下。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:825
msgid ""
"Good. And Mirya — scout around for any other exits we’ve missed. We must not "
"allow Konrad to escape with the Sceptre of Fire."
msgstr ""
"很好。还有，米莉娅——去侦察一下还有没有我们遗漏的其他出口。绝不能让科纳德带着"
"圣火权杖逃走。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:861
msgid ""
"Li’sar expects us to try to escape? No, I will not yield so easily. Hold "
"strong, friends. We must guard Delfador while he unearths the Sceptre, or "
"perhaps even attack and defeat Li’sar herself!"
msgstr ""
"莉莎以为我们会设法逃跑？不，我不会这么轻易屈服。坚守住，朋友们。我们必须在德"
"法多挖出权杖时保护他，甚至或许该主动出击，击败莉莎本人！"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:865
msgid ""
"The Sceptre is valuable, but your life is even more so, Konrad. If our "
"forces are not yet strong enough to confront the army of Wesnoth, do not be "
"afraid to swallow your pride and flee. I feel fresh air coming from the "
"north."
msgstr ""
"圣火权杖固然珍贵，但你的性命更加珍贵，科纳德。倘若我们的力量尚不足以迎战韦诺"
"的军队，就不要害怕放下骄傲、先行撤离。我感觉到有清新的空气从北方吹来。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:869
msgid "Of course, fleeing would surely mean leaving the Sceptre behind..."
msgstr "当然，逃跑无疑就意味着要舍弃圣火权杖……"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:877
msgid "Cowardly Victory:"
msgstr "怯懦胜利："

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:878
msgid "Move Konrad to any edge of the map"
msgstr "移动科纳德至地图的任意一端"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:882
msgid "Normal Victory:"
msgstr "常规胜利："

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:883
msgid "(gain the Sceptre of Fire)"
msgstr "（获得圣火权杖）"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:883
msgid "Protect Delfador until he unearths the sceptre"
msgstr "保护德法多，直到他掘出圣火权杖"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:888
msgid "Heroic Victory:"
msgstr "英勇胜利："

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:889
msgid "(gain the Sceptre of Fire, and special armor for Konrad)"
msgstr "（获得圣火权杖，以及科纳德的特殊护甲）"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:913
msgid ""
"You know I am here to claim the Sceptre as my birthright, Li’sar. Is your "
"hatred so great that you would rather chase after us than even <b><i>try</"
"i></b> to save Wesnoth from the ruin it has fallen to at the hands of your "
"mother?"
msgstr ""
"莉莎，你知道我来此是为了取回那本就该由我继承的圣火权杖。难道你的仇恨如此深"
"重，以至于你宁可追赶我们，也不愿哪怕<b><i>试着</i></b>把韦诺从你母亲造成的毁"
"灭中拯救出来吗？"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:918
msgid ""
"I <i>am</i> trying to save it — from you. Do you have any idea how much "
"chaos you and your little gang of ruffians have caused?"
msgstr ""
"我<b>确实</b>在拯救它——从你手中。你可知道你和你那群小流氓造成了多大的混乱？"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:922
msgid ""
"Asheviere took control of Wesnoth with violence, and violence has filled "
"every part of her reign. All she knows is blood! And all she cares about is "
"power."
msgstr ""
"艾什薇尔以暴力夺取了韦诺的控制权，而暴力也充斥着她统治的每一处。她只知道鲜"
"血！她只在乎权力。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:926
msgid ""
"You really are just a child. Maybe the Aethenwood runs on friendship and "
"flowers, but here in the real world sometimes people get hurt. And yes, "
"sometimes that means unsavory decisions, like the kind the queen has to make "
"every day."
msgstr ""
"你真的只是个孩子。也许艾森丛林靠友谊和鲜花运转，但在现实世界里，人有时就是会"
"受伤。没错，有时这意味着要做出不光彩的决定，就像女王每天不得不做的那些决定一"
"样。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:930
msgid ""
"Perhaps you truly think you’re acting for the best. But know this: with me "
"today stand free peoples from all corners of Wesnoth, united as one against "
"the tyranny of Asheviere. Whether we defeat you now or never, Wesnoth will "
"never stop fighting for what is right!"
msgstr ""
"也许你真的以为自己在为大局着想。但你要明白：今天与我并肩而立的，是来自韦诺各"
"个角落的自由人民，我们团结一心，共同反抗艾什薇尔的暴政。无论我们今日能否战胜"
"你，韦诺都绝不会停止为正义而战！"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:935
msgid ""
"... not bad, as hero speeches go. We’ll see how the palace dungeons change "
"your tune."
msgstr ""
"……作为英雄演讲来说，倒还不赖。我们倒要看看，王宫地牢会如何让你改换腔调。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:953
msgid ""
"I am making progress, Konrad! We are perhaps half of the way to the Sceptre."
msgstr "进展顺利，科纳德！我们或许已经走完通往权杖的一半路程了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:960
msgid "Almost done, Konrad. We shall soon hold the Sceptre in our hands!"
msgstr "快完成了，科纳德。我们很快就能亲手握住权杖了！"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:967
msgid ""
"I see red and gold poking though the earth! We shall have the Sceptre in but "
"another moment!"
msgstr "我看见红色与金色正从泥土中露出！再过片刻，我们就能拿到权杖了！"

#. [message]: speaker=Warven
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:979
msgid "Argh! He’s more powerful than we thought. I have to get away!"
msgstr "呃啊！他比我们预想的还要强大。我得赶紧逃走！"

#. [message]: speaker=leader6
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:989
msgid "Decades of study and practice, only to die in a cave..."
msgstr "数十年的钻研与修行，到头来竟要死在一个洞穴里……"

#. [message]: speaker=leader7b
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1005
msgid "Ack! I’m sorry, Your Highness, I couldn’t stop them..."
msgstr "啊！对不起，殿下，我没能拦住他们……"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1024
msgid "For the Aethenwood! For Wesnoth! For all the world!"
msgstr "为了艾森丛林！为了韦诺！为了整个世界！"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1026
msgid "The wrath of the elves falls upon you, girl!"
msgstr "精灵之怒，今降汝身，丫头！"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1027
msgid "Your mother has much to answer for. We shall start with you."
msgstr "你母亲有太多罪责要交代。我们就从你开始。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1028
msgid ""
"Ah’ll teach you and yer men to cage me up, ye obscene trunk of tallow-keech!"
msgstr ""
"俺要好好教教你和你那帮手下，敢把俺关起来是什么下场，你这不要脸的肥油墩子！"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1029
msgid ""
"The blood of traitors runs in your veins, girl. In Garard’s name, I strike "
"you down!"
msgstr "叛徒的血流淌在你的血管里，丫头。以伽拉德之名，我要将你击倒！"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1030
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1031
msgid "Behold the flames of Alduin!"
msgstr "看哪，奥渡因的烈焰！"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1032
msgid "By the Light we were made! Lo, and by the Light shall you be un-made!"
msgstr "我们由圣光所造！看哪，你也必被圣光所灭！"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1033
msgid "This is for Baldras!"
msgstr "这是为了巴尔德拉斯！"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1034
msgid "Sorry about this, but it has to be done!"
msgstr "抱歉了，但这事非做不可！"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1035
msgid "You done made wrong enemy, softskin!"
msgstr "你惹错敌人啦，软皮！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1124
msgid ""
"I have found an exit from the cavern! Quick, everyone, follow me and we may "
"yet evade Li’sar within the twisting tunnels!"
msgstr "我找到洞穴的出口了！大家快跟上，我们或许还能在蜿蜒的隧道里避开莉莎！"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1150
msgid ""
"Did you hear that? An earthquake! What sorcery of yours is this, Delfador? "
"Are you collapsing this whole cavern?"
msgstr ""
"你听到了吗？地震！德法多，这是你搞的什么巫术？你是要把整座洞穴都弄塌吗？"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1155
msgid ""
"I am not the cause of these tremors — what does that fool mage of yours "
"think she is doing? The volcano is awakening! Is she trying to kill us and "
"you both!?"
msgstr ""
"这些震动不是我引起的——你那个愚蠢的法师以为自己在干什么？火山正在苏醒！她是想"
"把我们和你都杀掉吗！？"

#. [message]: speaker=Mirya
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1159
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1232
msgid ""
"Sorry, Your Highness, queen’s orders. Better that nobody leaves than Konrad "
"does."
msgstr "抱歉，殿下，女王有令。宁可所有人都留下，也不能放走科纳德。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1163
msgid ""
"What?! Mirya, there’s no need for this! They’ve left without the Sceptre, "
"and it is a long way to the surface. We’ll have plenty of time to chase them "
"down!"
msgstr ""
"什么？！米莉娅，没必要这么做！他们没带权杖就离开了，而到地面还有很长一段路。"
"我们有充足时间追上他们！"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1171
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1244
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1356
msgid ""
"We are all in terrible danger! Konrad, stay close. You and I must flee with "
"great haste — my spells shall speed our steps!"
msgstr ""
"我们全都身处险境！科纳德，跟紧我。你我必须尽快逃离——我的法术会加快我们的脚"
"步！"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1197
msgid ""
"It is here! We have found it! The Sceptre of Fire; the Ruby of the Wesfolk; "
"the staff of kings. Konrad, you must come at once!"
msgstr ""
"它在这里！我们找到了！圣火权杖；韦福克人的红宝石；君王之杖。科纳德，你必须立"
"刻过来！"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1202
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1299
msgid ""
"The Sceptre, initially dulled from centuries of dust and debris, began to "
"glow from its ruby’s inner fire. Dwarvish runes on the golden handle lit up "
"in pulsating blue as Konrad’s fingers wrapped around the staff."
msgstr ""
"由于数百年的积尘与碎石，权杖最初显得有些暗淡，此刻却开始因红宝石内蕴之火而熠"
"熠生辉。当科纳德的手指握住杖身时，黄金杖柄上的矮人符文显现出脉动的蓝色。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1209
msgid ""
"The Sceptre is ours! It is not just a great weapon, but also a symbol; a way "
"to convince the people that I would truly belong as king. Now we finally "
"have the upper hand against Asheviere."
msgstr ""
"权杖是我们的了！它不只是一件强大的武器，更是一个象征；一种让人民相信我的确配"
"得上成为国王的方式。现在我们对艾什薇尔终于占了上风。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1219
msgid ""
"An earthquake!? Delfador, is this your doing? Has removing the Sceptre "
"somehow damaged the cavern?"
msgstr "地震！？德法多，这是你干的吗？取走权杖是不是不知怎么损坏了这个洞穴？"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1224
msgid ""
"I am not the cause of these tremors — what does that fool mage of Li’sar’s "
"think she is doing? The volcano is awakening! Is she trying to kill us and "
"the princess both!?"
msgstr ""
"这些震动不是我引起的——莉莎那个愚蠢的法师以为自己在干什么？火山正在苏醒！她是"
"想把我们和公主都杀掉吗！？"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1228
msgid ""
"What?! Mirya, you’re supposed to be scouting the tunnels, not destroying "
"them."
msgstr "什么？！米莉娅，你该去侦察隧道，而不是摧毁它们。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1236
msgid ""
"What?! Mirya, there’s no need for this! Konrad may have the Sceptre, but we "
"have them surrounded. Even if they escape to the surface we’ll have plenty "
"of time to chase them down!"
msgstr ""
"什么？！米莉娅，没必要这么做！科纳德也许拿到了权杖，可我们已经包围了他们。就"
"算他们逃到地面，我们也有充足时间追捕他们！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1248
msgid "But we have only just taken hold of the Sceptre! What about—"
msgstr "可我们才刚刚拿到权杖！那——"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1252
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1364
msgid "There is no time! Run, Konrad, run!"
msgstr "没时间了！快跑，科纳德，快跑！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1272
msgid ""
"You are beaten, villain! With your defeat, we have severed the right hand of "
"Asheviere!"
msgstr "你输了，恶徒！你的失败，等于我们斩断了艾什薇尔的右臂！"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION defeat}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1276
msgid ""
"I can’t believe it. Bested so far from home, and during my own ambush. "
"Embarrassing... Make it quick, then."
msgstr ""
"真不敢相信。离家这么远，还在我自己的伏击中败北。真难堪……那就给我个痛快吧。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1281
msgid ""
"No. You are to be my prisoner, and we shall ransom you to your mother in "
"exchange for her abdication; a better and more merciful use of your head "
"than petty vengeance. Delfador, do you have the Sceptre yet?"
msgstr ""
"不。你要成为我的俘虏，我们会用你向你母亲换取她的退位；这比为了微不足道的复仇"
"砍下你的脑袋要更好，也更仁慈。德法多，你拿到权杖了吗？"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1292
msgid ""
"I do! It is here — the Sceptre of Fire; the Ruby of the Wesfolk; the staff "
"of kings. Konrad, I shall bring it to you at once."
msgstr ""
"拿到了！它就在这里——圣火权杖；韦福克人的红宝石；君王之杖。科纳德，我这就把它"
"带给你。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1305
msgid ""
"The Sceptre is ours. It is not just a great weapon, Konrad, but also a "
"symbol; more proof of your kingship. And with Li’sar defeated, I wonder if "
"we might add yet another symbol to your claim..."
msgstr ""
"权杖是我们的了。科纳德，它不只是一件强大的武器，更是一个象征；是你王权身份的"
"又一证明。既然莉莎已被击败，我在想，我们或许还能为你的继位主张再添一个象征……"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION defeat}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1319
msgid ""
"What have you done, old man? You hold something that looks exactly like my "
"armor, finely crafted and inscribed with symbols of royalty, yet what I "
"still wear is intact. How is this possible?"
msgstr ""
"你干了什么，老家伙？你拿着的东西和我的铠甲一模一样，做工精良，还刻着王室徽"
"记，可我身上穿的这件却完好无损。这怎么可能？"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mentoring}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1323
msgid ""
"A magical copy, with some improvements and details adjusted for Konrad! It "
"will exist only for a year and a day, but that will be more than enough time "
"to overthrow Asheviere."
msgstr ""
"一件魔法复制品，做了一些改进，还按科纳德的身形调整了细节！它只能存在一年零一"
"天，但推翻艾什薇尔，这点时间绰绰有余。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad # no variation, so we can see him with both the sceptre and the chainmail
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1329
msgid ""
"Thank you, Delfador. This is truly a great boon! Now, to bind our prisoner "
"and once more ascend to the surface."
msgstr ""
"谢谢你，德法多。这真是莫大的恩赐！现在，把我们的俘虏捆起来，再次返回地面吧。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1339
msgid ""
"An earthquake!? Delfador, is this also your doing? Has removing the Sceptre "
"somehow damaged the cavern?"
msgstr "地震！？德法多，这也是你干的吗？取走权杖是不是不知怎么损坏了这个洞穴？"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1344
msgid ""
"I am not the cause of these tremors — what does that fool mage of Li’sar’s "
"think she is doing? The volcano is awakening! Is she trying to kill us and "
"her princess both!?"
msgstr ""
"这些震动不是我引起的——莉莎那个愚蠢的法师以为自己在干什么？火山正在苏醒！她是"
"想把我们和她的公主都杀掉吗！？"

#. [message]: speaker=Mirya
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1348
msgid ""
"Sorry, Li’sar, queen’s orders. You had your chance and you failed. Now it’s "
"time for the backup plan."
msgstr "抱歉，莉莎，女王有令。你曾有机会，却失败了。现在该执行备用计划了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1360
msgid "I have the princess tied up! But what about—"
msgstr "我已经把公主捆起来了！可那——"

#. [time]: id=underground
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:17
msgid "Underground"
msgstr "地下"

#. [generator]: id=cavegen
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:97
msgid "Plunging Into Darkness Caves"
msgstr "突入黑暗洞穴"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:327
msgid ""
"Blue sparks leapt from the wizard’s staff as he and his young ward plunged "
"into the corrosive water with supernatural haste, resurfacing moments later "
"inside a larger chamber."
msgstr ""
"蓝色火花自巫师的法杖上迸射而出，他与年轻的受监护人一同以超自然的速度跃入腐蚀"
"性的水中，片刻后在一处更宽敞的洞室里浮出水面。"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:329
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:339
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:359
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:369
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:379
msgid ""
"The sounds of rupturing earth behind rose to a crescendo, then faded into "
"the distance, as meanwhile an uncomfortable heat pressed close at their "
"backs."
msgstr ""
"身后大地迸裂的声响升至顶峰，随后消散在远处；与此同时，一股令人不适的灼热紧逼"
"他们的后背。"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:337
msgid ""
"Blue sparks leapt from the wizard’s staff as he and his young ward sped away "
"from the rising lava with supernatural haste. The few veterans able to "
"follow dashed madly through the cave, then passed alongside Konrad into a "
"larger chamber."
msgstr ""
"蓝色火花自巫师的法杖上迸射而出，他和他年轻的受监护人以超自然的速度逃离不断上"
"涨的熔岩。少数能跟上的老兵疯狂地冲过洞穴，随后跟着科纳德进入一处更大的石室。"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:347
msgid ""
"Blue sparks leapt from the wizard’s staff as he and his young ward sped away "
"from the rising lava with supernatural haste, leaving both their brave "
"volunteers and Li’sar’s distracted soldiers far behind as they passed into a "
"larger chamber."
msgstr ""
"蓝色火花自巫师的法杖上迸射而出，他和他年轻的受监护人以超自然的速度逃离不断上"
"涨的熔岩，当他们进入一处更大的石室时，把勇敢的志愿兵和莉莎那些慌乱分神的士兵"
"都远远甩在身后。"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:349
msgid ""
"The sounds of rupturing earth rose to a crescendo, then faded into the "
"distance, as meanwhile an uncomfortable heat pressed close at their backs."
msgstr ""
"大地迸裂的声响升至顶峰，随后消散在远处；与此同时，一股令人不适的灼热紧逼他们"
"的后背。"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:357
msgid ""
"Blue sparks leapt from the wizard’s staff as he and his young ward sped away "
"from the rising lava with supernatural haste. The harried soldiers plunged "
"deeper and deeper into the smothering darkness, further and further from the "
"light of the sun."
msgstr ""
"蓝色火花自巫师的法杖上迸射而出，他和他年轻的受监护人以超自然的速度逃离不断上"
"涨的熔岩。狼狈的士兵们在令人窒息的黑暗中越陷越深，离太阳的光辉也越来越远。"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:367
msgid ""
"Blue sparks leapt from the wizard’s staff as he and his young ward sped away "
"from the rising lava with supernatural haste. The harried soldiers held back "
"vomit as they beat a path through the horrifying squalor filling their "
"tunnel, then passed thankfully into a larger chamber."
msgstr ""
"蓝色火花自巫师的法杖上迸射而出，他和他年轻的受监护人以超自然的速度逃离不断上"
"涨的熔岩。狼狈的士兵们强忍呕吐，在充斥隧道的骇人污秽中辟出一条路，随后满怀感"
"激地进入一处更大的石室。"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:377
msgid ""
"Blue sparks leapt from the wizard’s staff as he and his young ward sped away "
"from the rising lava with supernatural haste. The harried soldiers rushed "
"thankfully through the miraculously opened passage."
msgstr ""
"蓝色火花自巫师的法杖上迸射而出，他和他年轻的受监护人以超自然的速度逃离不断上"
"涨的熔岩。狼狈的士兵们满怀感激地冲过那条奇迹般洞开的通道。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:460
msgid ""
"Faster, faster! My speeding spells begin to fade, but the fires continue to "
"rise! Hurry, Konrad; we must keep ahead of the lava until it recedes! Is Her "
"Highness secure?"
msgstr ""
"快些，再快些！我的加速法术正在消退，可火焰仍在上涨！快跑，科纳德；我们必须一"
"直跑在熔岩前面，直到它退去！公主殿下可还安好？"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:464
msgid ""
"I have chained her wrist to mine, Delfador. But are our friends and allies "
"all with us? We can’t leave anyone behind!"
msgstr ""
"我已把她的手腕锁在我的手腕上，德法多。可我们的朋友和盟友都还跟着我们吗？我们"
"不能落下任何人！"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:468
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:494
msgid ""
"Yes, they’re all still here. But everyone is running willy-nilly, and I "
"doubt we will find a keep in which to rally. If we do not hurry we shall "
"surely be caught by the lava, or else by some pursuing ally of Li’sar’s!"
msgstr ""
"是的，他们都还在这儿。但所有人都慌不择路地乱跑，我怀疑我们找不到一座可以集结"
"的堡垒。若再不快些，我们肯定会被熔岩吞没，要么就会被莉莎的某个盟友追上来！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:472
msgid ""
"No! Surely those we did not defeat have burned to death. This has been a "
"tight thing for us even with your magic to help!"
msgstr ""
"不！那些没被我们打败的人肯定已经烧死了。就算有你的魔法相助，这一路也险得很！"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:476
msgid ""
"Perhaps so, perhaps not. In any case I cannot imagine our prisoner’s army "
"has fared well — and the same fate will meet us too if you do not <i><b>stop "
"talking and start running</b></i>!"
msgstr ""
"也许如此，也许未必。无论如何，我无法想象我们那名俘虏的军队能有什么好下场——你"
"要是再不<i><b>闭上嘴、跑起来</b></i>，同样的命运也会落到我们头上！"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:486
msgid ""
"Faster, faster! My speeding spells begin to fade, but the fires continue to "
"rise! Hurry, Konrad; we must keep ahead of the lava until it recedes!"
msgstr ""
"快些，再快些！我的加速法术正在消退，可火焰仍在上涨！快跑，科纳德；我们必须一"
"直跑在熔岩前面，直到它退去！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:490
msgid ""
"Are our friends and allies all with us, Delfador? We can’t leave anyone "
"behind!"
msgstr "德法多，我们的朋友和盟友都还跟着我们吗？我们不能落下任何人！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:498
msgid ""
"No! Surely Li’sar and her loyalists have burned to death. This has been a "
"tight thing for us even with your magic to help!"
msgstr ""
"不！莉莎和她的忠实追随者肯定已经烧死了。就算有你的魔法相助，这一路也险得很！"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:502
msgid ""
"Perhaps so, perhaps not. In any case I cannot imagine her army has fared "
"well — and the same fate will meet us too if you do not <i><b>stop talking "
"and start running</b></i>!"
msgstr ""
"也许如此，也许未必。无论如何，我无法想象她的军队能有什么好下场——你要是再不"
"<i><b>闭上嘴、跑起来</b></i>，同样的命运也会落到我们头上！"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:511
msgid "Move Konrad or Delfador to the east edge of the map"
msgstr "移动科纳德和德法多至地图的东端"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:516
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:663
msgid "Death of Li’sar"
msgstr "莉莎死亡"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:527
msgid ""
"Lava expands 1 hex in every direction each turn, and will kill Konrad if it "
"reaches him."
msgstr "熔岩每回合向各个方向扩张1格，触及科纳德时会将其杀死。"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:529
msgid ""
"Lava expands 2 hexes in every direction each turn, and will kill Konrad if "
"it reaches him."
msgstr "熔岩每回合向各个方向扩张2格，触及科纳德时会将其杀死。"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:533
msgid "Li’sar is chained to Konrad, and will follow one hex behind him."
msgstr "莉莎被锁链锁在科纳德身上，会跟在他身后一格处。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:586
msgid ""
"What are we doing? Li’sar is a prisoner of great value! I have no desire to "
"execute an unarmed woman, enemy though she may be."
msgstr ""
"我们在做什么？莉莎是极有价值的俘虏！就算她是敌人，我也不愿处决一个手无寸铁的"
"女人。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:629
msgid ""
"Undead! What are such things doing down here? They will surely try to stop "
"us — and with no regard for their own safety!"
msgstr ""
"亡灵！这种东西怎么会出现在这下面？它们肯定会来阻拦我们——而且全然不顾自身安"
"危！"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION defeat}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:633
msgid ""
"Then give me my sword and I will cut them down. Or are you too afraid to let "
"me out of these chains?"
msgstr ""
"那就把剑给我，我来把它们砍翻。还是说你太害怕了，不敢把我从这些锁链里放出来？"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:637
msgid ""
"Hmph. We cannot afford to become bogged down fighting. At least one good "
"thing comes of all this flame: it is easy to summon fire elementals!"
msgstr ""
"哼。我们可耗不起陷入苦战。这一片火焰至少带来一点好处：召唤火元素很容易！"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION defeat}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:658
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1425
msgid "Aaaaah! I can’t believe it should end like this..."
msgstr "啊！！！我不相信居然会这样结束……"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:664
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1431
msgid ""
"Our prisoner has perished! She was an enemy, but I cannot shake the feeling "
"that Her Highness yet had a role to play in all this..."
msgstr ""
"我们的俘虏死了！她虽是敌人，可我总摆脱不了一种感觉：公主殿下在这场变故中本还"
"该有她的角色……"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:683
msgid ""
"The cave here slopes sharply upwards, and the lava behind is slowing! We’ve "
"done it, Delfador; we have escaped — and with Li’sar as our prisoner! The "
"gambit of that mage of Asheviere’s has failed."
msgstr ""
"这里的洞穴陡然向上倾斜，身后的熔岩也慢下来了！我们成功了，德法多；我们逃出来"
"了——还抓住了莉莎做俘虏！艾什薇尔手下那名法师的诡计失败了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:688
msgid ""
"The cave here slopes sharply upwards, and the lava behind is slowing! We’ve "
"done it, Delfador; we have escaped! The gambit of that mage of Asheviere’s "
"has failed."
msgstr ""
"这里的洞穴陡然向上倾斜，身后的熔岩也慢下来了！我们成功了，德法多；我们逃出来"
"了！艾什薇尔手下那名法师的诡计失败了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:699
msgid ""
"Failed in part, but not in whole. While we gathered many low-quality weapons "
"during our escape, much of our veterans’ equipment suffered serious damage. "
"Repairing them may prove costly."
msgstr ""
"那只是部分失败，并非全盘失败。虽然我们在逃亡途中捡到了许多劣质武器，但老兵们"
"的装备大多严重受损。修理它们恐怕花费不菲。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:706
msgid ""
"Failed in part, but not in whole. My mind feels oddly sharp, but what of our "
"trainees? I sense some magical malady upon them, sapping their intellect. "
"Training more veterans may prove difficult."
msgstr ""
"那只是部分失败，并非全盘失败。我的头脑感觉异常敏锐，可我们的受训新兵呢？我感"
"应到他们身上有种魔法恶疾，正在消磨他们的心智。要把更多人训练成老兵恐怕会很困"
"难。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:714
msgid ""
"Failed in part, but not in whole. While thus far we have been fortunate "
"enough to evade the lava, we are still lost deep underground, with the bulk "
"of our stores and rations lost to flame."
msgstr ""
"那只是部分失败，并非全盘失败。虽说我们迄今幸运地躲开了熔岩，但仍迷失在深深的"
"地下，大部分补给和口粮都已被火焰吞噬。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:718
msgid ""
"Indeed, hunger and weakness already gnaw at my stomach. We must find a way "
"to the surface soon, or these caves may yet prove our doom..."
msgstr ""
"的确，饥饿与虚弱已经在啃噬我的胃。我们必须尽快找到通往地面的路，否则这些洞穴"
"仍可能成为我们的葬身之地……"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:733
msgid ""
"Even worse, the bulk of our stores and rations have been lost to the lava! "
"Hunger and weakness already gnaw at my stomach. We must find a way to the "
"surface soon, or these caves may yet prove our doom..."
msgstr ""
"更糟的是，我们的大部分补给和口粮都已被熔岩吞没！饥饿与虚弱已经在啃噬我的胃。"
"我们必须尽快找到通往地面的路，否则这些洞穴仍可能成为我们的葬身之地……"

#. [scenario]: id=32_The_Swamp_of_Dread
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:7
msgid "scenario name^The Swamp of Dread"
msgstr "恐惧沼泽"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:412
msgid ""
"Konrad, Delfador, and their army wandered for days, lost in lonely corridors "
"and abandoned tunnels under the trackless mountains. What few foodstuffs had "
"been salvaged from the lava dwindled, then vanished entirely. For the first "
"time Konrad saw signs of fatigue in the old wizard’s normally inscrutable "
"face."
msgstr ""
"科纳德、德法多和他们的军队在茫茫群山下荒僻的走廊与废弃隧道中迷失了方向，游荡"
"了数日。从熔岩中抢救出的少许粮食日渐减少，最终彻底耗尽。有生以来，科纳德第一"
"次在老巫师通常高深莫测的表情里看到了疲惫。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:416
msgid ""
"Finally, weakened and battered by their ordeal, the exhausted rebels emerged "
"into an unknown valley..."
msgstr "终于，饱受磨难、虚弱不堪的反抗军筋疲力尽地来到了一片未知的山谷……"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:428
msgid ""
"Oh, my old bones! Long has it been since I exerted myself so, especially on "
"an empty stomach. We were most fortunate we have at last found our way to "
"the surface."
msgstr ""
"哎呀，我这把老骨头！我许久没有如此耗费气力了，尤其是在空着肚子的时候。我们真"
"是万幸，终于找到了通往地面的路。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:434
msgid ""
"But what matters is that you are alive, Konrad, and that we have escaped the "
"caves and found daylight again. And with both Li’sar and the Sceptre in our "
"hands!"
msgstr ""
"但重要的是你还活着，科纳德，我们逃出了洞穴，重见天日。而且莉莎和权杖都在我们"
"手中！"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:439
msgid ""
"But what matters is that you are alive, Konrad, and that we have escaped the "
"caves and found daylight again. And although Li’sar has escaped us, at least "
"we still have the Sceptre in our hands."
msgstr ""
"但重要的是你还活着，科纳德，我们逃出了洞穴，重见天日。尽管莉莎从我们手中逃脱"
"了，至少我们仍持有权杖。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:446
msgid ""
"But what matters is that you are alive, Konrad, and that we have escaped the "
"caves and found daylight again. And we have the Sceptre as well! Despite our "
"difficulties, our quest has been a success."
msgstr ""
"但重要的是你还活着，科纳德，我们逃出了洞穴，重见天日。而且我们还拿到了权杖！"
"尽管困难重重，我们的任务还是成功了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:452
msgid ""
"But what matters is that you are alive, Konrad, and that we have escaped the "
"caves and found daylight again. If only we had the Sceptre with us... it is "
"surely now buried beyond all hope of reclamation."
msgstr ""
"但重要的是你还活着，科纳德，我们逃出了洞穴，重见天日。要是权杖还在我们身边就"
"好了……它如今肯定已被深埋，再也无望寻回了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:457
msgid "Yes, but look! We are not the only army to have escaped the caves!"
msgstr "是啊，可你看！逃出洞穴的军队可不只有我们！"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:475
msgid ""
"My expeditionary company! Or at least a small fragment of it, with a "
"precious few survivors. And fighting many undead?!"
msgstr ""
"我的远征连队！或者说，至少是它的一小部分残部，只剩寥寥无几的幸存者。而且还在"
"与众多亡灵作战？！"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:480
msgid ""
"That’s a grim look, but even embattled they’re more than a match for your "
"rebels, Konrad, weakened and gold-deprived as you are from your long days "
"underground."
msgstr ""
"这局面确实严峻，但即便身陷重围，他们也足以匹敌你的反抗军，科纳德，你们在地下"
"困了这么多天，早已又虚弱又缺军饷。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar # default portrait, so that if she has her Sceptre it's shown in her portrait
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:485
msgid ""
"Keep moving. Don’t get pinned. I know this looks bad, but there is no choice "
"but to fight! Fight, fight or die!"
msgstr ""
"继续前进。别被缠住。我知道形势不妙，但除了战斗别无选择！战斗，战斗，否则就是"
"死！"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:489
msgid ""
"Even if others have escaped the lava elsewhere, we’ve no chance of finding "
"them unless we can first evade these undead!"
msgstr ""
"就算还有其他人从别处逃出了熔岩，我们也得先避开这些亡灵，否则根本找不到他们！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:503
msgid ""
"I shouldn’t be surprised that some part of your army has survived, princess; "
"you surely trained them well."
msgstr ""
"公主，你的军队还有一部分幸存下来，我本不该感到意外；你肯定把他们训练得很好。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:505
msgid ""
"But from what I can see, they stand both outnumbered and surrounded. If we "
"keep our distance the soldiers may not notice us, and will surely perish at "
"the hands of the zombies!"
msgstr ""
"但依我所见，他们既寡不敌众，又身陷重围。如果我们保持距离，那些士兵也许不会注"
"意到我们，他们肯定会死在僵尸手中！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:509
msgid ""
"On the other hand... you are right that we ourselves are weakened from long "
"days of hunger and travel, and these undead will only become stronger with "
"the addition of the bodies of the royal soldiers — I see many fresh corpses "
"among their numbers already."
msgstr ""
"另一方面……您说得对，我们自己也被多日的饥饿与跋涉拖得虚弱不堪，而这些亡灵一旦"
"增添王室士兵的尸体，只会变得更强——我已经看到他们队伍里有许多刚死不久的尸体"
"了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:513
msgid ""
"I have seen firsthand the dangers of the spawn of Asheviere, Konrad, and I "
"have learned the harm that comes from lending ear to their lies. This may be "
"our only chance to vanquish these soldiers and still keep our prisoner! I "
"think it best that we ensure their defeat first, and only afterwards give "
"thought to our escape."
msgstr ""
"科纳德，我亲眼见识过艾什薇尔的血脉有多危险，也领教过听信他们谎言会带来何等祸"
"害。这也许是我们既能击溃这些士兵、又能保住俘虏的唯一机会！我认为最好先确保击"
"败他们，然后再考虑脱身。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:521
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:604
msgid "Maybe... but no food, no shelter, little gold..."
msgstr "也许吧……但没有食物，没有栖身之处，金币也少得可怜……"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:525
msgid ""
"I have no love for the villains who tried to take my life, but neither am I "
"willing to doom my comrades just to spite them. That is how Asheviere "
"fights; more invested in the death of enemies than the life of friends — or "
"daughters. Did you yourself not tell me <i>“be forgiving, be wise, be kind”</"
"i>?"
msgstr ""
"我对那些曾想取我性命的恶棍毫无好感，但我也绝不愿为了报复他们而害死自己的战"
"友。艾什薇尔就是那样打仗的；她更在意敌人的死亡，而非朋友——或女儿——的性命。难"
"道您自己不曾对我说过<i>“要宽容，要明智，要仁慈”</i>吗？"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:529
msgid ""
"Unless all the living stand together against the dead, I fear things shall "
"end badly for us all — and from her palace safe in Weldyn, Asheviere will "
"laugh."
msgstr ""
"除非所有生者团结一致对抗亡者，否则我怕我们所有人都不会有好下场——而艾什薇尔会"
"安稳地坐在维尔帝的宫殿里大笑。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:533
msgid ""
"No. Li’sar, my cousin and prisoner, I offer you a trade. We shall make "
"ourselves known to your army, and you will command them to ally with us "
"against the undead. In return, once this place is cleansed, they will be "
"free to leave."
msgstr ""
"不。莉莎，我的表姐，也是我的俘虏，我向你提一笔交易。我们会向你的军队表明身"
"份，你则命令他们与我们结盟，共同对抗亡灵。作为回报，等此地被肃清之后，他们可"
"以自由离开。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION defeat}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:537
msgid "Perhaps. And I would be free to leave along with them?"
msgstr "也许吧。那我也能和他们一起自由离开吗？"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:541
msgid ""
"This is not a negotiation. You are my prisoner and at my mercy, and I still "
"mean to ransom you back to your mother in exchange for her abdication."
msgstr ""
"这不是谈判。你是我的俘虏，任我处置；我仍打算把你交还给你母亲，以换取她退位。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:545
msgid ""
"Do not be a fool; neither we nor your soldiers can prevail alone. And if we "
"fall to the undead, you will surely perish with us. Choose: will you command "
"your allies to aid us, or are we all to fight and bleed and die until our "
"bodies cold are buried under crimson snow?"
msgstr ""
"别犯傻；我们和你的士兵都无法独自取胜。如果我们败给亡灵，你也必定会和我们一同"
"丧命。选择吧：你是要命令你的部下支援我们，还是让我们全都战斗、流血、死去，直"
"到冰冷的尸身被埋在猩红之雪下？"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION defeat}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:553
msgid ""
"I’m not excited to join forces with the enemy, but neither do I want to "
"watch my friends and comrades lose a hopeless battle on two fronts. I agree "
"to your deal. I’ll remain prisoner while my soldiers fight as your allies."
msgstr ""
"我并不乐意与敌人联手，但也不愿看着我的朋友和战友在两条战线上输掉一场毫无希望"
"的仗。我同意你的交易。我会继续当俘虏，而我的士兵会作为你们的盟友作战。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION defeat}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:557
msgid ""
"But once these undead are finished, there will be no leaving peacefully. "
"Prisoner or not, this battlefield still has loyalists ready to fight for "
"their queen — and you and I have a score to settle."
msgstr ""
"但等这些亡灵被消灭之后，就别想和平离开了。无论我是不是俘虏，这片战场上仍有忠"
"于女王的将士准备为她而战——而我和你之间也还有一笔账要算。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:571
msgid ""
"So, the princess has survived — and she has the Sceptre of Fire! I shouldn’t "
"be surprised; villains often seem hard to finish off, don’t they?"
msgstr ""
"这么说，公主活下来了——而且还拿到了圣火权杖！我本不该惊讶；恶棍似乎总是很难被"
"彻底干掉，不是吗？"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:573
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:580
msgid ""
"And what’s more, she is fighting a great horde of undead! If we keep our "
"distance she may not notice us, and will surely perish at the hands of the "
"zombies!"
msgstr ""
"而且，她还在和一大群亡灵作战！如果我们保持距离，她也许不会发现我们，那她肯定"
"会死在僵尸手里！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:578
msgid ""
"So, the princess has survived after all. I shouldn’t be surprised; villains "
"often seem hard to finish off, don’t they?"
msgstr ""
"这么说，公主终究还是活下来了。我本不该惊讶；恶棍似乎总是很难被彻底干掉，不是"
"吗？"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:585
msgid ""
"On the other hand... we ourselves are weakened from long days of hunger and "
"travel, and these undead will only become stronger with the addition of the "
"bodies of Li’sar’s men — I see many fresh corpses among their numbers "
"already."
msgstr ""
"另一方面……我们自己也被多日的饥饿与跋涉拖得虚弱不堪，而这些亡灵一旦得到莉莎部"
"下的尸体补充，只会变得更强——我已经看到他们队伍里有许多刚死不久的尸体了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:590
msgid ""
"I have seen firsthand the dangers of the spawn of Asheviere, Konrad, and I "
"have learned the value of swift action against them. Li’sar has already "
"escaped us once! I think it best that we ensure her defeat first, and only "
"afterwards give thought to our escape."
msgstr ""
"我亲眼见识过艾什薇尔的血脉有多危险，科纳德，也懂得了迅速行动对付他们的价值。"
"莉莎已经从我方手中逃脱过一次！我认为最好先确保击败她，之后再考虑我们自己的撤"
"离。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:595
msgid ""
"I have seen firsthand the dangers of the spawn of Asheviere, Konrad, and I "
"have learned the value of swift action against them. This may be our only "
"chance to vanquish Li’sar! I think it best that we ensure her defeat first, "
"and only afterwards give thought to our escape."
msgstr ""
"我亲眼见识过艾什薇尔的血脉有多危险，科纳德，也懂得了迅速行动对付他们的价值。"
"这也许是我们消灭莉莎的唯一机会！我认为最好先确保击败她，之后再考虑我们自己的"
"撤离。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:608
msgid ""
"I have no love for the villain who tried to take my life, but neither am I "
"willing to doom my comrades just to spite her. That is how Asheviere fights; "
"more invested in the death of enemies than the life of friends — or "
"daughters. Did you yourself not tell me <i>“be forgiving, be wise, be kind”</"
"i>?"
msgstr ""
"我对那个曾想取我性命的恶徒毫无好感，但我也绝不愿为了报复她而害死自己的战友。"
"艾什薇尔就是那样打仗的；她更在意敌人的死亡，而非朋友——或女儿——的性命。难道您"
"自己不曾对我说过<i>“要宽容，要明智，要仁慈”</i>吗？"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:612
msgid ""
"Unless all the living stand together against the dead, I fear things shall "
"end badly for us all — and from her palace safe in Weldyn, Asheviere will "
"laugh. No, we should approach Li’sar and offer a brief alliance, at least "
"until these undead are defeated."
msgstr ""
"除非所有生者团结一致对抗亡者，否则我怕我们所有人都不会有好下场——而艾什薇尔会"
"安稳地坐在维尔帝的宫殿里大笑。不，我们应该去接触莉莎，提出短暂结盟，至少直到"
"这些亡灵被击败。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:616
msgid ""
"Although she is our enemy, I believe that she is trustworthy enough to honor "
"her word if she agrees not to harm us. I ask you to trust my judgement on "
"this, my mentor."
msgstr ""
"尽管她是我们的敌人，但我相信她足够守信，如果她同意不伤害我们，就会遵守诺言。"
"我请求您在这件事上相信我的判断，我的导师。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:620
msgid ""
"The last time a king asked me to trust him, things ended rather badly for "
"the both of us. Nevertheless, you are my lord, Konrad, and I know you to be "
"growing wise beyond your years. Let us reach Li’sar and make your offer."
msgstr ""
"上一次一位国王请求我相信他时，结果对我们俩都相当糟糕。尽管如此，你是我的主"
"上，科纳德，我知道你的智慧正超越你的年龄。让我们去接触莉莎，提出你的提议吧。"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:629
msgid "Reach Li’sar’s loyalists before they are slain"
msgstr "在莉莎的保王军被杀害前接触它"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:636
msgid "Then, defeat the primary enemy leader"
msgstr "然后，击败主要的敌方首领"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:644
msgid "Defeat the primary enemy leader"
msgstr "击败主要的敌方首领"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:653
msgid "Defeat Iliah-Malal"
msgstr "击败伊利阿-玛拉尔"

#. [note]
#. because of the low starting gold, companions (who're usually recalled for free) would be overly powerful here
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:677
msgid ""
"Konrad’s forces are exhausted, and have less starting gold than usual. Loyal "
"companions (except Delfador) are not automatically recalled."
msgstr ""
"科纳德的部队已精疲力竭，初始金币比平常更少。忠诚的同伴（德法多除外）不会自动"
"召回。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:694
msgid ""
"These must be the tunnels from whence Li’sar’s soldiers emerged. Out of all "
"the countless exits from the underground, we just so happened to come "
"together here..."
msgstr ""
"这些一定就是莉莎的士兵出现的隧道。地下有无数出口，我们竟偏偏在这里会合了……"

#. [message]: role=leader7
#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:733
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:739
msgid "We’re in dire straits. Deploy the reserves."
msgstr "我们处境危急。投入预备队。"

#. [message]: role=leader7
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:810
msgid ""
"Living soldiers at the perimeter! It’s Konrad and his rebels, intact despite "
"the volcano! And... they’ve taken the princess prisoner?!"
msgstr ""
"外围有活人士兵！是科纳德和他的叛军，他们居然在火山后安然无恙！而且……他们还把"
"公主俘虏了？！"

#. [message]: role=leader7
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:814
msgid ""
"I’d been hoping for reinforcements, for we are already hard-pressed, but if "
"we must fight a second foe to rescue our general I shall not shy away!"
msgstr ""
"我本希望能有援军，因为我们已处境艰难，但如果必须与第二个敌人交战来营救我们的"
"将军，我绝不会退缩！"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION defeat}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:818
msgid ""
"No, captain, that won’t be necessary. I am a prisoner, but we’ve agreed to a "
"temporary truce — emphasis on temporary. Until these undead are defeated, "
"you are to work together with Konrad against the dead."
msgstr ""
"不，队长，没必要。我确实是俘虏，但我们已同意暂时停战——重点在“暂时”。在这些亡"
"灵被击败前，你们要与科纳德合作对抗亡者。"

#. [message]: role=leader7
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:822
msgid ""
"You’re certain? You’re not being coerced? Well, in the dire straits we’re in "
"I can hardly say no to an ally."
msgstr ""
"您确定？您没有受到胁迫？好吧，我们如今处境危急，我实在没法拒绝一个盟友。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:841
msgid ""
"Konrad, should we not be concerned about Li’sar’s threats? Prisoner or no, "
"she has been very clear about her intentions to turn her allies against us "
"once these undead are defeated. And perhaps sooner, if she senses in us some "
"weakness!"
msgstr ""
"科纳德，我们难道不该担心莉莎的威胁吗？不管她是不是俘虏，她已经说得很清楚，一"
"旦这些亡灵被击败，她就会让她的盟友转而对付我们。而如果她察觉到我们有什么弱"
"点，也许还会更早！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:845
msgid ""
"Li’sar is not Eldred. Although she is our enemy, I have come to believe Her "
"Highness cares about her people just as we do, and that she is trustworthy "
"enough to honor her word if she agrees not to harm us. I ask you to trust my "
"judgement on this, my mentor."
msgstr ""
"莉莎不是埃雷德。尽管她是我们的敌人，但我逐渐相信，殿下关心她的人民就像我们一"
"样，而且如果她同意不伤害我们，她足够守信，会遵守诺言。我请求您在这件事上相信"
"我的判断，我的导师。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:849
msgid ""
"The last time a king asked me to trust him, things ended rather badly for "
"the both of us. Nevertheless, you are my lord, Konrad, and I know you to be "
"growing wise beyond your years. Let us set aside my worries and direct our "
"efforts against the undead."
msgstr ""
"上一次一位国王请求我相信他时，结果对我们俩都相当糟糕。尽管如此，你是我的主"
"上，科纳德，我知道你的智慧正超越你的年龄。让我们放下我的担忧，把力量集中对付"
"亡灵吧。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:863
msgid ""
"Living soldiers at the perimeter! ...Konrad, you’re here! And with your army "
"too, intact despite the volcano. I intend to have serious words with the "
"queen if we somehow get out of this alive..."
msgstr ""
"外围有活人士兵！……科纳德，你在这里！而且还带着你的军队，在火山之后也安然无"
"恙。如果我们能活着出去，我打算和女王好好谈谈……"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:867
msgid ""
"I am not here to fight you, Li’sar — at least not right now. You are "
"vulnerable, but so are we, and if we war the only winner will be the undead. "
"I propose a truce."
msgstr ""
"我不是来和你交战的，莉莎——至少现在不是。你很脆弱，我们也一样，如果我们开战，"
"唯一的赢家只会是亡灵。我提议休战。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:871
msgid ""
"A truce? What ploy is this; are you so cruel that you would give my men hope "
"before snuffing it out? If you are come to slay me, fight me to my face!"
msgstr ""
"休战？这是什么诡计；你竟如此残忍，先给我的人希望，再将其掐灭？如果你是来杀我"
"的，就当面和我打！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:875
msgid ""
"There is no trick! Do not be a fool; surely you can see that if we do not "
"stand together, we shall die alone? It is in both of our interests to work "
"together!"
msgstr ""
"没有诡计！别犯傻；你肯定看得出，如果我们不并肩作战，就只能各自孤军而死。合作"
"对我们双方都有利！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:877
msgid ""
"Do you agree to my proposal, Your Highness? Or are we to fight and bleed and "
"die until our bodies both are buried under crimson snow?"
msgstr ""
"殿下，你同意我的提议吗？还是我们要一直战斗、流血、死亡，直到你我的尸体都被埋"
"在猩红的雪下？"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:885
msgid ""
"Very well, we shall work together for now. But do not forget that once these "
"undead are defeated, you and I have a score to settle."
msgstr ""
"很好，我们暂时合作。但别忘了，一旦这些亡灵被击败，你我之间还有一笔账要算。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:913
msgid ""
"My men and I are desperately low on gold and supplies, Li’sar. Now we have "
"met with your allies — do they have anything to spare?"
msgstr ""
"我和我的人极度缺乏金币和补给，莉莎。现在我们已与你的盟友会合——他们有什么能分"
"给我们的吗？"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:918
msgid ""
"My men and I are desperately low on gold and supplies, Li’sar. Now that we "
"are allies, do you have anything to spare?"
msgstr ""
"我和我的人极度缺乏金币和补给，莉莎。既然我们是盟友了，你有什么能分给我们的"
"吗？"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:923
msgid ""
"We are allies only of convenience, cousin, and it is not in my best interest "
"for you or your rebels to be too well-supplied."
msgstr "我们只是权宜之盟，表弟，让你或你的叛军补给太充足，对我没有好处。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:928
msgid ""
"... not that it matters, because I can see that my soldiers have barely "
"enough to outfit themselves as it is. It’s unfortunate that the queen’s "
"orders harmed us as much as they did you, if not more."
msgstr ""
"……不过那也无所谓，因为我看得出，我的士兵连装备自己都勉强。不幸的是，女王的命"
"令害了我们，和害你们一样重，甚至更重。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:933
msgid ""
"... not that it matters, because we have barely enough to outfit ourselves "
"as it is. It’s unfortunate that the queen’s orders harmed us as much as they "
"did you, if not more."
msgstr ""
"……不过那也无所谓，因为我们连装备自己都勉强。不幸的是，女王的命令害了我们，和"
"害你们一样重，甚至更重。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:938
msgid ""
"It’s not “unfortunate” — your mother was more than willing to see you killed."
msgstr "这可不是什么“不幸”——你母亲巴不得看着你被杀。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:942
msgid ""
"Asheviere gave Mirya the orders she thought were necessary to prevent you "
"from escaping. Whether they were wise orders or not is immaterial; she acted "
"to ensure that Wesnoth survives, even if I don’t. I cannot fault her for "
"that."
msgstr ""
"艾什薇尔给米莉娅下了她认为阻止你逃脱所必需的命令。那些命令明智与否并不重要；"
"她这么做是为了确保韦诺存续，哪怕牺牲我。我无法因此责怪她。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:946
msgid ""
"She acted to ensure her power remains unchallenged, you mean. The dark queen "
"cares only for herself."
msgstr "你是说，她这么做是为了确保她的权力不受挑战。黑暗女王只在乎她自己。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:951
msgid ""
"“<i>The dark queen</i>,” pfft. I’ve heard enough slander; hold your tongue "
"or I shall have my men make an end to our truce and short work of you."
msgstr ""
"“<b>黑暗女王</b>”，呸。我已经听够了诽谤；闭上你的嘴，否则我就让我的人终止休"
"战，迅速解决你。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:956
msgid ""
"“<i>The dark queen</i>,” pfft. I’ve heard enough slander; hold your tongue "
"or I shall make an end to our truce and short work of you."
msgstr ""
"“<b>黑暗女王</b>”，呸。我已经听够了诽谤；闭上你的嘴，否则我就终止休战，迅速解"
"决你。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:998
msgid "Don’t wander around my keep, Konrad. We have a battle to fight."
msgstr "别在我的城堡里乱逛，科纳德。我们还有仗要打。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1013
msgid ""
"You have no tricks this time, Malal? Your magic is as weak as was your flesh!"
msgstr "这次你没有诡计了，玛拉尔？你的魔法就和你的血肉一样脆弱！"

#. [message]: speaker=Iliah-Malal
#. the same thing he says when fighting Delfador in The Deceiver's Gambait
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1018
msgid "Shadows consume you!"
msgstr "暗影吞噬你！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1027
msgid "Delfador killed you once! Now it’s my turn!"
msgstr "德法多杀过你一次！现在轮到我了！"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1036
msgid "Time to put you and your lies back in the ground!"
msgstr "该把你和你的谎言一起打回地下了！"

#. [message]: speaker=Iliah-Malal
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1054
msgid "Eye of elf and bone of beast..."
msgstr "精灵之眼与野兽之骨……"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1059
msgid ""
"A lich! So here is the source of the undead. Something about this magic "
"feels familiar... very familiar..."
msgstr "一个巫妖！所以亡灵之源就在这里。这魔法有种熟悉的感觉……非常熟悉……"

#. [message]: speaker=Iliah-Malal
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1064
msgid ""
"Hello, Delfador! Do you remember me? You’ve grown old. Perhaps you regret "
"passing up the temptations of necromancy, so long ago?"
msgstr ""
"你好啊，德法多！还记得我吗？你老了。也许你后悔当初拒绝了死灵法术的诱惑？"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1068
msgid ""
"Iliah-Malal! A name most foul, and one that I have not spoken aloud since "
"our duel so many years ago. You’ll recall that I won. You should be dead and "
"gone."
msgstr ""
"伊利阿-玛拉尔！一个极其可憎的名字，自从多年前我们决斗以来，我就再没大声说出"
"过。你应该记得，是我赢了。你本该早已死去，彻底消失。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1070
msgid "Iliah-Malal"
msgstr "伊利阿-玛拉尔"

#. [message]: speaker=Iliah-Malal
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1073
msgid ""
"Dead, yes, but not quite gone. You have the good queen to thank for my "
"return. And I have you to thank for finding the Sceptre of Fire! Soon it "
"will be mine."
msgstr ""
"死了，没错，但还没完全消失。我的归来，你可得感谢那位好女王。而找到圣火权杖，"
"我得感谢你！很快它就是我的了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1078
msgid ""
"I know my own mother, lich, and she would never be complicit in the "
"resurrection of an abomination like yourself."
msgstr "我了解我自己的母亲，巫妖，她绝不会参与复活像你这样的怪物。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1140
msgid ""
"You can’t deny, Li’sar, that th’ queen o’ yours was ready to massacre us "
"smallfolk in Delwyn an’ Dallben jus’ because we refused to swear fealty. An’ "
"she would’ve succeeded too, if we hadn’t fought back an’ fled an’ hid!"
msgstr ""
"你没法否认，莉莎，你们那位女王就因为咱们这些平头百姓不肯宣誓效忠，就要在德尔"
"文和达尔本把咱们全杀了。要不是咱们反抗、逃跑、藏起来，她还真能得逞！"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1141
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1148
msgid ""
"—no, that can’t be right. I was told that region had always been home to "
"rebels, and that after the destruction of Halstead Mother was regrettably "
"forced to raze the villages."
msgstr ""
"——不，那不可能。我听说那个地区一向是叛军的巢穴，而且在哈尔斯特德被毁后，母亲"
"才遗憾地被迫焚毁那些村庄。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1147
msgid ""
"You cannot deny, cousin, that Asheviere was ready to massacre the smallfolk "
"in Delwyn and Dallben just because they refused to swear fealty. They told "
"me the story: had they not fought back and fled and hid, they would all be "
"dead now."
msgstr ""
"你无法否认，表姐，艾什薇尔仅仅因为德尔文和达尔本的小民拒绝宣誓效忠，就准备屠"
"杀他们。他们给我讲了经过：要不是他们反抗、逃跑并躲藏起来，现在早就全死了。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1155
msgid ""
"You cannot deny, cousin, that Asheviere passed control of Elensefar to the "
"orcish hordes when she found she could not bend the populace to her will. I "
"was there — it is only by my sword that the entire city was not enslaved!"
msgstr ""
"你无法否认，表姐，艾什薇尔在发现无法让民众屈服于她的意志后，就把埃仁撒伐的控"
"制权交给了兽人群。我当时在场——全靠我的剑，整座城市才没有沦为奴隶！"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1156
msgid ""
"—no, that can’t be right. I was told that the city was under the control of "
"royal forces; the orcs were only supposed to aid in the attack."
msgstr "——不，那不可能。我听说那座城市由王室军队控制；兽人只是奉命协助进攻。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1157
msgid ""
"Or what of how Asheviere gave control of Elensefar to the orcish hordes when "
"she found she could not bend the populace to her will? Without my "
"intervention the entire city would have been enslaved!"
msgstr ""
"再说，艾什薇尔发现无法让民众屈服于她的意志后，就把埃仁撒伐的控制权交给兽人"
"群，这又怎么说？若不是我介入，整座城市早就沦为奴隶了！"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1162
msgid ""
"You cannot deny, cousin, that Asheviere allowed a necromancer to run amuck "
"on the Peninsula of Pearls, to weaken and create chaos in the west. I was "
"there — it is only by my sword that Muff Malal was killed!"
msgstr ""
"你无法否认，表姐，艾什薇尔任由一个死灵法师在珍珠半岛横行，削弱西方并制造混"
"乱。我当时在场——全靠我的剑，玛夫·玛拉尔才被杀死！"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1163
msgid ""
"—no, that can’t be right. I was told that you rebels were the ones who "
"invited the necromancer in, and that royal forces were beaten back when they "
"came to render aid."
msgstr ""
"——不，那不可能。我听说正是你们这些叛军把死灵法师引了进来，而王军前来援助时却"
"被击退了。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1164
msgid ""
"Or what of how Asheviere allowed a necromancer to run amuck on the Peninsula "
"of Pearls, to weaken and create chaos in the west? Without my intervention "
"the entire coast might have been overrun!"
msgstr ""
"又或者，艾什薇尔任由一个死灵法师在珍珠半岛横行，削弱西方并制造混乱，这又怎么"
"说？若不是我介入，整条海岸线都可能被蹂躏！"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1169
msgid ""
"You cannot deny, cousin, that Asheviere allowed her orcs to overrun the Bay "
"of Pearls, to enslave the peaceful merfolk and force them to dive for her "
"enrichment. I was there — it is only by my sword that they were freed!"
msgstr ""
"你无法否认，表姐，艾什薇尔任由她的兽人蹂躏珍珠湾，奴役和平的人鱼，强迫他们潜"
"水为她敛财。我当时在场——全靠我的剑，他们才获得自由！"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1170
msgid ""
"—no, that can’t be right. I was told the orcs were protecting the merfolk "
"against the rebels, not holding them as slaves."
msgstr ""
"——不，那不可能。我听说兽人是在保护人鱼免受叛军侵害，而不是把他们当奴隶。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1171
msgid ""
"Or what of how Asheviere allowed her orcs to overrun the Bay of Pearls, to "
"enslave the peaceful merfolk and force them to dive for her enrichment? "
"Without my intervention they might never have been freed!"
msgstr ""
"又或者，艾什薇尔任由她的兽人蹂躏珍珠湾，奴役和平的人鱼，强迫他们潜水为她敛"
"财，这又怎么说？若不是我介入，他们可能永远都得不到自由！"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1177
msgid ""
"Li’sar, what about how yer gnashgabbin’ Asheviere locked me up jus’ fer a "
"couple o’ insults — an’ high-quality ones too, proper fit fer a queen! Ye "
"even helped keep me an’ my boys from escapin’!"
msgstr ""
"莉莎，你们那个碎嘴子的艾什薇尔就因为我骂了她几句，就把俺关起来——而且还是骂得"
"特别精彩、配得上女王的那几句！你还帮着拦住俺和俺的弟兄们，不让俺们逃出去！"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1178
msgid ""
"—no, that can’t be right. I was told you dwarves were sentenced for sedition "
"and murder, not mere vulgarity."
msgstr ""
"——不，那不可能。我听说你们矮人是因为煽动叛乱和谋杀被判刑，而不只是粗俗言论。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1179
msgid ""
"Ach, an’ what about how yer gnashgabbin’ Asheviere locked me up jus’ fer a "
"couple o’ insults — an’ high-quality ones too, proper fit fer a queen! Ye "
"even helped keep me an’ my boys from escapin’!"
msgstr ""
"唉，还有，你们那个碎嘴子的艾什薇尔就因为我骂了她几句，就把俺关起来——而且还是"
"骂得特别精彩、配得上女王的那几句！你还帮着拦住俺和俺的弟兄们，不让俺们逃出"
"去！"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1184
msgid ""
"You cannot deny, cousin, that Asheviere locked up Ulfdain and his miners for "
"no crime but daring to criticise her! You even tried to stop me from freeing "
"them!"
msgstr ""
"你无法否认，表姐，艾什薇尔关押乌尔夫戴恩和他的矿工，唯一的“罪行”就是胆敢批评"
"她！你甚至还想阻止我释放他们！"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1185
msgid ""
"—no, that can’t be right. I was told those dwarves were sentenced for "
"sedition and murder, not mere vulgarity."
msgstr ""
"——不，那不可能。我听说那些矮人是因为煽动叛乱和谋杀被判刑，而不只是粗俗言论。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1186
msgid ""
"Or what of how Asheviere locked up Ulfdain and his miners for no crime but "
"daring to criticise her! You even tried to stop me from intervening to free "
"them!"
msgstr ""
"再说，艾什薇尔关押乌尔夫戴恩和他的矿工，唯一的“罪行”就是胆敢批评她，这又怎么"
"说！你甚至还想阻止我介入释放他们！"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1193
msgid ""
"You can scarcely deny, Li’sar, that after my peoples’ defeat at the "
"Aethenwood, Asheviere sent her armies to take our fleeing civilians as "
"slaves. It is only thanks to Konrad they escaped!"
msgstr ""
"你几乎无法否认，莉莎，在艾森丛林一役我族战败后，艾什薇尔派军把我们逃亡的平民"
"掳为奴隶。全靠科纳德，他们才得以逃脱！"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1194
msgid ""
"—no, that can’t be right. Your Aethenwood elves are dangerous, hardly "
"civilians, but you were all to be afforded a fair trial and a just verdict, "
"not taken as slaves."
msgstr ""
"——不，那不可能。你们艾森丛林的精灵很危险，根本算不上平民，但你们所有人都应得"
"到公正审判和正义裁决，而不是被掳为奴隶。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1195
msgid ""
"Or what of how after the elves’ defeat at the Aethenwood, Asheviere sent her "
"armies to take our fleeing civilians as slaves? Without Konrad’s "
"intervention they would be in chains in the mines!"
msgstr ""
"又或者，精灵在艾森丛林战败后，艾什薇尔派军把我们逃亡的平民掳为奴隶，这又怎么"
"说？若不是科纳德介入，他们早就戴着镣铐下矿了！"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1200
msgid ""
"You cannot deny, cousin, that after the elves’ defeat at the Aethenwood, "
"Asheviere sent her armies to take the fleeing civilians as slaves. I was "
"there — it is only by my sword that they escaped!"
msgstr ""
"你无法否认，表姐，精灵在艾森丛林战败后，艾什薇尔派军把逃亡的平民掳为奴隶。我"
"当时在场——全靠我的剑，他们才得以逃脱！"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1201
msgid ""
"—no, that can’t be right. The Aethenwood elves are dangerous, hardly "
"civilians, but they were to be afforded a fair trial and a just verdict, not "
"taken as slaves."
msgstr ""
"——不，那不可能。艾森丛林的精灵很危险，根本算不上平民，但他们应得到公正审判和"
"正义裁决，而不是被掳为奴隶。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1202
msgid ""
"Or what of how after the elves’ defeat at the Aethenwood, Asheviere sent her "
"armies to take the fleeing civilians as slaves? Without my intervention they "
"would be in chains in the mines!"
msgstr ""
"又或者，精灵在艾森丛林战败后，艾什薇尔派军把逃亡的平民掳为奴隶，这又怎么说？"
"若不是我介入，他们早就戴着镣铐下矿了！"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1209
msgid ""
"You cannot deny, cousin, that Asheviere sent her dwarvish lackies to slay "
"Wesnoth’s wild gryphons and steal their eggs! I was there — it is only by my "
"sword that Gryphon Mountain was not entirely ruined!"
msgstr ""
"你无法否认，表姐，艾什薇尔派她的矮人走狗去屠杀韦诺的野生狮鹫并偷走它们的蛋！"
"我当时在场——全靠我的剑，狮鹫山才没有彻底被毁！"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1210
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1216
msgid ""
"—no, that can’t be right. I was told we’d decided against the egg "
"expedition, because of the intelligence of gryphons and the risks to their "
"population."
msgstr ""
"——不，那不可能。我听说我们已经决定不进行偷蛋远征，因为狮鹫具有智慧，而且那样"
"会危及它们的种群。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1211
msgid ""
"Or what of how Asheviere sent her dwarvish lackies to slay Wesnoth’s wild "
"gryphons and steal their eggs? Without my intervention Gryphon Mountain "
"might have been entirely ruined!"
msgstr ""
"又或者，艾什薇尔派她的矮人走狗去屠杀韦诺的野生狮鹫并偷走它们的蛋，这又怎么"
"说？若不是我介入，狮鹫山可能已被彻底毁掉！"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1215
msgid ""
"You cannot deny, cousin, that Asheviere sent her dwarvish lackies to slay "
"Wesnoth’s wild gryphons and steal their eggs! I may have benefitted from the "
"act, but that does not change Asheviere’s decision to do it."
msgstr ""
"你无法否认，表姐，艾什薇尔派她的矮人走狗去屠杀韦诺的野生狮鹫并偷走它们的蛋！"
"我也许从中得到了好处，但这改变不了艾什薇尔决定这么做的事实。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1217
msgid ""
"Or what of how Asheviere sent her dwarvish lackies to slay Wesnoth’s wild "
"gryphons and steal their eggs? I may have benefitted from the act, but that "
"does not change Asheviere’s decision to do it."
msgstr ""
"又或者，艾什薇尔派她的矮人走狗去屠杀韦诺的野生狮鹫并偷走它们的蛋，这又怎么"
"说？我也许从中得到了好处，但这改变不了艾什薇尔决定这么做的事实。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1224
msgid ""
"You can scarcely deny, Li’sar, that the dark queen deliberately withheld aid "
"from my home, leaving many of our number to die at the hands of undead. It "
"is only thanks to Konrad that our seal was restored and calamity averted!"
msgstr ""
"你几乎无法否认，莉莎，黑暗女王故意不援助我的家园，任由我们许多人死于亡灵之"
"手。全靠科纳德，我们的封印才得以恢复，灾难才得以避免！"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1225
msgid ""
"—no, that can’t be right. You and your order are doing important work; it "
"should be the crown’s responsibility to keep you provisioned."
msgstr ""
"——不，那不可能。你和你的教团在做重要的工作；王室本应负责为你们提供补给。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1226
msgid ""
"Lo! Or what of how Asheviere deliberately withheld aid from my home, leaving "
"many of our number to die at the hands of undead? Without Konrad’s "
"intervention our seal would never have been restored!"
msgstr ""
"看哪！又或者，艾什薇尔故意不援助我的家园，任由我们许多人死于亡灵之手，这又怎"
"么说？若不是科纳德介入，我们的封印永远不会恢复！"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1231
msgid ""
"You cannot deny, cousin, that Asheviere deliberately withheld aid from the "
"Gryphon Mountain monastery, leaving many of their number to die at the hands "
"of undead. It is only by my sword that their seal was restored and calamity "
"averted!"
msgstr ""
"你无法否认，表姐，艾什薇尔故意不援助狮鹫山修道院，任由他们许多人死于亡灵之"
"手。全靠我的剑，他们的封印才得以恢复，灾难才得以避免！"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1232
msgid ""
"—no, that can’t be right. The monastic mages are doing important work; it "
"should be the crown’s responsibility to keep them provisioned."
msgstr ""
"——不，那不可能。修道院的法师们在做重要的工作；王室本应负责为他们提供补给。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1233
msgid ""
"Or what of how Asheviere deliberately withheld aid from the Gryphon Mountain "
"monastery, leaving many of their number to die at the hands of undead? "
"Without my intervention their seal would never have been restored!"
msgstr ""
"又或者，艾什薇尔故意不援助狮鹫山修道院，任由他们许多人死于亡灵之手，这又怎么"
"说？若不是我介入，他们的封印永远不会恢复！"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1240
msgid ""
"You can scarcely deny, Li’sar, that Asheviere’s quarrel with the Aethenwood "
"was more than just a quest to capture Konrad and Delfador. Asheviere has a "
"lust for control, and anyone who resists must be destroyed."
msgstr ""
"你几乎无法否认，莉莎，艾什薇尔对艾森丛林发难，绝不仅仅是为了抓捕科纳德和德法"
"多。艾什薇尔贪恋权柄，凡敢反抗者，必遭毁灭。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1242
msgid ""
"Or what of Asheviere’s attack on the Aethenwood? This was more than just a "
"quest to capture Konrad and Delfador. Asheviere has a lust for control, and "
"anyone who resists must be destroyed."
msgstr ""
"那艾什薇尔对艾森丛林的进攻又怎么说？绝不仅仅是为了抓捕科纳德和德法多。艾什薇"
"尔贪恋权柄，凡敢反抗者，必遭毁灭。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1247
msgid ""
"You cannot deny, cousin, that Asheviere’s quarrel with the Aethenwood was "
"more than just a quest to capture me and Delfador. Asheviere has a lust for "
"control, and anyone who resists must be destroyed."
msgstr ""
"你无法否认，表姐，艾什薇尔对艾森丛林发难，绝不只是为了抓我和德法多。艾什薇尔"
"贪恋权柄，凡敢反抗者，必遭毁灭。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1249
msgid ""
"Or what of Asheviere’s attack on the Aethenwood? This was more than just a "
"quest to capture me and Delfador. Asheviere has a lust for control, and "
"anyone who resists must be destroyed."
msgstr ""
"那艾什薇尔对艾森丛林的进攻又怎么说？这可不只是为了抓我和德法多。艾什薇尔贪恋"
"权柄，凡敢反抗者，必遭毁灭。"

#. [message]: speaker=Iliah-Malal
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1279
msgid "I feel... nothing."
msgstr "我……什么也感觉不到。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1308
msgid ""
"The lich is defeated, Li’sar, and our agreed-upon truce comes to an end. If "
"your soldiers and I are to battle, know that even weakened from the caves "
"they shall still find me a formidable foe."
msgstr ""
"巫妖已被击败，莉莎，我们约定的休战也到此为止。若你的士兵要与我兵戎相见，那就"
"记住：即便因洞穴中的磨难而虚弱，他们仍会发现我是个不容小觑的劲敌。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1313
msgid ""
"The lich is defeated, Li’sar, and our agreed-upon truce comes to an end. If "
"we are to battle, know that even weakened from the caves you shall still "
"find me a formidable foe."
msgstr ""
"巫妖已被击败，莉莎，我们约定的休战也到此为止。若我们终须一战，那就记住：即便"
"因洞穴中的磨难而虚弱，你仍会发现我是个不容小觑的劲敌。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1318
msgid ""
"But you heard my truths about Asheviere — and Malal’s. The dark queen has "
"already harmed countless lives, and will bring all that we love to ruin if "
"we do not stop her. If you are willing, I would welcome your aid in my fight "
"to make Wesnoth a better place."
msgstr ""
"但你已听了我所说的关于艾什薇尔的真相——以及玛拉尔所说的真相。黑暗女王已经残害"
"了无数生灵，若不阻止她，她将毁掉我们所珍爱的一切。若你愿意，我欢迎你助我一臂"
"之力，为让韦诺变得更好而战。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1322
msgid ""
"My mother has her flaws, but the crimes of which you’ve accused her... I "
"spent my entire childhood listening to my mother give orders and commanding "
"armies around. I’d always given her the benefit of the doubt."
msgstr ""
"我母亲自有她的缺点，但你指控她的那些罪行……我的整个童年里，听到的都是母后在发"
"布命令，指挥军队。我一直都尽量不怀疑她。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1326
msgid ""
"But I cannot deny there have been signs. I became my mother’s most trusted "
"aide-de-camp. I was sent to quiet the worst of the various rebellions. Of "
"course they fought back. I was never told who most of these people were or "
"why they fought my mother. Now the volcano, and now this lich..."
msgstr ""
"但我不能否认，确实早有征兆。我成为了母后最信任的副官，被派去剿灭最棘手的反叛"
"者。当然，他们反击了。我从不知道他们是谁，也不知道他们为什么对抗母后。先是火"
"山，如今又是这个巫妖……"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1339
msgid ""
"Free me from these chains and I will join you, even if it means opposing my "
"own flesh. Perhaps together we can save our country in a way that neither of "
"us could alone."
msgstr ""
"解开我身上的这些镣铐，我便加入你，哪怕这意味着与我的血亲为敌。也许我们联手，"
"才能以任何一人单独做不到的方式拯救我们的国家。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1345
msgid ""
"I will join you, even if it means opposing my own flesh. Perhaps together we "
"can save our country in a way that neither of us could alone."
msgstr ""
"我会加入你，哪怕这意味着与我的血亲为敌。也许我们联手，才能以任何一人单独做不"
"到的方式拯救我们的国家。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1374
msgid ""
"We’ve come this far together. There is no reason for me to execute an "
"unarmed woman, enemy though she may be!"
msgstr ""
"我们已一同走到这一步。纵然她是敌人，我也没有理由处决一个手无寸铁的女子！"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION defeat}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1393
msgid ""
"I can’t believe it. Bested so far from home.... and in part by the actions "
"of my own mother. Embarrassing..."
msgstr ""
"我真不敢相信。竟在离家如此遥远的地方落败……而且还部分拜我自己母亲的所作所为所"
"赐。真丢人……"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1398
msgid ""
"We are beaten! Bested so far from home.... and in part by the actions of the "
"queen..."
msgstr "我们败了！竟在离家如此遥远的地方落败……而且还部分拜女王的所作所为所赐……"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1409
msgid ""
"Li’sar’s soldiers have fallen, and their camps have become infested with "
"undead! I would rejoice, if we were not surely about to follow them into "
"undeath..."
msgstr ""
"莉莎的士兵已经倒下，他们的营地已被亡灵侵占！要不是我们肯定也要跟着他们变成亡"
"灵，我都要欢呼了……"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1446
msgid ""
"Ugh... I am faint with hunger and exhausted from our long days underground. "
"We must finish these undead before we become too weak to fight!"
msgstr ""
"呃……我饿得头昏眼花，又因连日在地下奔波而精疲力竭。我们必须在虚弱到无法战斗之"
"前解决掉这些亡灵！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1453
msgid ""
"My heart... my head... our long ordeal has taken a toll on us all. I can "
"barely stand, much less fight, and the army is no better. Even if Li’sar is "
"still able to vanquish these undead without our aid, she will surely do the "
"same to us now that we have become so frail!"
msgstr ""
"我的心……我的头……这场漫长的磨难已让我们所有人元气大伤。我几乎站都站不稳，更别"
"说战斗了，军队也好不到哪去。就算莉莎仍能在没有我们相助的情况下消灭这些亡灵，"
"如今我们已如此虚弱，她肯定也会照样收拾我们！"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:10
msgid "scenario name^Snow Plains"
msgstr "覆雪平原"

# Translated by openai with model deepseek-flash.
#. [side]: type=Orcish Warlord, id=leader2
#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:43
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:59
#, fuzzy
msgid "Clan Fell-Hand"
msgstr "凶掌氏族"

#. [message]: speaker=Mirya
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:216
msgid ""
"Your Highness, the Princess of Wesnoth! Can that be you, off in the "
"distance?! ...I’d be elated to see you, if you weren’t so clearly marching "
"in rapport with the traitor prince. This is a surprise."
msgstr ""
"殿下，韦诺的公主！远处的那位真的是您吗？！……要不是您显然正与那个叛徒王子一道"
"行动，见到您我本会欣喜若狂。这可真让人意外。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:220
msgid ""
"Konrad’s not the one who tried to kill his own allies in a flood of lava, "
"Mirya. Yet here I stand alive and free, while you are locked behind bars."
msgstr ""
"科纳德可不是试图用熔岩洪流杀死自己盟友的人，米莉娅。可如今我活生生、自由自在"
"地站在这里，而你却被锁在铁栏之后。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:224
msgid ""
"For over a decade now, you’ve served as my mother’s fastest scout and most "
"reliable courier. You’ve seen every major event in the kingdom firsthand; "
"people and battles I’ve only read about in sanitized reports."
msgstr ""
"十多年来，你一直是我母亲手下最快的斥候和最可靠的信使。王国中每一件大事你都亲"
"眼见过；那些人和战役，我只在粉饰过的报告里读到过。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:228
msgid ""
"Tell me, when did we stop trying to make Wesnoth a better place; a stronger "
"place? Or was it always this way and I was just too blind to see?"
msgstr ""
"告诉我，我们是什么时候不再努力让韦诺变得更好、更强了？还是它一直如此，只是我"
"瞎了眼没看见？"

#. [message]: speaker=Mirya
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:236
msgid ""
"Urag-Tifer, you must set me free at once. These soldiers before you are "
"rebels and traitors, orc-haters out for your head. Set me free and I will "
"help you fight."
msgstr ""
"乌拉戈-提法，你必须立刻放了我。你面前这些士兵是叛军和叛徒，是想要你脑袋的仇兽"
"人者。放了我，我就帮你作战。"

#. [message]: speaker=leader2
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:240
msgid ""
"Set you free so you can magic yourself away without us getting our ransom? "
"Fat chance. Just ’cause I’m an orc doesn’t mean I’m stupid."
msgstr ""
"放了你，好让你用魔法溜走，我们连赎金都拿不到？想得美。我是兽人，可不代表我"
"傻。"

#. [message]: speaker=leader2
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:244
msgid ""
"We’ll handle these soldiers the orcish way. C’mon, boys, grab your swords! "
"We’ve got a battle to win!"
msgstr ""
"咱们会用兽人的方式收拾这些士兵。来吧，小子们，抄起你们的剑！咱们得打赢这一"
"仗！"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:276
msgid "Defeat Urag-Tifer"
msgstr "击败乌拉戈-提法"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:304
msgid ""
"There’s the mage, but there won’t be time to deal with her until we first "
"defeat these orcs!"
msgstr "那个法师就在那儿，但得先打败这些兽人，才有时间对付她！"

#. [message]: speaker=leader2
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:338
msgid "Gah, ah..."
msgstr "呃啊，啊……"

#. [message]: speaker=leader2
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:345
msgid "Hands off!! Not another swing at me, or the mage gets it!"
msgstr "都别动！！再敢朝我挥一下武器，这法师就没命了！"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:353
msgid ""
"Okay, go ahead. We’re fighting to stop Mirya from returning to my mother, "
"not to rescue her or to keep her as prisoner."
msgstr ""
"好吧，动手吧。我们打仗是为了阻止米莉娅回到我母亲那里，不是为了救她，也不是为"
"了把她当俘虏关着。"

#. [message]: speaker=leader2
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:361
msgid "<b><i>That’s</i></b> all you want?!"
msgstr "你们要的<b><i>就这</i></b>？！"

#. [message]: speaker=Mirya
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:365
msgid "Wait—"
msgstr "等等——"

#. [message]: speaker=leader2
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:370
msgid "There, she’s dead. Better I lose a ransom than my life."
msgstr "好了，她死了。丢一笔赎金总比丢命强。"

#. [message]: speaker=leader2
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:374
msgid ""
"Now get out of here. You pinkskins and your politics have caused me enough "
"trouble already..."
msgstr "现在滚吧。你们这些粉皮，还有你们那套政治，已经给我惹够麻烦了……"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:390
msgid ""
"Mirya isn’t the type to leave her fate to chance, Konrad. While we’re busy "
"fighting, she’s certainly planning some kind of escape."
msgstr ""
"米莉娅不是那种会听天由命的人，科纳德。我们忙着打仗的时候，她肯定在谋划某种脱"
"身之计。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:394
msgid ""
"If we take too long to defeat these orcs and capture her, she may slip away "
"from us and back to Asheviere."
msgstr ""
"如果我们花太久才打败这些兽人并抓住她，她可能会从我们手中溜走，回到艾什薇尔身"
"边。"

#. [message]: speaker=Mirya
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:401
msgid ""
"Finally, I’ve burned an opening in these bars. And that oaf of an orc has "
"been too preoccupied with Li’sar to notice! Time to slip away..."
msgstr ""
"终于，我在这些栏杆上烧出了一个缺口。那个蠢货兽人一直忙着应付莉莎，压根没注意"
"到！是时候溜走了……"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:13
msgid "scenario name^A Crisis of Leadership"
msgstr "领导危机"

#. [side]: type={TYPE}, id={ID}
#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:44
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:68
msgid "Clan Whitefang"
msgstr "白牙氏族"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:50
msgid "Chief Khargol"
msgstr "酋长卡戈尔"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:51
msgid "Ga-har"
msgstr "加-哈尔"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:52
msgid "Aharb"
msgstr "阿哈布"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:53
msgid "Arshag"
msgstr "阿沙格"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:54
msgid "Rizgab"
msgstr "里兹加布"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:57
msgid "Muk-har"
msgstr "穆克-哈"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:153
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:164
msgid "25 gold"
msgstr "25金币"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:154
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:155
msgid "50 gold"
msgstr "50金币"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:156
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:158
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:160
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:210
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:211
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:212
msgid "100 gold"
msgstr "100金币"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:157
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:159
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:161
msgid "200 gold"
msgstr "200金币"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:324
msgid ""
"I have the scheming orc locked up, Konrad. My soldiers and I will guard the "
"camp to make sure he doesn’t escape until you safely return."
msgstr ""
"我把那个满肚子诡计的兽人关起来了，科纳德。我和我的士兵会守住营地，确保他在你"
"平安归来之前逃不掉。"

#. [message]: speaker=faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:330
msgid ""
"Yeah yeah, nice cage. Now, prince — recruit three of your best fighters, and "
"my followers’ wagons will sneak you four into the camp."
msgstr ""
"行啦行啦，笼子不错。现在，王子——征募三个你最能打的部下，我手下的马车会把你们"
"四个偷偷送进营地。"

#. [message]: speaker=faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:336
msgid ""
"You haven’t seen our camp before, but as long as you stay hidden in my "
"wagons you should be able to freely explore. Once you find the chief, kill "
"him!"
msgstr ""
"你以前没见过我们的营地，但只要藏在我的马车里，就能自由探索。找到酋长后，杀了"
"他！"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:344
msgid "Recruit three units to help Konrad infiltrate the orcish camp"
msgstr "征募三个单位，协助科纳德潜入兽人营地"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:351
msgid "Find and defeat the Orcish Sovereign"
msgstr "找到并击败兽人君主"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:362
msgid ""
"Konrad can only recruit or recall during this scenario’s first turn. Next "
"turn, Fagh-mok will sneak all your units into the center of the orcish camp."
msgstr ""
"科纳德只能在本场景第一回合征募或召回单位。下一回合，法格-莫克会把你们所有单位"
"偷偷送进兽人营地中央。"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:368
msgid ""
"Konrad’s soldiers are disguised. They will be permanently revealed after any "
"soldier moves adjacent to an enemy."
msgstr ""
"科纳德的士兵已伪装。任何士兵移动到与一名敌人相邻的位置，他们就会永久暴露。"

#. [message]: speaker=faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:396
msgid ""
"Just you? You’re going alone? ...fine, pick a wagon, get in, and hide under "
"the hay. My goblins will sneak you inside."
msgstr ""
"就你一个？你要一个人去？……好吧，挑辆马车，钻进去，藏在干草下面。我的地精会把"
"你偷偷送进去。"

#. [message]: speaker=faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:405
msgid ""
"Ready? Pick a wagon, get in, and hide under the hay. Harness your animals to "
"the front. My goblins will sneak you all inside."
msgstr ""
"准备好了？挑辆马车，钻进去，藏在干草下面。把你们的动物套在车前。我的地精会把"
"你们全都偷偷送进去。"

#. [message]: speaker=faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:415
msgid ""
"Ready? Pick a wagon, get in, and hide under the hay. Yes, even that big rock "
"thing. My goblins will sneak you all inside."
msgstr ""
"准备好了？挑辆马车，钻进去，藏在干草下面。对，就连那个大石头疙瘩也一样。我的"
"地精会把你们全都偷偷送进去。"

#. [message]: speaker=faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:425
msgid ""
"Ready? Pick a wagon, get in, and hide under the hay. Err... maybe we can "
"find something less flammable than hay to cover up that fire thing."
msgstr ""
"准备好了？挑辆马车，钻进去，藏在干草下面。呃……也许我们该找点比干草更不容易烧"
"着的东西，把那个玩火的家伙盖起来。"

#. [message]: speaker=faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:434
msgid ""
"Ready? Pick a wagon, get in, and hide under the hay. My goblins will sneak "
"you all inside."
msgstr ""
"准备好了？挑辆马车，钻进去，藏在干草下面。我的地精会把你们全都偷偷送进去。"

#. [message]: speaker=leader6
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:512
msgid "Wagons at the gate!"
msgstr "大门口来马车了！"

#. [message]: role=gate_speaker
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:517
msgid ""
"That you, Razgob? Glad to see you’re bringing pillage with you this time."
msgstr "是你吗，拉兹戈布？很高兴看到你这次带战利品回来了。"

#. [message]: role=gate_speaker
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:522
msgid ""
"That you, Razgob? Big load of pillage you’ve brought with you this time."
msgstr "是你吗，拉兹戈布？这次你可带回了一大车战利品啊。"

#. [message]: role=wagon1
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:527
msgid "Wagon Driver"
msgstr "车夫"

#. [message]: role=wagon1
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:529
msgid "(shaking) *squeak*"
msgstr "（颤抖着）*吱吱*"

#. [message]: speaker=leader6
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:533
msgid ""
"Stupid runtling, quit trembling! What’re you so afraid of? Go on through and "
"get everything to the stockpiles."
msgstr "蠢货小崽子，别抖了！你怕什么？滚进去，把东西都送到仓库去。"

#. [hides]: id=disguised
#. ability given to a wagon
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:563
msgid "disguised"
msgstr "伪装"

#. [hides]: id=disguised
#. ability given to a wagon
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:565
msgid "This unit’s mundane exterior conceals assassins within."
msgstr "这支部队毫不起眼的外表下暗藏着刺客。"

#. [message]: speaker=$spotter_id
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:618
msgid ""
"Hey, I think there’s someone hiding inside this wagon! Let’s chase away the "
"driver and break it apart!"
msgstr "嘿，我觉得这辆马车里藏着人！咱们把车夫赶走，把车拆开！"

#. [message]: speaker=leader6
#. this is the same orc who let Konrad's soldiers in
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:634
msgid "It’s a spy! Which one of you grunts let that worm into our camp?!"
msgstr "是间谍！你们这群饭桶是谁把那条虫子放进营地的？！"

#. [message]: speaker=Khargol
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:638
msgid ""
"We’re under attack! Check the other wagons! Grab your swords and kill "
"anything that looks out of place!"
msgstr ""
"我们遭到袭击了！去检查其他马车！抄起你们的刀剑，看到任何不对劲的东西都杀掉！"

#. [message]: role=wagon1 {OR id=Konrad}
#. [event]
#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:649
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:856
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:861
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:897
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:912
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/bigmap.cfg:77
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:37
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:509
msgid "Konrad"
msgstr "科纳德"

#. [message]: role=wagon1 {OR id=Konrad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:651
msgid ""
"They’re getting ready for battle! We have to defeat the chief before we’re "
"overwhelmed."
msgstr "他们正准备战斗！我们必须在被敌人压倒之前击败酋长。"

#. [message]: role=arshag_wolf
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:687
msgid "Grrrr! Arf!"
msgstr "呜噜噜！汪！"

#. [message]: speaker=Arshag
#. Arshag is talking to his pet wolf, in the same way that a modern human might talk to a dog
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:692
msgid ""
"Who’s a good girl? Are you a good girl? Are you ready to feast on the bones "
"of our enemies?"
msgstr "谁是好姑娘呀？你是不是好姑娘？准备好享用敌人的骨头了吗？"

#. [message]: role=arshag_wolf
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:696
msgid "Arf! Arf! Woof!"
msgstr "汪！汪！嗷呜！"

#. [message]: speaker=leader3b
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:711
msgid ""
"Hurry on past, goblin. I don’t want your stench in my nose while I’m trying "
"to eat."
msgstr "快滚过去，地精。老子吃饭时可不想闻到你的臭味。"

#. [message]: role=nw_gold_guard
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:728
msgid ""
"That last raid was great! I can’t believe the queen is still finding rebel "
"villages for us to plunder!"
msgstr "上次抢得真痛快！真不敢相信女王还在给咱们找叛军的村子抢！"

#. [message]: role=nw_gold_guard
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:732
msgid ""
"Just look at this pile of gold I’ve pillaged! I hope nobody steals my loot "
"while I’m not looking..."
msgstr "瞧瞧我抢来的这堆金币！可别在我没看着的时候被人偷走……"

#. [message]: role=wagon1 {OR id=Konrad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:748
msgid ""
"There are caged animals here, many bearing the brand of a chief. They don’t "
"look very well cared for."
msgstr ""
"这里有被关在笼子里的动物，很多身上打着酋长的烙印。它们看起来没被好好照料。"

#. [message]: role=wagon1 {OR id=Konrad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:752
msgid ""
"Let us lift the latch on their fence gate, then quietly leave before anybody "
"notices..."
msgstr "我们把围栏门的门闩拉开，然后趁没人发现悄悄离开……"

#. [message]: role=boar_speaker
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:770
msgid ""
"Chief! Chief! Someone opened the pasture gate! Your prize pigs are running "
"free!"
msgstr "酋长！酋长！有人打开了牲口圈门！您的宝贝猪都跑出来了！"

#. [message]: speaker=Khargol
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:774
msgid ""
"Imbeciles! You three, go guard the pen and find my pigs. When I find out who "
"was responsible..."
msgstr "一群蠢货！你们三个，去看守猪圈，把我的猪找回来。等我知道是谁干的……"

#. [message]: speaker=leader3
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:824
msgid ""
"Argh, this place is so boring! Why am I stuck guarding this dumb valley "
"instead of going out on raids? I wish something exciting would finally "
"happen..."
msgstr ""
"唉，这地方真无聊！为什么我得守着这破山谷，不能出去劫掠？真希望终于来点刺激的"
"事……"

#. [message]: speaker=leader6
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:840
msgid "Hey, what’re you goblins doing back here? Get lost!"
msgstr "嘿，你们这些地精跑回这儿来干什么？滚开！"

#. [message]: role=wagon1 {OR id=Konrad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:857
msgid "Look at all those weapons! This must be one of their armories."
msgstr "瞧这些武器！这一定是他们的一个军械库。"

#. [message]: role=wagon1 {OR id=Konrad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:862
msgid ""
"If we can sabotage some without waking that goblin guard, we’ll make it "
"harder for their chief to recruit fighters and respond to our attack."
msgstr ""
"如果我们能在不惊醒那个地精守卫的情况下破坏其中一些，就能让他们酋长更难征募战"
"士，也更难应对我们的进攻。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:872
msgid "The Orcish Sovereign’s gold has been reduced to 0."
msgstr "兽人君主的金币已降至0."

#. [message]: speaker=Khargol
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:889
msgid ""
"Where’s that useless worm Fagh-Mok? He’s supposed to take orders from me! "
"But he’s been acting suspiciously lately, and now I can’t find him at all."
msgstr ""
"那个没用的虫子法格-莫克在哪儿？他本该听我的命令！可他最近举动可疑，现在我又完"
"全找不到他。"

#. [message]: speaker=Khargol
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:893
msgid ""
"I’ll be watching him. He’d better not try anything funny or I’ll chop his "
"head off!"
msgstr "我会盯着他。他最好别耍花样，否则我就把他的脑袋砍下来！"

#. [message]: role=wagon1 {OR id=Konrad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:898
msgid "That must be the orcish chief. He’s the one we need to kill."
msgstr "那一定就是兽人酋长。我们要杀的就是他。"

#. [message]: role=wagon1 {OR id=Konrad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:913
msgid ""
"We have reached an orcish keep, but our army is still outside. Any attempt "
"to bring them in would only give the orcs time to deploy more soldiers "
"against us."
msgstr ""
"我们已经抵达一座兽人要塞，但军队还在外面。若想把他们调进来，只会给兽人时间部"
"署更多士兵来对付我们。"

#. [message]: speaker=faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:937
msgid ""
"You idiot! What’re you doing back here?! You’re supposed to be fighting the "
"chief!"
msgstr "你这白痴！你跑回这里干什么？！你本该去和酋长战斗！"

#. [message]: speaker=faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:943
msgid "Get back in there or our deal’s off!"
msgstr "滚回去，否则我们的交易就作废！"

#. [message]: speaker=Khargol
#. referring to the events from the final scenario of Asheviere's Dogs. Khargol wasn't a named character in that campaign, but perhaps he was one of the random grunts
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:959
msgid ""
"You! You’re that wizard from the battle at Dan’Tonk! The one who did the "
"storm and the lightning."
msgstr "你！你就是丹·冬克之战里的那个巫师！就是召来风暴和闪电的那个！"

#. [message]: speaker=Khargol
#. Bazur is an orcish warrior, and the main character of Asheviere's Dogs.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:964
msgid ""
"Bazur always said he wanted a chance to kill you. Now I’ll do what he never "
"could!"
msgstr "巴祖尔总说想找个机会杀了你。现在我就来完成他永远办不到的事！"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:968
msgid ""
"Those were dark days. Today I end your rule as I shall one day end "
"Asheviere’s!"
msgstr ""
"那是黑暗的岁月。今日，我将终结你的统治，正如有朝一日我也会终结艾什薇尔的统"
"治！"

#. [message]: speaker=Khargol
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:979
msgid ""
"Hey! Do you see that? That’s the thing the queen told us to watch out for!"
msgstr "嘿！你们看见那个了吗？那就是女王叫咱们提防的东西！"

#. [message]: speaker=Khargol
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:983
msgid "The Sceptre of Fire! Get it!"
msgstr "圣火权杖！抢过来！"

#. [message]: speaker=Khargol
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:994
msgid "Weakling invaders! I’ll kill you all!"
msgstr "软弱的入侵者！我要杀光你们！"

#. [message]: role=arshag_wolf
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1009
msgid "whimper whimper whimper"
msgstr "呜咽，呜咽，呜咽"

#. [message]: speaker=Arshag
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1013
msgid "You’ll pay for that!"
msgstr "你会为此付出代价！"

#. [message]: speaker=Arshag
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1021
msgid "These foes are beyond my strength!"
msgstr "这些敌人太强了，我打不过！"

#. [message]: speaker=leader3
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1029
msgid "Filthy pinkskins!"
msgstr "肮脏的粉皮鬼！"

#. [message]: speaker=leader4
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1037
msgid "Curse you all!"
msgstr "诅咒你们所有人！"

#. [message]: speaker=leader6
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1045
msgid "Gah!!"
msgstr "嘎！！"

#. [message]: speaker=Khargol
#. Konrad may not have struck the finishing blow, but it'll be either him or one of his soldiers
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1059
msgid ""
"Impossible! Arr, how shameful to die at the hands of some stupid assassins..."
msgstr "不可能！呃啊，竟死在几个蠢刺客手里，真是太耻辱了……"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1069
msgid "Gado-har"
msgstr "加多-哈尔"

#. [message]: speaker=leader3
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1074
msgid "Khargol’s dead! The assassins killed our chief!"
msgstr "卡戈尔死了！刺客杀了咱们的酋长！"

#. [message]: speaker=faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1084
msgid ""
"Now is my chance! Set me free, girl, so I can take command of the horde!"
msgstr "现在是我的机会！放了我，丫头，让我来统领兽人大军！"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1088
msgid ""
"Set you free? Nice try. You’re not getting out of that cage until Konrad "
"returns."
msgstr "放了你？想得美。科纳德回来之前，你别想从那个笼子里出来。"

#. [message]: speaker=faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1094
msgid ""
"Stupid girl, you think the other orcs are just going to let him walk out? I "
"must take command. Set me free or your friends all die!"
msgstr ""
"蠢丫头，你以为其他兽人会让他大摇大摆地走出去？必须由我统率。放了我，不然你的"
"朋友全都得死！"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1098
msgid "Rrr... insufferable. I don’t know how Mother stands working with orcs."
msgstr "啧……真让人受不了。我真不知道母后怎么能受得了和兽人共事。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1102
msgid ""
"Go. But don’t you dare betray us, or I swear to personally find you and kill "
"you. If you know anything about me, you’ll know that’s a promise I can keep."
msgstr ""
"去吧。但你要是敢背叛我们，我发誓会亲自找到你，杀了你。你若知道我的为人，就该"
"明白我言出必行。"

#. [message]: speaker=faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1122
msgid "Assassins! I’ll get them!"
msgstr "刺客！我去收拾他们！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1127
msgid "You?! What??"
msgstr "你？！什么？？"

#. [message]: speaker=faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1133
msgid "Play dead, you idiot."
msgstr "装死，你这白痴。"

#. [message]: speaker=faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1152
msgid ""
"Look, everyone! I have slain the invaders and avenged the murder of our "
"chief!"
msgstr "大伙儿看哪！我杀了入侵者，为被谋杀的酋长报仇了！"

#. [message]: speaker=faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1158
msgid ""
"As head of Khargol’s personal guard, is only right that I assume the late "
"chief’s duties! Long live chief Fagh-mok the Amazing!"
msgstr ""
"身为卡戈尔的亲卫队长，由我接任已故酋长的职责天经地义！了不起的酋长法格-莫克万"
"岁！"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1166
msgid "Akhir"
msgstr "阿基尔"

#. [message]: speaker=Arshag
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1171
msgid ""
"Fagh-mok? You?! You’re weak! You were nothing more than the chief’s sword-"
"carrier!"
msgstr "法格-莫克？你？！你太弱了！你不过是给酋长背剑的！"

#. [message]: speaker=Arshag
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1175
msgid ""
"No, I should be chief instead! Khargol respected me most of all! I followed "
"him from the beginning!"
msgstr "不，该当酋长的是我！卡戈尔最敬重我！我从一开始就追随他！"

#. [message]: speaker=leader3
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1180
msgid ""
"No, I should be chief! My warriors are the bravest, and I am the strongest "
"warrior of all!"
msgstr "不，我才该当酋长！我的战士最勇敢，而我是所有战士中最强的！"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1184
msgid "Bovrir"
msgstr "博夫里尔"

#. [message]: speaker=leader4
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1189
msgid ""
"Strongest?! I could kill both you AND that ingrate Fagh-Mok, with one hand "
"tied behind my back!"
msgstr "最强？！我一只手绑在背后，也能把你和那个忘恩负义的法格-莫克都杀了！"

#. [message]: speaker=faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1196
msgid "Oh yeah? Come here and try it, you worthless sack of slime!"
msgstr "哦，是吗？有种过来试试，你这没用的烂泥袋！"

#. [message]: speaker=Arshag
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1200
msgid ""
"I say we kill all three of ’em! Warriors, fight to make me chief and I "
"promise to bathe you all in gold and blood!"
msgstr ""
"要我说，把那三个全宰了！战士们，为我厮杀，助我当上酋长，我保证让你们泡在黄金"
"和血水里！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1232
msgid "Hail, Li’sar! I return!"
msgstr "你好，莉莎！我回来了！"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1236
msgid ""
"The orcich camp echoes with shouts and screams. I take it Fagh-Mok’s bid to "
"become chief has not gone according to plan?"
msgstr ""
"兽人营地里喊声与惨叫声此起彼伏。看来法格-莫克争夺酋长之位的打算并未按计划进"
"行？"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1240
msgid ""
"Not exactly, no. But at least he held up his end of the bargain, and we "
"ours. Chief Khargol is dead, and until the Whitefangs resolve their "
"succession crisis they’ll be of no aid to Asheviere."
msgstr ""
"不完全是，没有。但至少他履行了他那部分的约定，我们也履行了我们的。酋长卡戈尔"
"已死；在白牙部落解决他们的继承危机之前，他们不会给艾什薇尔任何帮助。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1244
msgid ""
"Then we’ve accomplished what we set out to do. Onwards to the next battle."
msgstr "那么，我们已经达成了既定目标。向下一个战场进发。"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:21
msgid "scenario name^Cliffs of Thoria"
msgstr "索丽亚之崖"

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:49
msgid "Drakes"
msgstr "龙人"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:124
msgid "There is 80 gold lying in a cove at the bottom of this waterfall!"
msgstr "瀑布底部的小湾里躺着80金币！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:207
msgid ""
"All is quiet. Whatever fight was happening here, it ended before we could "
"intervene."
msgstr "一切都很安静。不管这里曾发生过什么战斗，都在我们来得及介入之前结束了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:214
msgid ""
"And the outcome is no mystery — there is a small fleet of boats shattered "
"among the river islands! I shall send a scout to investigate."
msgstr "结果不难猜——河心岛之间散落着一支小船队的残骸！我会派一名斥候前去查探。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:228
msgid ""
"And the outcome is no mystery — there is a small fleet of boats shattered "
"among the river islands! I shall send my familiar to investigate."
msgstr "结果不难猜——河心岛之间散落着一支小船队的残骸！我会派我的魔宠前去查探。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:244
msgid ""
"Curious. The wrecks are not of proper ships, but of shallow-draft rafts "
"built only recently; much of their timber is green. Those that were not "
"capsized have been burned. And most curious of all — all flew the banner of "
"Wesnoth."
msgstr ""
"奇怪。残骸不是完全意义上的战船，而是最近才草草造出来的小舟，船上的很多木料还"
"是新的。那些没有倾覆的则被烧毁了。而最奇怪的是——它们全都挂着韦诺的旗帜。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:248
msgid ""
"Wesnoth! There is only one army of Wesnoth in these lands, and it is the one "
"which I led here to fight you. These must be survivors from the volcano!"
msgstr ""
"韦诺！这片土地上只有一支韦诺军队，那就是我率领来讨伐你的这支。这些人一定是火"
"山那边的幸存者！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:252
msgid "I’m afraid they don’t seem to be survivors any longer, Li’sar."
msgstr "恐怕他们看起来已经不再是幸存者了，莉莎。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:261
msgid "Keh Ohn"
msgstr "克·欧亨"

#. [message]: speaker=Keh Ohn
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:269
msgid ""
"Interlopers from the Domain of Men!\n"
"Heed this warning for it is the last I shall offer your kind —\n"
"\n"
"Seek no further trespass of our land across this river.\n"
"Lest you reach only that same end as they who did so before you."
msgstr ""
"来自人类之域的擅入者！\n"
"听此警告；此乃吾予汝族最后之警诫——\n"
"\n"
"勿再越此河，犯吾等之地。\n"
"否则汝等唯将如先前犯境者，同至其终。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:277
msgid ""
"A drake! So the winged figures we saw fighting were drakes. You are the ones "
"who destroyed this flotilla?"
msgstr ""
"一个龙人！原来我们看见的那些在空中交战的有翼身影就是龙人。是你们摧毁了这支船"
"队？"

#. [message]: speaker=Keh Ohn
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:281
msgid ""
"We are.\n"
"\n"
"For in violation of our Ways, they harvested game from our Domain.\n"
"Then... they took the eggs of drakes... our eggs... as prey.\n"
"\n"
"For such an act, I should grant no leniency.\n"
"Yet long ago, my ancestors once made similar transgressions against your "
"kind.\n"
"So I grant you, who were not directly responsible, your lives.\n"
"Now go."
msgstr ""
"吾等为之。\n"
"\n"
"彼等违吾等之道，于吾等之域猎取野物。\n"
"继而……彼等取龙人之卵……吾等之卵……掠为猎物。\n"
"\n"
"行此之举，吾本不应宽贷。\n"
"然远古之时，吾之先祖亦曾对汝族犯下相似之过。\n"
"故吾赐汝等——未直与其事者——性命。\n"
"今且去。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:293
msgid ""
"The soldiers consumed drake eggs? I cannot imagine anyone would be fool "
"enough to do such a thing, unless unknowingly or in extreme starvation. I "
"fear this has been a terrible misunderstanding."
msgstr ""
"士兵们吞食了龙人蛋？我无法想象有人会蠢到做出这种事，除非是不知情，或是极度饥"
"饿。恐怕这是一场可怕的误会。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:297
msgid ""
"The men I trained are skilled and tenacious. If it was possible to survive, "
"they will have. We will go, drake, but you will first turn over any "
"prisoners and allow us to search the river for survivors."
msgstr ""
"我训练出来的人技艺娴熟、坚韧不拔。只要有一线生机，他们就能活下来。我们会走，"
"龙人，但你必须先交出所有俘虏，并允许我们沿河搜寻幸存者。"

#. [message]: speaker=Keh Ohn
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:301
msgid ""
"Their lives are forfeit.\n"
"All who have preyed upon our young, we shall destroy.\n"
"The matter is decided.\n"
"My decision, final."
msgstr ""
"彼等之命，已无可赦。\n"
"凡猎食吾等幼裔者，吾等必灭之。\n"
"此事已决。\n"
"吾之裁决，终不可改。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:308
msgid ""
"Foul dragon, the decision was never yours to make! If but one soldier of "
"Wesnoth has survived then I am coming to his rescue. Stand in my way only if "
"you seek to do battle."
msgstr ""
"恶龙，这决定从来轮不到你来做！哪怕只有一名韦诺士兵幸存，我也要前去救他。若你"
"想与我交战，就尽管挡路。"

#. [message]: speaker=Keh Ohn
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:312
msgid "So be it, fellow contender."
msgstr "既如此，便这样吧，同场争锋的对手。"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:322
msgid "Find the survivor near the southeast corner of the map."
msgstr "在地图东南角附近找到幸存者。"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:329
msgid "Then, escort him towards the west edge of the map."
msgstr "然后护送他前往地图西侧边缘。"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:337
msgid "Reach Warven, then escort him towards the west edge of the map."
msgstr "抵达沃尔文处，然后护送他前往地图西侧边缘。"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:346
msgid "Escort Warven west to the marked hexes."
msgstr "护送沃尔文向西前往标记的六角格。"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:353
msgid "Death of Warven"
msgstr "沃尔文死亡"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:368
msgid ""
"Warven will remain under player control until the end of the scenario, but "
"will join Li’sar’s side in future scenarios."
msgstr "沃尔文将在本场景结束前始终由玩家控制，但在后续场景中会加入莉莎一方。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:383
msgid ""
"I don’t see any enemy keep on the river, but it’s littered with crude "
"dwellings. We should break down the drakish villages to stop them rallying "
"more fighters."
msgstr ""
"我在河上没看到任何敌方城堡，但河岸上到处是简陋的住所。我们应该拆毁这些龙人村"
"庄，阻止他们集结更多战士。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:403
msgid ""
"There is a cataract ahead. By the thunder of the water and the height of the "
"spume, it must drop several hundred feet at least! To try to sail past this "
"would be suicide."
msgstr ""
"前方有一个大瀑布。水像雷霆一般震响，泡沫也飞起很高，看来它的高度至少有几百英"
"尺！想乘船从这儿过去，简直是自寻死路。"

#. [message]: speaker=Keh Ohn
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:417
msgid "GRRROOOOAAAAR!"
msgstr "嘎啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:423
msgid "Huzzah! We’ve killed their leader!"
msgstr "万岁！我们干掉了他们的首领！"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:428
msgid ""
"Our dominant is slain!\n"
"Gliders, send word to the first intendant of his ascension by fate."
msgstr ""
"吾等翼主已亡！\n"
"滑翔者，传讯于首席辅佐者：彼已循天命升继。"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:451
msgid ""
"We’ve slain one of the drakes! Their biology is... wow, incredibly strange — "
"yes, I think there must be some magic in them."
msgstr ""
"我们杀死了一个龙人！它们的生理构造……哇，真是奇怪得难以置信——没错，我想它们体"
"内一定有什么魔法。"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:455
msgid ""
"With more specimens, I’m sure I could learn something practical. If you "
"could kill, say, err, thirty drakes — not including this one, that is — then "
"I’m sure their fire could show me how to improve my flashpowder."
msgstr ""
"如果有更多样本，我肯定能学到些实用的东西。要是你能杀死，呃，比如说三十个龙人"
"——当然，不包括这一只——那么我敢肯定，它们的火焰能让我知道如何改进我的闪光粉。"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:476
msgid ""
"That’s fifteen drakes you’ve defeated. I’m already learning so much from "
"dissecting the corpses! Fifteen more and I’m sure I’ll learn something "
"practical."
msgstr ""
"你已经击败了十五个龙人。光靠解剖尸体，我就已经学到这么多东西！再来十五个，我"
"肯定能学到些实用的东西。"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:486
msgid ""
"Oh, wow, you defeated all thirty drakes I asked for! These are just... "
"absolutely amazing! Such fascinating creatures! Did you know that each wing "
"contains upwards of seven major arteries?"
msgstr ""
"噢，哇，你击败了我要求的全部三十个龙人！它们简直……太不可思议了！多么迷人的生"
"物！你知道吗，每只翅膀里都有七条以上的主要动脉？"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:490
msgid ""
"Err, and, well, of course I’ve extracted some particular reagents that could "
"be useful on the battlefield as well. As promised."
msgstr ""
"呃，还有，嗯，当然，我也提取了一些特殊的试剂，在战场上也能派上用场。就像我承"
"诺的那样。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:522
msgid ""
"Good, we’ve destroyed one drake beacon. Each one we raze will make it more "
"difficult for them to rally their fighters."
msgstr ""
"好，我们已经摧毁了一座龙人信标。我们每夷平一座，他们想集结战士就会更困难。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:600
msgid ""
"Look! I see someone at the top of the furthermost cliff! It’s a young human "
"officer, barely more than a boy. He appears badly hurt but still alive."
msgstr ""
"看！我看见一个人在最远处的峭壁顶上！是一位年轻的人类军官，只比小男孩大一点。"
"他看上去受了重伤，但仍然活着。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:613
msgid ""
"I wonder why the drakes haven’t finished him by now? It is strange that "
"there are not any drakes in that area."
msgstr ""
"我很奇怪为什么龙人到现在还没有干掉他？那个区域里竟然一个龙人都没有，真是太奇"
"怪了。"

#. [message]: type=Water Serpent,Kraken
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:636
msgid "Grrroar"
msgstr "嘎啊啊啊啊啊"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:640
msgid "Well... that answers the question."
msgstr "好吧……这就是问题的答案。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:645
msgid ""
"That young officer is Warven, one of my best lieutenants! He might well be "
"the only survivor of this battle! We must reach him and bring him to safety."
msgstr ""
"那名年轻军官是沃尔文，我最好的尉官之一！他很可能是这场战斗中唯一的幸存者！我"
"们必须赶到他那里，把他带到安全的地方。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:648
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:649
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:650
msgid ""
"Must I remind you that he, like all the others who fought us underground, "
"once tried his utmost to kill us? Will he follow you, or will he choose to "
"betray us to Asheviere?"
msgstr ""
"难道还要我提醒你，他就像所有在地下与我们交过手的人一样，曾竭尽全力想杀死我们"
"吗？他会追随你，还是会选择把我们出卖给艾什薇尔？"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:651
msgid ""
"I don’t mean to question your judgement, but wasn’t he trying to kill us not "
"so long ago? He’s one of Asheviere’s! Will he follow you, or will he choose "
"to betray us to the dark queen?"
msgstr ""
"我无意质疑你的判断，但不久前他不是还想杀死我们吗？他是艾什薇尔的人！他会追随"
"你，还是会选择把我们出卖给黑暗女王？"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:652
msgid ""
"What honor is there in the heart of a man who has served Asheviere; who "
"pursued us underground and fought to kill us? Will he follow you, or will he "
"choose to betray us to the dark queen?"
msgstr ""
"一个曾侍奉艾什薇尔、在地下追击我们并想杀死我们的人，心中还能有什么荣誉？他会"
"追随你，还是会选择把我们出卖给黑暗女王？"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:653
msgid ""
"Not so long ago he was fightin’ underground and trying his best to kill "
"Konrad. How do you think he’s going to join our alliance now? What if he "
"betrays us to the queen?"
msgstr ""
"不久前他还在底下拼命想杀科纳德呢。你觉得他现在会加入我们的联盟？万一他把我们"
"出卖给女王怎么办？"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:654
msgid ""
"Forget not that he, like the others who fought us underground, came north "
"with you to kill Konrad. If rescued shall he join our alliance, or shall he "
"betray us to Asheviere?"
msgstr ""
"莫要忘记，他就像其他在地下与我们交战的人一样，曾随你北上，意图杀死科纳德。若"
"我们救了他，他会加入我们的联盟，还是将我们出卖给艾什薇尔？"

#. [companion_message]
#. reference to this fable: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Scorpion_and_the_Frog
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:656
msgid ""
"Aye, so said the scorpion to the frog! Dinnae forget, that ninnyhammerin’ "
"cad tried to kill Konrad not so long ago, same as all them other chuckle-"
"heads who fought us underground! He’ll betray us to Asheviere quick as a "
"wink."
msgstr ""
"是啊，蝎子对青蛙就是这么说的！甭忘了，那个蠢驴恶棍不久前还想杀科纳德，跟那些"
"在地下跟我们交手的呆瓜一个德性！他一眨眼就会把我们卖给艾什薇尔。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:657
msgid ""
"It’s good to save a life and all, of course. But, err, well, you know, "
"wasn’t he fighting underground trying to kill Konrad not too long ago? Is he "
"going to join our alliance? What if he betrays us to Asheviere?"
msgstr ""
"救人一命当然是好事，呃，不过，嗯，你知道，他不是不久前还在地下想杀科纳德吗？"
"他会加入我们的联盟吗？万一他把我们出卖给艾什薇尔怎么办？"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:658
msgid ""
"Dosh don’t think dat be so smart. He was unnerground tryin’ to kill Konrad "
"not too long ago, wasn’t he? Now we want to help him? Dosh thinks he’ll run "
"quick as a wink back to dat queen, an’ we’ll be all da worse for it."
msgstr ""
"多什觉得这可不聪明。他不久前还在地下想杀科纳德，对吧？现在俺们要帮他？多什觉"
"得他会一眨眼就跑回那个女王那儿，俺们可就倒大霉喽。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:659
msgid ""
"Do not forget that he, like all the others who fought us underground, once "
"tried his utmost to kill me. Will he follow you, or will he choose to betray "
"us to Asheviere?"
msgstr ""
"别忘了，他就像所有在地下与我们交过手的人一样，曾竭尽全力想杀死我。他会追随"
"你，还是会选择把我们出卖给艾什薇尔？"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#. "you people" refers to the last speaker - one of Konrad's many possible companions. Kalenz, Chantal, Haldiel, Elrian, Seimus, Harper, Moremirmu, Ulfdain, Jeniver, or Dosh.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:667
msgid ""
"Perhaps he did come to kill you, but he’s loyal to me and did so only at my "
"orders. I don’t question you people who Konrad chooses to put his trust in — "
"please don’t question mine."
msgstr ""
"也许他确实来杀过你，但他忠于我，而且只是奉我之命行事。我不会质疑科纳德选择信"
"任的你们——也请你们不要质疑我信任的人。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:673
msgid ""
"Perhaps he did come to kill you, but he’s loyal to me and did so only at my "
"orders. You can trust him."
msgstr "也许他确实来杀过你，但他忠于我，而且只是奉我之命行事。你可以信任他。"

#. [message]: speaker=Warven
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:694
msgid "Who... who are you? A friend or a foe?"
msgstr "谁……你们是谁？是敌是友？"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:698
msgid ""
"We are friends. Don’t worry about it and don’t try to fight us — you are in "
"no condition to fight."
msgstr "我们是朋友。不用担心，也别试图和我们战斗——你这副样子可不能战斗啊。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:702
msgid ""
"Welcome back to the fold, young lieutenant. Let’s get you to the healers."
msgstr "欢迎归队，年轻的尉官。我们带你去找治疗师。"

#. [message]: speaker=Warven
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:706
msgid ""
"General Li’sar — here? Praise Haldric, you’re alive! But... what you doing "
"in league with the false prince?"
msgstr ""
"莉莎将军——您在这里？赞美哈德里克，您还活着！可是……您怎么会和那个伪王子勾结在"
"一起？"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:710
msgid "Call it a change of heart. You swore an oath to me. Will you follow us?"
msgstr "就当是我改变心意了。你曾向我宣誓效忠。你愿意追随我们吗？"

#. [message]: speaker=Warven
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:714
msgid "Your Highness... Highnesses, I am yours to command."
msgstr "殿下……殿下，谨遵您的号令！"

#. [message]: speaker=Warven
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:741
msgid ""
"General... Thank you for rescuing me, but the others are in need of help too."
msgstr "将军……谢谢您救了我，但其他人也需要帮助。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:745
msgid "Others? There are more survivors!?"
msgstr "其他人？还有更多幸存者！？"

#. [message]: speaker=Warven
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:749
msgid ""
"Yes, Your Highness! We were only the scouts — trying to find a way back "
"home. If I survive this battle, I can lead you upriver to our camp. They’ll "
"be elated to see that you’ve survived."
msgstr ""
"是的，殿下！我们只是侦察兵——正在寻找回家的路。如果我能活着离开这场战斗，我可"
"以带你们沿河而上，去我们的营地。他们看到您还活着，一定会欣喜若狂。"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:770
msgid ""
"Our foe flees.\n"
"We are victorious."
msgstr ""
"吾等之敌遁矣。\n"
"吾等得胜。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:776
msgid "Warven’s made it to safety! Time to leave, everyone."
msgstr "沃尔文已经安全了！大家该走了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:794
msgid ""
"No! Without him we will never find the other survivors. I’ve failed my duty "
"as commander."
msgstr "不！没有他，我们永远找不到其他幸存者。我辜负了作为指挥官的职责。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:812
msgid ""
"Even the best healing we can administer is no substitute for rest. We must "
"get Warven to safety before his wounds become too much to bear."
msgstr ""
"即使我们能给予最好的治疗，也代替不了休息。我们必须在沃尔文的伤势变得无法承受"
"之前，把他送到安全的地方。"

#. [message]: speaker=Warven
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:819
msgid "Argh... I... can’t—"
msgstr "呃啊……我……不行了——"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:824
msgid ""
"No! Without him we will never find the other survivors. I’ve failed my men."
msgstr "不！没有他，我们永远找不到其他幸存者。我辜负了我的部下。"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:20
msgid "scenario name^Underground Channels"
msgstr "地下通道"

#. [side]: id=leader3, type=Saurian Javelineer
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:117
msgid "Saurians"
msgstr "蜥蜴人"

#. [side]: id=Haralamdum, type=Ancient Wose
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:166
msgid "Woses"
msgstr "树人"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:241
msgid ""
"Here we are! Whatever evil lurks within these caves, we shall put an end to "
"it."
msgstr "我们到了！无论这些洞穴里潜伏着什么邪恶，我们都要将它彻底铲除。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:253
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:254
msgid "Konrad, do you hear that sound? Look to the north. I wonder if—"
msgstr "科纳德，你听见那声音了吗？往北看。我在想是不是——"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:255
msgid "Konrad, listen. Do you hear that? The trees are moving in the north!"
msgstr "科纳德，听。你听见了吗？北边的树在动！"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:256
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:257
msgid "Konrad, listen. Do you hear that? Look to the north. Woses!"
msgstr "科纳德，听。你听见了吗？往北看。是树人！"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:258
msgid "Whoah, did you hear that? Look north! The trees are moving!"
msgstr "哇哦，你听见了吗？往北看！树在动！"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:259
msgid "Hark to the north, Konrad! There is movement among the trees!"
msgstr "听哪，科纳德，北边！树丛中有动静！"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:260
msgid "Hey, do you hear that? Look north! Th’ trees are moving!"
msgstr "嘿，你听见没？往北瞅！那些树在动呢！"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:261
msgid "Do you hear that? Is — yes! Yes, look! A wose!"
msgstr "你听见了吗？是不是——对！对，快看！一个树人！"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:262
msgid "Hey, Konrad, did you hear dat? I tink dem trees are moving!"
msgstr "嘿，科纳德，你听见那声没？俺觉着那些树在动！"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:263
msgid "Delfador, do you hear that? Look to the north. Woses!"
msgstr "德法多，你听见了吗？往北看。是树人！"

#. [message]: speaker=Haralamdum
#. Well, I say. Is that young Master Delfador?
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:274
msgid "Well, I say ... hmm dum har ... young Master Delfador?"
msgstr "那，我得说……呣，达呣，哈……年轻的德法多大师？"

#. [message]: speaker=Haralamdum
#. So it is! How is the ambassador? He was here just the other day.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:279
msgid ""
"Harum-alam-alam. So it is! Hmm hmm alam ... how is ... hum ... the "
"ambassador? He was here ... hmm ... just the other day."
msgstr ""
"哈鲁姆—阿拉姆—阿拉姆。果然如此！嗯嗯阿拉姆……大使……嗯……他近来可好？他前些天……"
"嗯……还在这儿呢。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:283
msgid ""
"That was many years ago, I’m afraid. You are the woses who once resided at "
"the Grey Grove? I see you have learned the language of men."
msgstr ""
"恐怕那是许多年前的事了。你们就是曾在灰林居住的树人吗？看来你们已经学会了人类"
"的语言。"

#. [message]: speaker=Haralamdum
#. Hmm, yes. A very useful language. Now these undead... very troubling.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:288
msgid ""
"Hmm ... yes ... alam ... alam dum ... very useful ... language ... yes ... "
"hum ... now these undead ... harum ... very troubling."
msgstr ""
"嗯……是……阿拉姆……阿拉姆，杜姆……很有用……语言……对……嗯……现在这些亡灵……哈鲁姆……很"
"麻烦。"

#. [message]: speaker=Haralamdum
#. I am sure you could help rid us of these infernal undead. Afterwards, we could perhaps help you too.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:293
msgid ""
"I am sure ... dum hum ... you could help rid us of these ... alam hurum ... "
"infernal undead ... yes, harum-alam-alam. Afterwards, we could perhaps... "
"hmm ... help you too. Har alam dum."
msgstr ""
"我相信……杜姆，胡姆……你能帮我们除掉这些……阿拉姆，胡鲁姆……地狱般的亡灵……是的，"
"哈鲁姆-阿拉姆-阿拉姆。之后，我们也许……嗯……也能帮你们。哈，阿拉姆，杜姆。"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:301
msgid "Defeat the undead leader"
msgstr "击败亡灵首领"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:306
msgid "Death of Haralamdum"
msgstr "哈拉兰杜姆死亡"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:327
msgid ""
"Konrad, this entrance is nearly flooded, and is too narrow for both our "
"armies to enter. My soldiers and I will search for another way in."
msgstr ""
"科纳德，这个入口快被水淹了，而且太窄，我们两支军队没法同时进入。我和我的士兵"
"会另找一条路进来。"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:341
msgid ""
"It’s so exciting to finally see woses up close! I hear they have a "
"spectacular resistance to poison! Wose sap... curing — yes, if I could just "
"extract a bucket of wose sap I’m certain I could learn their secrets."
msgstr ""
"能近距离看到树人真是太激动了！我听说它们对毒素有惊人的抗性！树人的汁液……治疗"
"——对，只要我能提取一桶树人汁液，我肯定能学会它们的秘密。"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:345
msgid ""
"Now, err, well, of course sap extraction would be problematic from a live "
"specimen, them being our allies and all. But, ah, we are on a battlefield. "
"<b><i>We</i></b> don’t have to be the ones doing the cutting."
msgstr ""
"现在，呃，这个嘛，当然，从活体身上提取汁液会有问题，毕竟他们是我们的盟友之类"
"的。不过，啊，我们可是在战场上。<b><i>我们</i></b>不一定非得是动手切割的人。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:349
msgid ""
"You’re asking me to help you rob the dead. Don’t you think that’s a bit "
"ghoulish, Jeniver?"
msgstr ""
"你这是要我帮你盗取死者身上的东西。珍妮芙，你不觉得这有点食尸鬼般的恶趣味吗？"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:353
msgid ""
"But just imagine the possibilities! I ask you to help me stand next to a "
"wose when it dies. If I can, I’m sure — yes I’m sure I can gather enough sap "
"to begin curing poisons."
msgstr ""
"但你想想这能有多大用处！我只要你帮我站在一棵树人身旁，等它死去。只要能做到，"
"我确信——对，我确信我能收集到足够汁液来开始治疗毒素。"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:362
msgid "It’s falling over! Oh, now’s my chance to collect some sap!"
msgstr "它倒下了！哦，现在是我收集汁液的机会！"

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:378
msgid "Antivenom"
msgstr "抗毒剂"

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:379
msgid "Jeniver has gained the “<i>cures</i>” ability!"
msgstr "珍妮芙获得了“<b>治愈</b>”能力！"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:383
msgid ""
"It works! It works! Oh, I knew it! Now, err, I suppose I’d better quickly "
"get back to the battle before the woses wonder what I was doing with their "
"friend."
msgstr ""
"成功了！成功了！哦，我就知道！现在，呃，我想我最好赶紧回到战斗中去，免得树人"
"们纳闷我拿他们的朋友做了什么。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:405
msgid ""
"Everyone ready? Good. Now that Konrad has distracted them from the west, "
"we’ll push in from the east."
msgstr ""
"都准备好了吗？很好。既然科纳德已经从西边牵制住了他们，我们就从东边推进。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:428
msgid ""
"The river is clean and fresh in this direction. There are no undead to hunt "
"this way."
msgstr "这个方向的河水干净又清澈。这边没有亡灵可猎杀。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:454
msgid "Look, saurians! What business do you have in these caves?"
msgstr "看，蜥蜴人！你们在这些洞穴里有何贵干？"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:458
msgid "Fssssh! Ssslay you! Ssslay you all!"
msgstr "嘶嘶嘶！杀了你们嘶嘶！把你们全杀了嘶嘶！"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:462
msgid "I don’t think diplomacy will get us far with these ones."
msgstr "我看跟这些家伙讲外交是行不通的。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:477
msgid ""
"The aggressive saurians are vanquished, but the undead are the greater evil "
"here. We must not waver!"
msgstr "好斗的蜥蜴人已经被击败，但亡灵才是这里更大的邪恶。我们绝不能动摇！"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:489
msgid "Master. Is away. I guard. I will fight. Until Iliah. Malal returns."
msgstr "主人。不在。我守卫。我会战斗。直到伊利阿。玛拉尔。归来。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:493
msgid ""
"Your master Malal is gone, you undead fool! Go back to your eternal rest."
msgstr "你的主人玛拉尔已经走了，你这亡灵蠢货！滚回你永恒的安息中去吧。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:497
msgid ""
"Iliah-Malal? That is the lich we fought in the swamp. What would one of his "
"minions be doing here? And why is it so powerful!?"
msgstr ""
"伊利阿-玛拉尔？就是我们在沼泽里战斗过的那个巫妖。他的一个爪牙在这里做什么？而"
"且它为什么这么强大！？"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#. reference to Eastern Invasion's "Dark Sanctuary" scenario
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:502
msgid ""
"It speaks of guarding — perhaps Malal has a sanctuary hidden somewhere else "
"in these hills. I do not think we have time to search for it, though. "
"Perhaps a task for another hero, another time."
msgstr ""
"它提到守卫——也许玛拉尔在这片丘陵的其他地方藏着一处圣殿。不过，我想我们没有时"
"间去找它了。也许这是另一位英雄、另一个时代的任务。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:520
msgid ""
"There is an old book here, labeled <i>“Isaac Mallat — Journal.”</i> The "
"running water has washed away most of the ink, but one passage is still "
"readable..."
msgstr ""
"这里有一本旧书，标签上写着“《艾萨克·马拉特——日志》”。流水冲掉了大部分墨迹，但"
"有一段还能辨认……"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:525
msgid ""
"—died in my arms. My own brother! He could have been saved!! This imbecile "
"king’s quarantine will be the end of us all."
msgstr ""
"——死在我怀里。我的亲兄弟！他本可以得救的！！这个蠢货国王的隔离令会把我们全部"
"害死。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:527
msgid ""
"I’m sure I’m not contagious. I’m sure there’s some way to cure it. If I "
"sneak out of the village and make my way north to—"
msgstr ""
"我确信我没有传染性。我确信一定有办法治好它。如果我偷偷溜出村子，一路向北前往"
"——"

#. [message]: speaker=Haralamdum
#. Well done. Very good.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:547
msgid "Har hum har ... hmm ... well ... har alam dum ... good."
msgstr "哈，哈呣，哈……呣……好……哈，啊啦呣，达呣……很好。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:551
msgid ""
"Those undead will bother you no more, Sir Wose. Will you join us? We march "
"towards Weldyn, to depose the dark queen Asheviere."
msgstr ""
"那些亡灵再也不会骚扰你们了，树人阁下。你愿意加入我们吗？我们正向维尔帝进军，"
"要废黜黑暗女王艾什薇尔。"

#. [message]: speaker=Haralamdum
#. March? So hasty. No, we are not soldiers, not at all. And we are not many.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:556
msgid ""
"March? So hasty. Harum-alam-alam ... no, we are not soldiers ... harum ... "
"not at all. And we are not ... hum ... not many."
msgstr ""
"进军？这么急。哈鲁姆—阿拉姆—阿拉姆……不，我们不是士兵……哈鲁姆……根本不是。而且"
"我们……嗯……数量也不多。"

#. [message]: speaker=Haralamdum
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:560
msgid "Hmm ... but there was something ... something to help ..."
msgstr "嗯……不过有一样东西……能帮上忙的东西……"

#. [message]: speaker=Haralamdum
#. Oh, yes. The dust.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:566
msgid "Har dum ... oh, yes, the dust."
msgstr "哈，达呣……哦，是的，尘灰。"

#. [message]: speaker=Haralamdum
#. Dust carried by a skeleton. Something magical. I put it— where did I put it...
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:571
msgid ""
"Dust carried ... har alam dum ... by a skeleton. Something magical. I put "
"it ... harum ... where did I put it..."
msgstr ""
"尘灰……由一具骷髅携带……哈阿拉姆杜姆……某种魔法之物。我把它……哈鲁姆……我把它放哪"
"儿了……"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:578
msgid ""
"I see it — a pouch of powdered sapphire! A valuable component for all kinds "
"of spells. I used the last of my supply in the defense of Elensefar, and "
"have sorely missed it since. Thank you for your gift, Haralamdum."
msgstr ""
"我看见了——一袋蓝宝石粉末！这是各种法术的珍贵材料。我在保卫埃仁撒伐时用光了最"
"后一点储备，此后一直为缺它而苦恼。感谢你的馈赠，哈拉兰杜姆。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mentoring}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:582
msgid ""
"Konrad, with this I can conjure up powerful earthen elementals. Malal must "
"have stashed it away here. Now it is ours."
msgstr ""
"科纳德，有了这个，我就能召唤强大的土元素。玛拉尔一定是把它藏在了这里。现在它"
"归我们了。"

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:588
msgid "Delfador can now recruit Granite Golems!"
msgstr "德法多现在可以招募花岗岩魔像了！"

#. [message]: speaker=Haralamdum
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:608
msgid "Harum ... huff ..."
msgstr "哈鲁姆……呼……"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:614
msgid "The woses have been defeated! The undead have won."
msgstr "树人们战败了！亡灵获胜了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:629
msgid ""
"We should hurry, Konrad. There are storm clouds on the horizon. If we take "
"too long to finish our battle and it starts to rain, this entire cave system "
"might flood."
msgstr ""
"我们得快点，科纳德。天边出现了暴风云。如果我们拖太久还没打完，一旦下起雨来，"
"整个洞穴系统都可能被淹没。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:640
msgid ""
"It’s starting to rain, and these caves are about to flood! The undead can "
"survive underwater, but I can’t. Even the merfolk must surface often for "
"air! We’ll have to break off the attack."
msgstr ""
"开始下雨了，这些洞穴就要被淹了！亡灵能在水下存活，可我不能。就连人鱼也得时常"
"浮出水面呼吸！我们只能中止进攻了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:645
msgid ""
"It’s starting to rain, and these caves are about to flood! The undead can "
"survive underwater, but I can’t. We’ll have to break off the attack."
msgstr ""
"开始下雨了，这些洞穴就要被淹了！亡灵能在水下存活，可我不能。我们只能中止进攻"
"了。"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:8
msgid "scenario name^Test of the Clans"
msgstr "氏族的考验"

#. [side]: type=Grand Knight, id={ID}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:41
msgid "Plainsmen"
msgstr "平原居民"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:203
msgid ""
"The clans are rich and powerful, even under my mother, and their lands are "
"overflowing with stockpiled supplies. We’ll make better use of it than they "
"would."
msgstr ""
"这些氏族富庶而强大，就算在我母亲的治下也是如此，他们的领地到处堆满了囤积的物"
"资。我们可比他们更懂得利用这些东西。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:258
msgid "Hail, men of the plains! I greet you with a proposal."
msgstr "向你们致敬，平原的勇士们！我带着一项提议来见你们。"

#. [message]: speaker=Daryn
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:262
msgid ""
"What do these intruders want? We did not invite them here, that is certain."
msgstr "这些入侵者想要什么？我们可没有邀请他们来，这是确定无疑的。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:266
msgid ""
"You know that my late uncle, King Garard II, was a friend of the clans. Your "
"knights made up the cream of his army, and were venerated for their service. "
"What prestige do you plainsmen hold under Asheviere, queen of the cities and "
"employer of orcs?"
msgstr ""
"你们知道，我已故的伯父、国王伽拉德二世曾是各氏族的朋友。你们的骑士曾是他军中"
"最精锐的力量，并因他们的效劳而备受尊崇。可如今在艾什薇尔——众城女王、兽人的雇"
"主——治下，你们平原人又能有什么尊荣？"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:270
msgid ""
"Join us to overthrow the evil queen, and I will see the clans restored to "
"prominence within the courts of Weldyn. Oppose us, and I will strip you of "
"your power once the throne is rightfully reclaimed."
msgstr ""
"加入我们，推翻邪恶的女王，我定会让各氏族在维尔帝的宫廷中重获显赫。若你们与我"
"们为敌，待王座重归正统之时，我必剥夺你们的权位。"

#. [message]: speaker=Alric
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:276
msgid ""
"Hah! You think you can seize the throne? You who are led by these youths and "
"this old man?"
msgstr "哈！你以为你能夺取王座？你们这群被小孩子和老头子率领的乌合之众？"

#. [message]: speaker=Bayar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:280
msgid ""
"He will confront Asheviere, as he claims. Then he will die. And if we have "
"lent our support it will be all the worse for us."
msgstr ""
"他会如他所言去对抗艾什薇尔。然后他会死。而若我们曾给予支援，那对我们只会更"
"糟。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:284
msgid ""
"“These youths”, you dare call us? Don’t think me so weak that I cannot prove "
"my worth in pitched battle."
msgstr ""
"“小孩子”，你竟敢这样称呼我们？别以为我软弱到无法在正面会战中证明自己的价值。"

#. [message]: speaker=Bayar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:288
msgid ""
"Hah! You would challenge us? I accept. Rout our clansmen and we will "
"repudiate the queen. Or otherwise leave now and never return!"
msgstr ""
"哈！你想挑战我们？我接受。击溃我们氏族人，我们就背弃女王。否则现在就离开，永"
"远别再回来！"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:292
msgid ""
"If you will not listen to reason, then so be it. Ready your lances, men of "
"the plains!"
msgstr "既然你们不听劝告，那就这样吧。平原的战士们，备好长枪！"

#. [message]: speaker=Ruga
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:298
msgid "Fools! We will run you down like dogs!"
msgstr "蠢货！我们将把你们打得有如丧家之犬！"

#. [message]: speaker=Daryn
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:302
msgid "There is no turning back for you now. You will not break us!"
msgstr "你们已无退路。你们休想击垮我们！"

#. [objective]: description={ON_DIFFICULTY4, condition=win
#. $clansmen_remaining will be between 1 and 60
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:348
msgid ""
"Defeat 30 enemies to rout the Horse Clans ($clansmen_remaining remaining)"
msgstr "击败 30 名敌人以击溃马上氏族（剩余 $clansmen_remaining）"

#. [objective]: description={ON_DIFFICULTY4, condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:349
msgid ""
"Defeat 40 enemies to rout the Horse Clans ($clansmen_remaining remaining)"
msgstr "击败 40 名敌人以击溃马上氏族（剩余 $clansmen_remaining）"

#. [objective]: description={ON_DIFFICULTY4, condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:350
msgid ""
"Defeat 50 enemies to rout the Horse Clans ($clansmen_remaining remaining)"
msgstr "击败 50 名敌人以击溃马上氏族（剩余 $clansmen_remaining）"

#. [objective]: description={ON_DIFFICULTY4, condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:351
msgid ""
"Defeat 60 enemies to rout the Horse Clans ($clansmen_remaining remaining)"
msgstr "击败 60 名敌人以击溃马上氏族（剩余 $clansmen_remaining）"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:357
msgid ""
"Defeat one or more enemy leaders — defeated leaders will join your recall "
"list after this scenario"
msgstr "击败一名或多名敌方首领——被击败的首领将在本场景结束后加入你的召回列表"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:365
msgid ""
"Defeat mounted enemies with Haldiel or Simyr — defeated cavalry will join "
"your recall list after this scenario"
msgstr ""
"以哈尔迪尔或西米尔击败骑乘敌军——被击败的骑兵将在本场景结束后加入你的召回列表"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:375
msgid ""
"Defeat mounted enemies with Haldiel — defeated cavalry will join your recall "
"list after this scenario"
msgstr "以哈尔迪尔击败骑乘敌军——被击败的骑兵将在本场景结束后加入你的召回列表"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:385
msgid ""
"Defeat mounted enemies with Simyr — defeated cavalry will join your recall "
"list after this scenario"
msgstr "以西米尔击败骑乘敌军——被击败的骑兵将在本场景结束后加入你的召回列表"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:407
msgid ""
"This is sheer madness. We cannot afford to wage war against these clansmen "
"when we should be marching against the Queen..."
msgstr "这简直太疯狂了。我们应该大军开进，打倒女王，而不是和这些氏族人开战。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:412
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2102
msgid "Lord Bayar, halt this folly! I challenge you to a personal combat."
msgstr "巴亚尔领主，请终止这种愚蠢的做法！我要求与您进行决斗。"

#. [message]: speaker=Bayar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:416
msgid "Ho! You have amused me, young heir. Ho, ho, challenge indeed."
msgstr "哈！您可真有趣，年轻的继承人。哈，哈，真正的决斗。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:420
msgid "Young heir? Then you assent to my claim?"
msgstr "年轻的继承人？这么说您同意我的主张？"

#. [message]: speaker=Bayar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:424
msgid ""
"Impudence. Bah! Do you see orcs on our plains? Did we not grant you a test "
"of your strength?"
msgstr ""
"真是无礼！呸！你看到我们平原上横行的兽人了么？我们难道没有给你一次检验自己力"
"量的机会么？"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:428
msgid ""
"This is hardly a test. Our battle serves only to spill needless blood and "
"weaken us both."
msgstr "这根本算不上什么考验。这场战斗只会带来无谓的流血，并削弱我们双方。"

#. [message]: speaker=Bayar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:432
msgid "No, whelp. You may be weakened, but the horse clans are eternal."
msgstr "不，小崽子，你们也许会被削弱，但马上氏族是永恒的。"

#. [message]: speaker=Bayar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:434
msgid ""
"I will promise you this, however. If your forces can defeat me personally, I "
"myself will join your cause."
msgstr "不过，我可以向你承诺：如果你的部队能击败我本人，我本人便加入你的事业。"

#. [message]: speaker=Ruga
#. [message]: speaker=Daryn
#. [message]: speaker=Alric
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:440
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:444
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:450
msgid "Aye."
msgstr "没错。"

#. [message]: id=Haldiel,Simyr
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:480
msgid ""
"This is my home, Konrad, and Simyr’s too. Although we were barely men when "
"we left, their Horsemen will still recognize us as kin."
msgstr ""
"这里是我的家乡，科纳德，也是西米尔的家乡。虽然我们离开时还年少，但他们的骑师"
"仍会认我们为亲族。"

#. [message]: id=Haldiel,Simyr
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:486
msgid ""
"This is my home, Konrad. Although I was barely a man when I left, their "
"Horsemen will still recognize me as kin."
msgstr ""
"这里是我的家乡，科纳德。虽然我离开时还年少，但他们的骑师仍会认我为亲族。"

#. [message]: id=Haldiel,Simyr
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:492
msgid ""
"Now that their leaders have offered to join our cause, I believe I can "
"convince their fighters as well. Help me defeat Cavalrymen and Horsemen in "
"combat, and I believe I can persuade them to follow their leaders and join "
"you."
msgstr ""
"既然他们的首领已提出加入我们的事业，我相信我也能说服他们的战士。帮我在战斗中"
"击败骑兵与骑师，我相信我能说服他们追随他们的首领，加入你们。"

#. [message]: speaker=second_unit
#. said by either Haldiel or Simyr
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:521
msgid "I have persuaded this one to join us in the next battle, Konrad."
msgstr "科纳德，我已说服此人加入我们下一场战斗。"

#. [message]: speaker=second_unit
#. said by either Haldiel or Simyr
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:529
msgid ""
"This fighter is injured now, but he is willing to join us for our next "
"battle."
msgstr "这位战士现在负伤了，但他愿意加入我们下一场战斗。"

#. [message]: speaker=second_unit
#. said by either Haldiel or Simyr
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:537
msgid "Konrad, I have convinced this fighter to join us in our next battle."
msgstr "科纳德，我已说服这名战士加入我们下一场战斗。"

#. [message]: speaker=second_unit
#. said by either Haldiel or Simyr
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:545
msgid ""
"I have spoken with this one, Konrad. He will join us in the next battle."
msgstr "科纳德，我已和此人谈过。他会加入我们下一场战斗。"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:609
msgid ""
"How can this be?! You have bested me in combat! Impossible... but true. I "
"will honor my pledge to join your army."
msgstr ""
"这怎么可能？！你们竟在战斗中击败了我！不可能……但这是真的。我会信守承诺，加入"
"你们的军队。"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:610
msgid ""
"I cannot believe this! You have defeated me, despite everything. I pledge my "
"lance into your service, young ones."
msgstr ""
"我简直不敢相信！尽管一切如此，你们还是击败了我。我以长枪起誓，为你们效力，年"
"轻人。"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:611
msgid ""
"A heroic battle! Yet in the end I am bested — incredible. I will join you, "
"Konrad and Li’sar."
msgstr ""
"一场英勇的战斗！但最终我仍被击败——难以置信。我会加入你们，科纳德、莉莎。"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:612
msgid ""
"Bah, a humiliating defeat! But a defeat nonetheless. Let it not be said that "
"Sir Rugan is without honor — as agreed, I will join your army."
msgstr ""
"呸，一场耻辱的败仗！但终究是败了。别说鲁加爵士没有荣誉——按照约定，我会加入你"
"们的军队。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:648
msgid ""
"We have defeated many foes — the plainsmen’s resolve is shaken! Only a few "
"more and they will surely break."
msgstr "我们已击败许多敌人——平原人的决心动摇了！再击败几个，他们必定崩溃。"

#. [message]: role=clanboss
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:665
msgid "Stop! Stop! Our armies can bear this no longer."
msgstr "住手！住手！我们的军队再也承受不住了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:669
msgid "So you admit defeat! You assent to my claim and repudiate Asheviere?"
msgstr "所以你承认失败了！你承认我的继承权，并背弃艾什薇尔？"

#. [message]: role=clanboss
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:673
msgid ""
"Indeed — you have humbled us, bearers of the Sceptre. His and Her Royal "
"Highnesses fighting in tandem... perhaps you truly do have a chance at "
"defeating the great queen."
msgstr ""
"的确如此——你们让我们折服了，权杖的持有者。王子殿下与公主殿下并肩作战……或许你"
"们真有机会击败那位伟大的女王。"

#. [message]: role=clanboss
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:677
msgid ""
"The Clans cannot risk all by joining you in your attack on Weldyn, but you "
"have proven yourself — neither shall we join Asheviere in opposition."
msgstr ""
"氏族不能冒险倾巢而出，与你们一同进攻维尔帝，但你们已证明了自己——我们也不会加"
"入艾什薇尔来对抗你们。"

#. [message]: role=clanboss
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:679
msgid ""
"And as a gesture of goodwill, I instead offer you our warchest; a vast "
"reserve of supplies and coin to sustain you on your crusade."
msgstr ""
"而作为善意的表示，我改为向你们献上我们的军资库；其中储备了大量补给与钱币，可"
"支撑你们的远征。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:684
msgid "Konrad and Li’sar have each gained 300 gold!"
msgstr "科纳德和莉莎各获得了300枚金币！"

#. [message]: role=clanboss
#. "Her" refers to Asheviere
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:694
msgid ""
"Now go from this place, and fight with courage. Fight Her as ferociously as "
"you have fought us."
msgstr "现在离开此地，勇敢战斗吧。像与我们作战那样凶猛地与她作战。"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:715
msgid ""
"Bah, the Sceptre is but a magic staff. Steel is the true test of a ruler."
msgstr "呸，权杖不过是根魔法杖。钢铁才是衡量统治者的真正试炼。"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:10
msgid "scenario name^Dan’Tonk"
msgstr "丹·冬克"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:289
msgid ""
"Hello, Isolde. I see my mother’s appointed you regent in Dan’Tonk — "
"congratulations. We were comrades, once. I’m sorry we now find ourselves on "
"opposing sides."
msgstr ""
"你好，伊索尔德。看来我母亲任命你为丹·冬克的摄政——恭喜。我们曾经是战友。很遗"
"憾，如今我们竟站在了对立面。"

#. [message]: speaker=Isolde
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:293
msgid ""
"Hello, Li’sar. I’m sorry too. I never saw you as one to turn against your "
"sovereign; your own kin. ...I suppose it runs in the family."
msgstr ""
"你好，莉莎。我也很遗憾。我从没想到你会是背叛君主、背叛自己血亲的人。……看来这"
"是家族遗传。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:297
msgid ""
"You are bold to march out from behind your walls and meet us on the open "
"plain. Are you not worried we will defeat you?"
msgstr ""
"你竟敢从城墙后出击，在开阔平原上迎战我们，真是胆大。你就不担心我们会击败你"
"吗？"

#. [message]: speaker=Isolde
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:301
msgid ""
"Hmph. My whole life, I’ve wanted to live a peaceful life. But there’s always "
"someone causing problems. First it was Garard, then the baron. Outlaws on "
"the isles, elves in the Aethenwood. Always one more thing."
msgstr ""
"哼。我这辈子只想安安稳稳地过日子。但总有人惹麻烦。先是伽拉德，然后是那个男"
"爵。群岛上的亡命徒，艾森丛林里的精灵。总没个完。"

#. [message]: speaker=Isolde
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:305
msgid ""
"And now it’s you three. At least you had the courtesy to come to my city — "
"your queen’s city — in person. I can vanquish you and your armies all at "
"once."
msgstr ""
"现在又轮到你们三个了。至少你们还懂点礼数，亲自来到我的城市——你们女王的城市。"
"我可以把你们和你们的军队一举击溃。"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:335
msgid "Defeat Isolde"
msgstr "击败伊索尔德"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:349
msgid ""
"Gryphons will appear periodically near the northwest corner of the map. They "
"aren’t your allies, but will prefer to attack Isolde’s soldiers when given "
"the choice."
msgstr ""
"狮鹫会定期出现在地图西北角附近。它们不是你的盟友，但如果有选择，会优先攻击伊"
"索尔德的士兵。"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:368
msgid "Kraww!!"
msgstr "嘎啊！！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:372
msgid "Look, gryphons are attacking soldiers inside the city walls!"
msgstr "看，狮鹫正在攻击城墙内的士兵！"

#. [message]: speaker=Isolde
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:376
msgid "These vermin again. What did that dwarf do to rile them up so badly?!"
msgstr "又是这些害兽。那个矮人到底做了什么，把它们激怒成这样？！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:380
msgid ""
"I suspect they have a particular grudge against the soldiers of Dan’Tonk, "
"but we should still do our best to stay out of their way — they remain wild "
"animals."
msgstr ""
"我猜它们对丹·冬克的士兵怀有特别的怨恨，但我们还是尽量别挡它们的路为好——它们终"
"究是野兽。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:420
msgid ""
"Li’sar, as a general of Wesnoth you were surely familiar with Dan’Tonk’s "
"defenses. Do you have any insight into its weaknesses? Is there anything we "
"can use against the general?"
msgstr ""
"莉莎，作为韦诺的将军，你肯定熟悉丹·冬克的防御。你对它的弱点有什么见解吗？有没"
"有什么能用来对付那位将军的办法？"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#. reference to Asheviere's Dogs
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:425
msgid ""
"There was a hidden tunnel, once, but I had it collapsed some years ago. "
"Sorry."
msgstr "曾经有一条密道，不过几年前我命人把它弄塌了。抱歉。"

#. [message]: speaker=Isolde
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:453
msgid "Argh! This is going terribly. Retreat! Retreat!"
msgstr "啊！情况糟透了。撤退！撤退！"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:478
msgid ""
"Victory is won. As we expected, Isolde has taken refuge behind the city "
"walls. Her army is defeated, but not broken. We lack the supplies or time to "
"besiege the city proper."
msgstr ""
"胜利已属我们。正如所料，伊索尔德已退入城墙之后避难。她的军队虽败，却未溃散。"
"我们缺乏补给或时间围攻城池本身。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:482
msgid ""
"Maybe we don’t need to, Delfador. Power is a fragile thing, and we’ve shown "
"this entire city — a city that once fought against Asheviere — that the "
"queen is not so unbeatable as she once seemed. I do not think Isolde will be "
"able to leave Dan’Tonk again without risking its revolt."
msgstr ""
"也许我们不必这么做，德法多。权力是很脆弱的东西，而我们已经让整座城市——一座曾"
"反抗艾什薇尔的城市——看到，女王并不像她从前看上去那样不可战胜。我认为，伊索尔"
"德若再想离开丹·冬克，就得冒着该城叛乱的风险。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:486
msgid ""
"That, and also I’ll leave a few of my men behind to destroy the roads and "
"harass any sorties. Dan’Tonk won’t pose any problem when we attack Weldyn."
msgstr ""
"除此之外，我还会留下几名部下破坏道路，并袭扰任何出击的敌军。等我们进攻维尔帝"
"时，丹·冬克不会构成任何麻烦。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:502
msgid ""
"We’re doing well. If we can keep up the fight for a little longer, I suspect "
"Isolde will be forced to give up the fight."
msgstr "我们打得不错。如果能再坚持一阵，我想伊索尔德就会被迫放弃抵抗。"

#. [message]: speaker=Isolde
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:509
msgid ""
"You are a more skilled fighter than you look, Konrad. I don’t believe I can "
"defeat you today. It’s time to cut our losses and retreat."
msgstr ""
"科纳德，你的战斗技巧比外表看起来高明得多。我相信今天无法击败你。该及时止损撤"
"退了。"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:514
msgid ""
"That’s a poor choice, soldiers. I hope you weren’t planning on ever seeing "
"retirement."
msgstr "这可不是明智的选择，士兵们。我希望你们本来就没指望能活着退役。"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:11
msgid "scenario name^The Battle for Wesnoth"
msgstr "韦诺之战"

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:144
msgid "Orcish Auxiliaries"
msgstr "兽人辅助部队"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:149
msgid "Shnog"
msgstr "什诺格"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:150
msgid "Agnarz"
msgstr "阿格纳兹"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:151
msgid "Arob"
msgstr "阿罗布"

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:212
msgid "Royal Guard"
msgstr "皇家卫兵"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:217
msgid "Asheviere"
msgstr "艾什薇尔"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:218
msgid "Sir Aeollet"
msgstr "艾奥莱特爵士"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:219
msgid "Sir Gunter"
msgstr "冈特爵士"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:220
msgid "Sir Aebaud"
msgstr "艾博德爵士"

#. [then]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:234
msgid "Beastmaster Burlin"
msgstr "驯兽师伯林"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:428
msgid "Raag!"
msgstr "拉格！"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:435
msgid ""
"That orc’s keep will make a perfect staging ground for our attack on the "
"city, Konrad. I’ll move forward and recruit from there once it’s clear. "
"You’re welcome to share, of course."
msgstr ""
"那个兽人的主楼会成为我们攻城行动的完美前进基地，科纳德。等那里安全后，我会向"
"前推进，并从那里募兵。当然，也欢迎你共用。"

#. [event]: id=sapper_ability_object
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1217
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1218
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1219
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1220
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1221
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1222
msgid "Bridge Guard"
msgstr "守桥卫兵"

#. [dummy]: id=sapper
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1300
msgid "sapper"
msgstr "爆破兵"

#. [dummy]: id=sapper
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1301
msgid ""
"This unit is carrying explosives. When defeated, it will destroy whatever "
"terrain it is standing on."
msgstr "该单位携带着炸药。被击败时，它会摧毁其所在的地形。"

#. [dummy]: id=sapper
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1303
msgid ""
"This unit will not detonate if overkilled by 25 hitpoints or more, as long "
"as the vanquishing damage type is not fire."
msgstr ""
"该单位如果被25点或以上的过量伤害击杀，只要击杀伤害类型不是火焰，就不会引爆。"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1358
msgid "Ack!"
msgstr "呃啊！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1364
msgid ""
"That guard was carrying some kind of strange device! Whatever it was, we "
"slew him with such a mighty blow that he had not the chance to use it."
msgstr ""
"那个守卫带着某种奇怪的装置！不管那是什么，我们以如此强力的一击杀死了他，让他"
"根本没机会使用它。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1369
msgid ""
"Well done! We slew this guard with such a mighty blow that he had not a "
"chance to destroy his bridge."
msgstr "干得好！我们以如此强力的一击斩杀了这个守卫，让他没机会摧毁他守的桥。"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1388
msgid "The fire is getting to the explosive powder! Your Majesty—"
msgstr "火焰快引爆炸药了！陛下——"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1397
msgid "Argh! Your Majesty... it doesn’t even need to walk..."
msgstr "呃啊！陛下……它甚至都不需要走路……"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1402
msgid "Argh! Your Majesty... the plan..."
msgstr "呃啊！陛下……计划……"

#. [message]: speaker=Asheviere
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1407
msgid "Carry out your orders. Do not disappoint me."
msgstr "执行命令。别让我失望。"

#. [message]: speaker=Asheviere
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1488
msgid "So. After burning half my fields, these rebels come at last to face me."
msgstr "原来如此。烧了哀家半数的田地之后，这些叛军终于来与哀家对峙了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Asheviere
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1493
msgid "So, these rebels come at last to face me."
msgstr "那么，这些叛军终于来与哀家对峙了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1498
msgid ""
"Surrender, Mother. The land’s blood is spent. I have come to take my "
"rightful place."
msgstr ""
"投降吧，母后。这片土地已经流尽了鲜血。我来到这里，只是为了夺回属于我的位置。"

#. [message]: speaker=Asheviere
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1502
msgid ""
"Ahh. My own daughter, a turncoat. Such treason my reign must endure! But "
"endure it will."
msgstr "啊。我的亲生女儿，一个叛徒！我竟然要忍受这样的背叛么！但我会忍受的。"

#. [message]: speaker=Asheviere
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1506
msgid ""
"The walls of Weldyn are strong. And her allies are many. They will arrive in "
"days — and then you will die."
msgstr ""
"维尔帝的城墙坚不可摧，而她的盟友众多。他们几天内就会抵达——到时你们就死定了。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1526
msgid ""
"Knights from the Horse Clans, footmen from Dan’Tonk, and orcish hordes from "
"the north now swollen even further with your mage Mirya’s new recruits. We "
"know, and we are prepared."
msgstr ""
"马上氏族的骑士、丹·冬克的步兵，以及北方的兽人大军——如今还因你的法师米莉娅新招"
"募的兵员而愈发壮大。我们都已知晓，也早有准备。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1528
msgid ""
"Knights from the Horse Clans, footmen from Dan’Tonk, and orcish hordes from "
"the north. We know, and we are prepared."
msgstr ""
"马上氏族的骑士、丹·冬克的步兵，以及北方的兽人大军。我们都已知晓，也早有准备。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1529
msgid ""
"Knights from the Horse Clans, footmen from Dan’Tonk, and your mage Mirya "
"with her newly-recruited grunts. We know, and we are prepared."
msgstr ""
"马上氏族的骑士、丹·冬克的步兵，以及你的法师米莉娅和她新招募的新兵。我们都已知"
"晓，也早有准备。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1530
msgid ""
"Footmen from Dan’Tonk, orcish hordes from the north, and your mage Mirya "
"with her newly-recruited grunts. We know, and we are prepared."
msgstr ""
"丹·冬克的步兵、北方的兽人大军，以及你的法师米莉娅和她新招募的新兵。我们都已知"
"晓，也早有准备。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1531
msgid ""
"Knights from the Horse Clans and orcish hordes from the north, now swollen "
"even further with your mage Mirya’s new recruits. We know, and we are "
"prepared."
msgstr ""
"马上氏族的骑士，以及北方的兽人大军——如今还因你的法师米莉娅新招募的兵员而愈发"
"壮大。我们都已知晓，也早有准备。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1533
msgid ""
"Knights from the Horse Clans and footmen from Dan’Tonk. We know, and we are "
"prepared."
msgstr "马上氏族的骑士和丹·冬克的步兵。我们都已知晓，也早有准备。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1534
msgid ""
"Footmen from Dan’Tonk and orcish hordes from the north. We know, and we are "
"prepared."
msgstr "丹·冬克的步兵和北方的兽人大军。我们都已知晓，也早有准备。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1535
msgid ""
"Knights from Horse Clans and orcish hordes from the north. We know, and we "
"are prepared."
msgstr "马上氏族的骑士和北方的兽人大军。我们都已知晓，也早有准备。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1536
msgid ""
"Footmen from Dan’Tonk and your mage Mirya with her newly-recruited orcs. We "
"know, and we are prepared."
msgstr ""
"丹·冬克的步兵，以及你的法师米莉娅和她新招募的兽人。我们都已知晓，也早有准备。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1537
msgid ""
"Knights from the Horse Clans and your mage Mirya with her newly-recruited "
"orcs. We know, and we are prepared."
msgstr ""
"马上氏族的骑士，以及你的法师米莉娅和她新招募的兽人。我们都已知晓，也早有准"
"备。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1538
msgid ""
"Orcish hordes from the north, now swollen even further with your mage "
"Mirya’s new recruits. We know, and we are prepared."
msgstr ""
"北方的兽人大军——如今还因你的法师米莉娅新招募的兵员而愈发壮大。我们都已知晓，"
"也早有准备。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1540
msgid ""
"Fewer than there might have been. Of all your allies, only your mage Mirya "
"and her newly-recruited orcs are still ready to aid you. We did not come "
"here unprepared."
msgstr ""
"比你本可拥有的要少。在你的所有盟友中，只有你的法师米莉娅和她新招募的兽人还准"
"备援助你。我们可不是毫无准备地来到这里。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1541
msgid ""
"Fewer than there might have been. Of all your allies, only the orcish hordes "
"of the north still stand ready to aid you. We did not come here unprepared."
msgstr ""
"比你本可拥有的要少。在你的所有盟友中，只有北方的兽人大军仍准备援助你。我们可"
"不是毫无准备地来到这里。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1542
msgid ""
"Fewer than there might have been. Of all your allies, only the Horse Clans "
"still stand ready to aid you. We did not come here unprepared."
msgstr ""
"比你本可拥有的要少。在你的所有盟友中，只有马上氏族仍准备援助你。我们可不是毫"
"无准备地来到这里。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1543
msgid ""
"Fewer than there might have been. Of all your allies, only the footmen of "
"Dan’Tonk still stand ready to aid you. We did not come here unprepared."
msgstr ""
"比你本可拥有的要少。在你的所有盟友中，只有丹·冬克的步兵仍准备援助你。我们可不"
"是毫无准备地来到这里。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1545
msgid ""
"What allies, Your Grace? The Horse Clans have turned their backs; Dan’Tonk "
"is barricaded; the orcish clans are embroiled in civil war. Even your mage "
"Mirya is gone. You have nothing more than the forces arrayed before us here."
msgstr ""
"什么盟友，陛下？马上氏族已经背弃了你；丹·冬克设起了路障；兽人氏族正陷入内战。"
"就连你的法师米莉娅也不在了。你只剩下眼前这些列阵的军队。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1552
msgid ""
"How long must the people endure your rule, woman? Give the throne to your "
"daughter. She is the rightful heir. We even hold the Sceptre to prove it!"
msgstr ""
"人民还需要再忍受你的统治多久，女人？把王座让给你的女儿。她才是合法的继承人。"
"我们甚至还有圣火权杖来证明这一点！"

#. [message]: speaker=Asheviere
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1556
msgid ""
"Delfador! My old tormentor! Treason! Men! Seize them! Kill them! Kill them "
"all!"
msgstr ""
"德法多！哀家多年的眼中钉！这是叛国！来人啊，抓住他们！杀掉他们！统统杀掉！！"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1564
msgid "Defeat Asheviere"
msgstr "击败艾什薇尔"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1583
msgid ""
"It’s you! The dwarf from Gryphon Mountain! I thought you were merely "
"delivering eggs to Asheviere, not fighting for her."
msgstr ""
"是你！狮鹫山上的那个矮人！我还以为你只是给艾什薇尔送狮鹫蛋，没想到你竟为她作"
"战。"

#. [message]: speaker=Burlin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1587
msgid "Well, you know what they say: money talks. It’s nothing personal."
msgstr "哼，你也知道人们怎么说：有钱能使鬼推磨。这可不是私人恩怨。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mentoring}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1622
msgid ""
"Their initial attack will be especially powerful, but they will continue "
"reinforcing Asheviere every day or two until she is defeated — or we are."
msgstr ""
"他们的首轮攻势会格外强大，但他们会每隔一两天持续增援艾什薇尔，直到她被击败——"
"或者我们被击败。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mentoring}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1626
msgid ""
"Each wave of attackers will be ready to move and fight the instant they "
"arrive, so we should be careful not to leave our soldiers exposed near the "
"attackers’ entry points."
msgstr ""
"每一波敌人一抵达就能立刻移动和战斗，所以我们务必小心，不要让士兵暴露在敌人的"
"入口附近。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1634
msgid ""
"Konrad, Asheviere’s allies have prepared a follow-up attack! This wave is "
"not especially powerful, but I suspect that each subsequent follow-up will "
"be more deadly than the last."
msgstr ""
"科纳德，艾什薇尔的盟友已经准备好一波后续进攻！这一波并不算特别强大，但我怀疑"
"之后的每一波后续攻势都会比前一波更加致命。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1784
msgid ""
"Konrad, I sense a current of magic approaching along the north road. I "
"suspect we will soon encounter that teleporting mage of Asheviere’s, along "
"with her orcish allies and mage followers."
msgstr ""
"科纳德，我感觉到一股魔法正沿着北方道路逼近。我怀疑我们很快就会遭遇艾什薇尔那"
"个会传送的法师，以及她的兽人盟友和法师随从。"

#. [message]: speaker=Mirya
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1801
msgid "Ah, we’ve arrived at the perfect time."
msgstr "啊，我们来得正是时候。"

#. [message]: speaker=Mirya
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1828
msgid ""
"Congratulations on your entry into the queen’s service, orcs. To earn your "
"first payment, bring me the heads of the rebel leaders."
msgstr ""
"恭喜你们开始为女王效力，兽人们。要想挣到第一笔报酬，就把叛军首领的头颅带给"
"我。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1837
msgid "You’re a good mage, Mirya. It’s a shame you’re a bad person."
msgstr "你是个出色的法师，米莉娅。只可惜，你是个恶人。"

#. [message]: speaker=Mirya
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1845
msgid ""
"Ow! I think it’s time to take my leave. No point dying for the cause when I "
"could live for it instead."
msgstr "哎哟！我想我该告辞了。既然我还能为这事业活下去，就没必要为它送命。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#. "Morium libre vintis" doesn't mean anything. It's just some gibberish that sounds like a magic spell.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1851
msgid "You will not leave. Morium libre vintis!"
msgstr "你休想离开。Morium libre vintis！"

#. [message]: speaker=Mirya
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1859
msgid "My spell is broken!"
msgstr "我的法术被破了！"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1886
msgid ""
"Look, to the west! There is a great plume of dust visible just over the "
"horizon."
msgstr "看，西边！地平线上方扬起了一大片烟尘。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1891
msgid ""
"That road leads to Dan’Tonk — there must be a column of soldiers marching to "
"my mother’s aid. They’ll be here any moment."
msgstr ""
"那条路通向丹·冬克——一定有一支士兵纵队正赶往支援我母亲。他们随时都可能到。"

#. [message]: speaker=Isolde
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1905
msgid ""
"Your Majesty! So Konrad has come, just as you said he would. My army will "
"make short work of him."
msgstr "陛下！科纳德果然来了，正如您所说。我的军队会迅速将他收拾掉。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1938
msgid "I’m sorry it had to come to this, Isolde. I respected you."
msgstr "很遗憾事情竟到了这一步，伊索尔德。我曾敬重你。"

#. [message]: speaker=Isolde
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1942
msgid "You picked the wrong side, princess. I’ll try to capture you alive."
msgstr "你站错边了，公主。我会尽量活捉你。"

#. [message]: speaker=Isolde
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1950
msgid "Don’t surrender, my queen! Do not let my death be in vain!"
msgstr "不要投降，我的女王！别让我白白牺牲！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1969
msgid ""
"I hear the rhythmic beat of war-drums. There is a vast orcish host "
"approaching from the northeast, behind us! They must have come a long way to "
"make war."
msgstr ""
"我听见战鼓有节奏地敲响。一支庞大的兽人大军正从东北方、从我们背后逼近！他们远"
"道而来，必是为了大战一场。"

#. [message]: speaker=Faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1985
msgid ""
"Should’ve taken me up on my offer when you had the chance, Konrad. If I "
"can’t kill the chief, maybe I can still win his favor by killing you!"
msgstr ""
"科纳德，当初有机会你就该答应俺的提议。既然杀不了酋长，也许砍了你还能得到他的"
"赏识！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2015
msgid ""
"Coming here was a poor decision, orc. The dark queen’s reign is at an end. "
"You lash yourself to a sinking ship."
msgstr ""
"到这里来是个糟糕的决定，兽人。黑暗女王的统治已经到头了。你这是在把自己绑上一"
"艘沉船。"

#. [message]: speaker=Faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2019
msgid "Yeah yeah. Let’s get on with the fighting!"
msgstr "行啦行啦。要打就打吧！"

#. [message]: speaker=Faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2027
msgid "Arrrgh! What a waste..."
msgstr "呃啊啊！真是浪费……"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2046
msgid ""
"There is a thunder of approaching hooves in the south! The Horse Clans have "
"come."
msgstr "南方传来雷鸣般的马蹄声！马上氏族来了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Bayar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2064
msgid ""
"Hail, good Asheviere! We have taken the long road and come around by the "
"south to surprise the rebels!"
msgstr ""
"向您致敬，尊敬的艾什薇尔！我们走了远路，从南边绕过来，好打叛军一个措手不及！"

#. [message]: speaker=Asheviere
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2068
msgid ""
"More likely you took the long road hoping to miss the worst of the fighting. "
"I expected better, Bayar. We will discuss this after the battle."
msgstr ""
"更可能是你故意绕远路，指望避开最激烈的战斗。巴亚尔，哀家对你期望更高。此事战"
"后再议。"

#. [message]: speaker=Asheviere
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2106
msgid "Ignore him. Run them down like dogs."
msgstr "别理他。把他们打得有如丧家之犬。"

#. [message]: speaker=Bayar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2114
msgid "No! I am beaten! Perhaps the dark queen truly can be bested..."
msgstr "不！我败了！也许黑暗女王真的能够被击败……"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2153
msgid "Mother, I swore to end your reign of evil, and now I shall."
msgstr "母后，我发过誓要终结您的邪恶统治，而现在我就要这样做了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Asheviere {ASHEVIERE_VARIATION defeated}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2157
msgid "Daughter, I built this kingdom for you. It has all been for you!"
msgstr "女儿，哀家建立这个王国可都是为了你！只是为了你！"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2161
msgid ""
"Even now, can you not tell the truth? Your greed has corrupted your soul. "
"You are a monster! A murderess! It pains me to kill you, Mother, but you "
"have chosen your own fate. For Wesnoth!"
msgstr ""
"都到了这地步，您就不能说实话么？您的贪婪腐蚀了您的灵魂，您现在已经变成了一个"
"怪物！一个杀人狂！要下杀手让我很痛苦，母后，但这是您自己选择的命运。为了韦"
"诺！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2179
msgid ""
"You have hunted me across the countryside, indeed across the years. Here I "
"am, Dark Queen."
msgstr "你四处追捕我，这么多年来一直四处追捕我。现在我来了，黑暗女王。"

#. [message]: speaker=Asheviere {ASHEVIERE_VARIATION defeated}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2183
msgid ""
"I was sure I had killed you, yet you haunt me still. Be gone, demon! I "
"banish you, ghost!"
msgstr "哀家肯定已经把你杀了的！但你还是缠着哀家！滚开，魔鬼！快滚开，幽灵！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2187
msgid ""
"Oh, wretched lady, I am very real. The land has suffered from your greed and "
"ambition. You will now be held to account for your misdeeds. For the young "
"Prince Konrad! For WESNOTH!"
msgstr ""
"哦，可怜的女士，我可是实实在在的。这片土地在你的贪婪与野心之下苦苦挣扎，而你"
"现在将要为你的罪行负责。为了小王子科纳德！为了<big>韦诺！</big>"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2205
msgid "As I destroyed your son, I now destroy you."
msgstr "现在我将要毁灭你，如同我毁灭了你的儿子一样。"

#. [message]: speaker=Asheviere {ASHEVIERE_VARIATION defeated}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2209
msgid ""
"You were always defiant, wizard, and no one has thwarted my plans as "
"determinedly as you."
msgstr "你总是目中无人，巫师，没有人能像你这样顽固地挫败哀家的计划。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2213
msgid ""
"I have always been a humble servant of the Crown, and remain such even now."
msgstr "我一直是国王最谦恭的仆从，甚至到现在也还是如此。"

#. [message]: speaker=Asheviere {ASHEVIERE_VARIATION defeated}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2217
msgid ""
"Delfador! You utterly disgust me, you sniveling worm. How dare you confront "
"me, your queen?"
msgstr "德法多！你真是令我作呕！你这条鼻涕虫！你怎么敢和哀家，你的女王对抗？"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2221
msgid "How dare I? I, High Provost of the Council of Archmagi..."
msgstr "我怎么敢？我，大法师评议会的高等教长……"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2223
msgid ""
"... bearer of the staff of An-Usrukhar, guardian of the book of Crelanu ..."
msgstr "……安-乌斯鲁卡法杖的持有者，克雷拉努之书的守护者……"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2225
msgid ""
"... Mage Protector of The Kingdom Of The Peoples Of The West-North, Chief "
"Advisor to the Crown..."
msgstr "……西北人民之王国的守护法师，王室的首席顾问……"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2227
msgid ""
"... and personal counselor to my King and my friend, Garard the Second, whom "
"you most foully betrayed..."
msgstr "……以及吾王的个人参事。吾王，亦吾挚友，伽拉德二世，你无耻地背叛了他……"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2229
msgid "I am Delfador the Great and TODAY YOU MEET YOUR ATONEMENT!"
msgstr "我是德法多大师，而今天，你——必——须——赎——罪！"

#. [message]: speaker=Asheviere {ASHEVIERE_VARIATION defeated}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2260
msgid "Treason! The evil ones have slain me!"
msgstr "叛国！恶徒杀了我！"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2265
msgid ""
"For too long has your darkness troubled the world, Asheviere. Your time has "
"come!"
msgstr "汝之黑暗荼毒世间久矣，艾什薇尔。汝之死期已至！"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2266
msgid "Vengeance for the fallen! Vengeance for Deoran!"
msgstr "为阵亡者复仇！为德欧兰复仇！"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2267
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2268
msgid ""
"The hand of the Clans strikes you down, witch! Vengeance for my king! "
"Vengeance for Garard!"
msgstr "氏族之手将你击倒，巫婆！为吾王复仇！为伽拉德复仇！"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2269
msgid ""
"Dark queen, your evil ends this day. In the name of the Light, I purge you "
"from this world!"
msgstr "黑暗女王，你的邪恶今日终结。以光明之名，我将你从此世涤除！"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2270
msgid "Here’s for Baldras! Here’s for Delwyn and Dallben!"
msgstr "这一下是为巴尔德拉斯！这一下是为德尔文和达尔本！"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2271
msgid ""
"Dinnae recognize me, do ye? You sent me to the gibbet, ye milksop, ye "
"coward! Ah’ll cut that lubberworting head right off yer steamin’ corpse!"
msgstr ""
"你不认得俺了，是吧？是你把俺送上绞架的，你这软骨头，你这孬种！俺要把你那颗浑"
"账脑袋从你热腾腾的尸首上剁下来！"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2272
msgid "Sorry about this! Oh, how did I get caught up in all this?"
msgstr "抱歉了！唉，我怎么就卷进这一切里了呢？"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2273
msgid "For Alduin! For my friends, my apprentices, and my home! Now burn!"
msgstr "为了奥渡因！为了我的朋友、我的学徒和我的家园！烧吧！"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2274
msgid "For Alduin! For my friends, my family, and my home! Now burn!"
msgstr "为了奥渡因！为了我的朋友、我的家人和我的家园！烧吧！"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2275
msgid "Dis not personal, queen. But Dosh gonna squash you like frog."
msgstr "这不为私怨，女王。可多什要把你压扁，像青蛙一样。"

#. [message]: speaker=Asheviere {ASHEVIERE_VARIATION defeated}
#. "struck by some lowborn grunt" hints to the player that there's messages if Konrad/Lisar/Delfador get the kill
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2280
msgid ""
"Oh, such indignity to have the final blow struck by some lowborn grunt..."
msgstr "哦，竟被某个低贱小卒打出最后一击，何等屈辱……"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2288
msgid "And so passes Asheviere, queen of Wesnoth."
msgstr "艾什薇尔，韦诺的女王，就此死去。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2292
msgid "We have won at last! Li’sar! You will be queen!"
msgstr "我们终于胜利了！莉莎！你就要成为女王了！"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2296
msgid ""
"Yes, but I won’t ever forget what you have done for me, Konrad. And you, "
"Delfador."
msgstr "恩，但我永远不会忘记你们为我做的一切，科纳德。还有你，德法多。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2301
msgid "So much blood. So much death. For what? A title?"
msgstr "如此多的鲜血流淌，如此多的生命消逝。为了什么？一个头衔？"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2305
msgid ""
"For justice, Elf Lord. We fight because if we do not, evil would prevail. "
"But, I implore you to let the dead have their rest. We have taken victory. "
"Tomorrow is a new day, friends... let us build this kingdom anew."
msgstr ""
"为了正义，精灵领主。我们之所以战斗，是因为如若我们不这样做，那邪恶便会取胜。"
"但，我恳求您让逝者安息。我们胜利了。明天将是崭新的一天，朋友们……让我们重建这"
"个王国吧。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2310
msgid ""
"We have taken victory. Tomorrow is a new day, friends... let us build this "
"kingdom anew."
msgstr "我们胜利了。明天将是崭新的一天，朋友们……让我们重建这个王国吧。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2404
msgid "And so the Dark Queen’s reign was ended."
msgstr "就这样，黑暗女王的统治结束了。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2408
msgid ""
"Li’sar, daughter of Garard II and Heir to the Throne of Wesnoth, was crowned "
"Queen and Bearer of the Sceptre of Fire, which she would pass on to all her "
"successors. Her reign was long, and she undid much of the evil deeds of her "
"mother."
msgstr ""
"莉莎，伽拉德二世之女，韦诺王座的继承人，加冕为女王，亦为圣火权杖之持有者。她"
"将会把这一切传给自己所有的后代。她统治了很多年，纠正了她的母亲曾经做过的许多"
"邪恶之事。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2410
msgid ""
"Delfador became Li’sar’s High Counselor, advising her in the most important "
"matters of state. He lived until a ripe old age and was granted a royal "
"funeral, after which he was buried in the Royal Crypt in Weldyn."
msgstr ""
"德法多成为了莉莎的高等参事，在最重要的国事方面提出睿智的建议。他享年很久，去"
"世之后亦得到了皇家葬礼的礼遇，他被安葬在维尔帝的皇家陵寝中。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2415
msgid ""
"Chantal ventured into the palace dungeons, where she found her great-"
"grandfather Kalenz among many other prisoners. Together they returned to "
"their home in the north and never again came to the lands of men."
msgstr ""
"香黛尔冒险进入王宫地牢，在那里发现她的曾祖父卡雷兹与许多其他囚徒关在一起。他"
"们一同返回北方的家园，此后再未踏足人类的土地。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2416
msgid ""
"Kalenz and Chantal returned to their homes in the north, and never again "
"came to the lands of men."
msgstr "卡雷兹和香黛尔返回北方的家园，此后再未踏足人类的土地。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2417
msgid ""
"Kalenz returned to his home in the north and never again came to the lands "
"of men."
msgstr "卡雷兹返回北方的家园，此后再未踏足人类的土地。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2418
msgid ""
"Haldiel — and Kaylan — returned to the Horse Plains. With the queen defeated "
"and her supporters among the the Horse Lords disgraced, the returnees gained "
"much clout within the Horse Clans, and enacted reform."
msgstr ""
"哈尔迪尔——还有凯兰——回到了骏马平原。女王战败，她在骏马领主中的支持者随之失"
"势，这些归来者在马上氏族中获得了极大影响力，并推行了改革。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2419
msgid ""
"Haldiel returned to the Horse Plains. The queen’s supporters were "
"embarrassed by her defeat, but Kaylan’s death left Konrad’s allies with no "
"one to rally behind. Change would be slow."
msgstr ""
"哈尔迪尔回到了骏马平原。女王的支持者因她的战败而颜面尽失，但凯兰之死让科纳德"
"的盟友无人可以拥戴。变革将十分缓慢。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2420
msgid ""
"Moremirmu lived the rest of his days as a wandering warrior, bringing light "
"and hope wherever he went. When at last he fell, he was buried with honors "
"and laid to rest among the other heroes of his order."
msgstr ""
"莫密尔姆余生作为一名游历战士度过，所到之处为人们带来光明与希望。当他最终倒下"
"时，他得以隆重安葬，长眠于他所属修会的其他英雄之侧。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2421
msgid ""
"Harper returned to the Three Sisters, where she led her people back to the "
"mainland, to reclaim their ruined hometowns. Delwyn and Dallben were "
"rebuilt, and prospered."
msgstr ""
"哈珀回到三姐妹群岛，率领她的人民返回大陆，收复他们沦为废墟的故乡。德尔文和达"
"尔本得以重建，并繁荣起来。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2422
msgid ""
"With Konrad’s blessing, Ulfdain rallied a company of soldiers — dwarves and "
"men both — and set out to fight for Knalga. They were never heard from again."
msgstr ""
"在科纳德的祝福下，乌尔夫戴恩召集了一队士兵——既有矮人，也有人类——出发为纳尔迦"
"而战。此后他们便杳无音讯。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2423
msgid ""
"Jeniver swallowed her pride and traveled to Alduin. At Delfador’s insistence "
"she was awarded a professorship, and would go on to contribute greatly to "
"the advancement of alchemy and the training of young minds."
msgstr ""
"珍妮芙放下自尊，前往奥渡因。在德法多的坚持下，她获授教授之职，后来为炼金术的"
"进步和年轻学子的培养作出了巨大贡献。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2424
msgid ""
"Seimus returned to Alduin, where he was hailed as a hero by many (and "
"reviled by a few). He presided over the academy for many years, where he was "
"often visited by his friend Delfador."
msgstr ""
"西穆斯回到奥渡因，在那里被许多人誉为英雄（也被少数人唾骂）。他主持学院多年，"
"他的朋友德法多常来探望他。"

#. [then]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2428
msgid "His grandparents’ loan was repaid in full, plus interest."
msgstr "他祖父母的借款已连本带息全额偿还。"

#. [then]
#. [else]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2428
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2431
msgid ""
"Inspired by Konrad’s leadership, Elrian forwent his study of magic and "
"instead devoted himself to the study of strategy. In time, he would become "
"one of the Crown’s top generals."
msgstr ""
"受科纳德领导风范的激励，艾尔利安放弃了魔法研习，转而投身于战略研究。假以时"
"日，他成为了王室最杰出的将领之一。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2434
msgid ""
"Dosh returned to the north, where stories of his battle-feats and "
"exceptional intelligence (for a troll) made him a figure of some renown. In "
"time he accrued enough followers to start his own clan, which he ruled "
"wisely as chief."
msgstr ""
"多什回到北方，他的战斗事迹和（作为巨魔而言）非凡的智慧使他颇有名气。后来，他"
"聚集了足够多的追随者，建立了自己的氏族，并作为酋长明智地统治着它。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2435
msgid ""
"Konrad kept his promise to Merle, channeling gold and attention towards the "
"Dulatus hills. That place became known as a home of great craftsmen."
msgstr ""
"科纳德遵守了对默尔的承诺，将黄金和关注投向杜拉图斯丘陵。那个地方后来以伟大工"
"匠之乡而闻名。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2436
msgid ""
"Jotha eventually returned to his home in the north, this time alongside many "
"other merfolk. The Bay of Jotha (so it came to be called) would grow into a "
"prosperous settlement; a rare jewel of civilization in the northern "
"wildlands."
msgstr ""
"礁沙最终回到北方的家乡，这一次有许多其他人鱼同行。礁沙湾（人们后来这样称呼"
"它）逐渐发展成一个繁荣的定居点；北方荒野中一颗罕见的文明明珠。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2437
msgid ""
"Warven, now elevated to Grand Marshal, continued to serve Li’sar loyally for "
"many years. He would one day be crippled in battle, and would retire to "
"teach at Weldyn’s military academy."
msgstr ""
"沃尔文如今已被提拔为大元帅，继续忠诚地侍奉莉莎多年。有朝一日，他会在战斗中致"
"残，并退隐到维尔帝的军事学院任教。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2438
msgid ""
"Blackwing the raven, already advanced in age, passed away soon after "
"Asheviere’s demise. He was laid to rest at the Royal Library, in a glass "
"ossuary ornamented with all manner of trinkets and baubles."
msgstr ""
"渡鸦黑翼本已年迈，在艾什薇尔覆灭后不久便去世了。他被安葬在皇家图书馆，长眠于"
"一座装饰着各式小玩意儿和饰品的玻璃藏骨匣中。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2451
msgid ""
"The prisoners Asheviere had threatened were found and freed, none the worse "
"for their ordeal. Most returned to their homes, singing the new Queen’s "
"praises."
msgstr ""
"艾什薇尔曾威胁过的囚徒被找到并释放，他们虽历经磨难，却安然无恙。大多数人回到"
"家乡，歌颂新女王。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2457
msgid ""
"The bones of the infant Prince Konrad were retrieved from the elves and "
"buried in the Royal Crypt in Weldyn, which our Konrad visited to pay homage "
"every week."
msgstr ""
"婴儿王子科纳德的尸骨从精灵那里运了回来，安葬在维尔帝的皇家陵寝中。每个星期，"
"科纳德都会前往吊唁。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2459
msgid ""
"And as for our Konrad himself... the foundling prince became a noble in "
"Li’sar’s court."
msgstr "至于我们的科纳德本人……这位被收养的王子成了莉莎宫廷之上的一位贵族。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2466
msgid ""
"The prince and the queen’s mutual respect grew into friendship, trust, and "
"eventually something more. They were married, and together they had two sons "
"and a daughter."
msgstr ""
"王子与女王相互敬重，这份情谊逐渐化为友谊、信任，最终更进一步。他们结为夫妻，"
"育有两子一女。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2470
msgid ""
"They ruled wisely, but some wounds are slow to heal. The croplands "
"surrounding Weldyn would never entirely recover from their razing. The "
"people there grew hard and bitter; that land spawned many outlaws."
msgstr ""
"他们睿智地统治着国家，但有些创伤愈合得很慢。维尔帝周边的农田因遭到焚毁，始终"
"未能完全恢复。那里的人民变得冷硬而怨愤；那片土地滋生了许多亡命之徒。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2474
msgid "But such was the cost of victory, wasn’t it?"
msgstr "但这正是胜利的代价，不是吗？"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2482
msgid ""
"The prince and the queen’s mutual respect grew into friendship, trust, and "
"eventually something more. They were married, and together they had two sons "
"and a daughter. The kingdom once more prospered under their rule."
msgstr ""
"王子与女王相互敬重，这份情谊逐渐化为友谊、信任，最终更进一步。他们结为夫妻，"
"育有两子一女。王国在他们的统治下再度繁荣。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2486
msgid "All was well."
msgstr "一切安好。"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2495
msgid ""
"How unfortunate, for both you and your loved ones. I shall have to make an "
"example of you."
msgstr "真不幸，对你和你所爱之人都是如此。哀家不得不拿你以儆效尤。"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:5
msgid "Overlook"
msgstr "俯瞰"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:19
msgid ""
"Konrad’s once-ragged band of refugees had grown to a massive army. The young "
"prince strode among the ranks, visiting and encouraging soldiers: both his "
"and Li’sar’s."
msgstr ""
"科纳德当初那支衣衫褴褛的难民队伍，如今已壮大成一支浩荡大军。年轻的王子在队列"
"间穿行，看望并鼓舞士兵——既有他自己的部下，也有莉莎的。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:22
msgid ""
"Many had left behind the safety and peace of their homes to make war — his "
"war. The weight of that thought bore on him. Much had changed since the "
"flight from the Aethenwood."
msgstr ""
"许多人背井离乡，舍弃家中的安宁与和平，投身战争——他的战争。这个念头沉沉压在他"
"心头。自逃离艾森丛林以来，太多事情已经改变。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:26
msgid ""
"Although once mortal enemies, the prince and princess had forged an uneasy "
"alliance; perhaps even a friendship. But the question of succession "
"remained. Li’sar held the Sceptre, but Konrad’s claim was strong. The matter "
"could not lie unresolved; not so near to the throne."
msgstr ""
"虽然他们曾是不共戴天的仇敌，王子和公主还是结成了不安的同盟；也许甚至已有了友"
"谊。但继承问题仍未解决。莉莎持有圣火权杖，可科纳德的继承权主张也很有力。此事"
"不能悬而不决；尤其王座已近在咫尺。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:30
msgid ""
"Although once mortal enemies, the prince and princess had forged an uneasy "
"alliance; perhaps even a friendship. But the question of succession "
"remained. Konrad held the Sceptre, but Li’sar’s claim was strong. The matter "
"could not lie unresolved; not so near to the throne."
msgstr ""
"虽然他们曾是不共戴天的仇敌，王子和公主还是结成了不安的同盟；也许甚至已有了友"
"谊。但继承问题仍未解决。科纳德持有圣火权杖，可莉莎的继承权主张也很有力。此事"
"不能悬而不决；尤其王座已近在咫尺。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:34
msgid ""
"At length, the rebel army came to the northern shore of the river Weldyn, "
"and paused there. To look at the city. To make plans for the battle, and to "
"talk."
msgstr ""
"终于，反抗军来到了维尔帝河的北岸，并在那里驻足。眺望那座城。制定作战计划，还"
"有，谈谈一些事情。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#. this is a lead-in to the main conversation, but also explains to the player why we start the battle next to the river, even though we approached from a different direction on the overworld.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:87
msgid ""
"—and the outskirts are barely a day’s march away. We should approach along "
"the river, to make use of our merfolk and to cover our flank. She’ll cut off "
"our supply chain if we give her the chance."
msgstr ""
"——城郊离这里只有不到一天的行军路程。我们应当沿河逼近，以便发挥人鱼部队的作"
"用，并掩护侧翼。只要我们给她机会，她就会切断我们的补给线。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#. this is a lead-in to the main conversation, but also explains to the player why we start the battle next to the river, even though we approached from a different direction on the overworld.
#. out of character, we start next to the river so that the player has a chance to use their merfolk, if any
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:94
msgid ""
"—and the outskirts are barely a day’s march away. We should approach from "
"the northeast, using the river to cover our flank. She’ll cut off our supply "
"chain if we give her the chance."
msgstr ""
"——城郊离这里只有不到一天的行军路程。我们应当从东北方逼近，利用河流掩护侧翼。"
"只要我们给她机会，她就会切断我们的补给线。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:100
msgid ""
"The prisoners could be a problem, if she threatens them to try to force our "
"surrender. But I don’t think it will come to that. She knows we’re not so "
"foolish as to give in."
msgstr ""
"俘虏可能会成为问题，要是她拿他们来威胁我们，试图逼我们投降的话。不过我认为事"
"情不会走到那一步。她知道我们没那么愚蠢，不会屈服。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:112
msgid "Delfador, what do you think? You’ve been very quiet recently."
msgstr "德法多，你觉得呢？你最近一直很沉默。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:116
msgid ""
"Weldyn. The great city. The ancient city. The city of evil. The city of "
"good. The city of men."
msgstr "维尔帝，伟大之城，古老之城，邪恶之城，良善之城，人类之城。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:124
msgid ""
"I have not looked upon that city for seventeen years, Konrad. Seventeen "
"years ago, when I should have been at the height of my power. But my "
"strength failed me. I failed, and I cannot atone for it."
msgstr ""
"整整十七年了，我都没有再望过那座城市一眼。十七年前, 那本该是我的法力最巅峰的"
"时候。但我的法力还是不够。我战败了，那场失败是无可弥补的。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:129
msgid ""
"You could not defeat Asheviere, I know. But you rescued me. That was no "
"failure."
msgstr "我知道，你没能打败艾什薇尔。但你救了我。那绝不是失败。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:133
msgid "You do not understand."
msgstr "你不明白。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:145
msgid ""
"The battle had been long and hard. We had been defeated. Eldred was slain, "
"but I knew that Asheviere’s wrath would be great. That many innocents would "
"be slain."
msgstr ""
"那场战斗，漫长而艰苦，我军最终兵败。埃雷德是被杀了，但我知道艾什薇尔的愤怒将"
"会无比恐怖，很多无辜者都将被她杀害。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:147
msgid ""
"I had to save the monarchy. I had to save the princes. I made haste to "
"Weldyn, before the guards of Asheviere could get there, to carry out their "
"evil orders."
msgstr ""
"我必须保住这个国家的君主，我必须保住王子们。我必须尽快赶到维尔帝，在艾什薇尔"
"的卫兵赶到那儿并执行他们邪恶的命令之前。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:151
msgid ""
"But I failed. I was too late. I entered the chambers of the youngest prince, "
"Prince Konrad, just as one of the evil ones ran him through."
msgstr ""
"但我失败了。太迟了，我冲进了最幼小的王子，科纳德王子的卧室，正是那一刻一个恶"
"徒用剑刺穿了他的心脏。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:153
msgid ""
"All was lost. The heirs were slain. Only Asheviere and her daughter had any "
"claim to the throne."
msgstr ""
"一切都完了。所有的继承人都被杀了。只有艾什薇尔和她的女儿才有资格得到王座了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:157
msgid "I am not dead, Delfador. What is this you’re saying!?"
msgstr "我没有死，德法多。你在说什么！？"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:161
msgid ""
"Of course, you are surprised by this, but it is the truth. In haste, I "
"vanquished the evil ones who had committed this foul deed. Then I took the "
"little prince’s broken body, and away I rode. Far away, to the land of the "
"elves."
msgstr ""
"当然，你们会很惊讶，但这就是事实。匆忙之中，我打倒了做出如此卑劣之事的恶徒"
"们。而后我带着小王子的遗体，骑马离开。我逃到了很远的地方，到了精灵们的领地"
"上。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:165
msgid ""
"By strange and mysterious fortune, the Elf Lady Parandra had come across a "
"human child. She knew not where he had come from, only that the orcs would "
"have eaten him if it weren’t for her intervention."
msgstr ""
"造化弄人，那时精灵女领主帕兰德拉偶然救回了一个人类男婴。她也不知道这个孩子来"
"自何方，只知道如果不是因为自己出手相救，他已经被兽人们吃掉了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:167
msgid ""
"The elves felt that great fortune smiled upon this nameless child. Perhaps "
"that is why this most truthful of peoples agreed to my plan."
msgstr ""
"精灵们觉得命运女神正向着这无名的孩子微笑。也许这就是这些最真诚的人会同意我的"
"计划的原因。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:171
msgid ""
"After burying the little prince, we agreed never to speak of him again. "
"Instead, this orphan child we would call Konrad, and he would be brought up "
"to be king."
msgstr ""
"我们埋葬了小王子的尸体，并约定再也不提起他。取而代之地，我们将把这个孤儿称作"
"科纳德，而他将被抚养成人，成为国王。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:173
msgid ""
"I would say that I had slain the guards before they had carried out their "
"evil deed, instead of after. No one would ever have to know. And no one did "
"know for certain, until now."
msgstr ""
"我将会说，我是在守卫们干出卑劣之事之前杀死了他们，而不是之后。没有人会需要知"
"道真相，也没有人确切地知道真相，直到现在为止。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:183
msgid ""
"I had thought that we could one day make you king, Konrad. But now I see "
"that fate has made a different choice. That despite all of Asheviere’s evil, "
"this Li’sar is fit for the throne."
msgstr ""
"我曾经以为总有一天我们可以让你成为国王，科纳德。但现在我知道了，命运之神做出"
"了一个不同的选择。尽管艾什薇尔无比邪恶，但莉莎却有着得到王座所必须的美德。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:188
msgid ""
"Parandra was right. Li’sar... Li’sar is the rightful queen. From a long line "
"of kings, stretching all the way back to the seafarers of old from the west."
msgstr ""
"帕兰德拉说得对。莉莎……莉莎才是合法的女王，她的血统可以沿着韦诺的历代国王向上"
"追溯，一直追溯到那群来自西方的海上漂泊者们。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:193
msgid ""
"Li’sar... Li’sar is the rightful queen. From a long line of kings, "
"stretching all the way back to the seafarers of old from the west."
msgstr ""
"莉莎……莉莎才是合法的女王，她的血统可以沿着韦诺的历代国王向上追溯，一直追溯到"
"那群来自西方的海上漂泊者们。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:199
msgid "Li’sar... The rightful queen..."
msgstr "莉莎……合法的女王……"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:203
msgid ""
"Delfador, I am honored. And Konrad... I’m just as surprised by this "
"revelation as are you. In truth, you’d nearly had me convinced we were of "
"one blood. I can’t call you my cousin any more, now."
msgstr ""
"德法多，我深感荣幸。还有，科纳德……这个真相让我和你一样吃惊。说实话，你差点让"
"我相信我们同出一脉。如今，我可不能再叫你表弟了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:211
msgid ""
"Then call me a friend. I was ready to be king. But in our time together I "
"have come to agree with Delfador — you will make a good queen."
msgstr ""
"那就叫我朋友吧。我本已准备好成为国王。但在我们共处的这段时日里，我逐渐认同了"
"德法多——你会成为一位好女王。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:215
msgid "It is decided."
msgstr "此事已定。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:220
msgid ""
"Now, let us not tarry here any longer! The dawn breaks! The time has come "
"for the heir to the throne to claim it!"
msgstr ""
"现在，我们不能继续在这里耽搁了！就要破晓了！王座的继承人夺回王座的时刻来临"
"了！"

#. [terrain_type]: id=impassable_fence
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/terrain.cfg:7
msgid "Impassable Fence"
msgstr "不可通行的栅栏"

#. [terrain_type]: id=web
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/terrain.cfg:16
msgid "Spiderweb"
msgstr "蜘蛛网"

#. [terrain_type]: id=dummy_obstacle
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/terrain.cfg:27
msgid "Point of Interest"
msgstr "兴趣点"

#. [unit_type]: id=Dwarvish Bloodaxe, race=dwarf
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Dwarvish_Bloodaxe.cfg:18
msgid ""
"According to legend, the mystical bloodaxes were forged at the dawn of time "
"in the great stone-fires of Dhur Darihm, when all Irdya was still drowned in "
"flame and soot. It is with them that the first dwarves made war against the "
"troll-mother, laying low her people and forevermore claiming dominion in the "
"underearth."
msgstr ""
"据传说，神秘的血斧于时间之初在杜尔·达里姆的巨型石火中锻造，彼时整个伊迪亚仍浸"
"没在烈焰与烟尘之中。最初的矮人正是手持这些血斧，向巨魔之母开战，击倒她的族"
"众，并从此永远占据地底世界的统治权。"

#. [unit_type]: id=Dwarvish Bloodaxe, race=dwarf
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Dwarvish_Bloodaxe.cfg:20
msgid ""
"While the truth of this legend is a matter of debate, battlefield reports "
"leave no doubt that such weapons exist, and that they confer great "
"resilience upon their wielder. The dwarves’ few remaining bloodaxes are "
"jealously guarded, passed down from father to son and reclaimed from the "
"fallen even at great cost."
msgstr ""
"尽管此传说的真实性尚存争议，但战地报告不容置疑地表明，此类武器确实存在，并能"
"赋予持用者极强的韧性。矮人仅存的几把血斧受到严密守护，父传子继；即便代价惨"
"重，也要从阵亡者手中夺回。"

#. [attack]: type=blade
#. [object]: id=bloodaxe
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Dwarvish_Bloodaxe.cfg:32
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/specials_and_abilities.cfg:365
msgid "bloodaxe"
msgstr "血斧"

# Translated by openai with model deepseek-flash.
#. [dummy]: id=march
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Elite_Units.cfg:12
#, fuzzy
msgid "march"
msgstr "行军"

# Translated by openai with model deepseek-flash.
#. [dummy]: id=march
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Elite_Units.cfg:13
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This unit has improved movement on forest, cave, hill, mountain, frozen, and "
"water terrain."
msgstr "该单位在森林、洞穴、丘陵、山地、冻土和水域地形上的移动得到提升。"

#. [unit_type]: id=Elvish Civilian, race=elf, gender=male,female
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Elvish_Civilian.cfg:4
msgid "Elvish Civilian"
msgstr "精灵平民"

#. [unit_type]: id=Elvish Civilian, race=elf, gender=male,female
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Elvish_Civilian.cfg:19
msgid ""
"Although elves are not warlike by nature, their natural grace ensures that "
"even untrained they have talent for swords and bows. However, if you are "
"hurling civilians at your foes, you’re clearly out of superior forces."
msgstr ""
"精灵虽非天性尚武，但他们与生俱来的优雅风姿使未经训练者也能在剑术与弓术上展露"
"天赋。不过，倘若你竟沦落到把平民扔向敌人，那显然说明你已无精锐之师可用了。"

#. [attack]: type=blade
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Elvish_Civilian.cfg:22
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Moremirmu_Warrior_of_Light.cfg:32
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Moremirmu_White_Warrior.cfg:30
msgid "sword"
msgstr "剑"

#. [attack]: type=pierce
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Elvish_Civilian.cfg:31
msgid "bow"
msgstr "弓"

#. [male]: gender=male
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Elvish_Civilian.cfg:42
msgid "male^Elvish Civilian"
msgstr "精灵平民"

#. [female]: gender=female
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Elvish_Civilian.cfg:90
msgid "female^Elvish Civilian"
msgstr "精灵平民"

#. [unit_type]: id=Dark Queen, gender=female, race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Dark_Queen.cfg:4
msgid "female^Dark Queen"
msgstr "黑暗女王"

#. [unit_type]: id=Dark Queen, gender=female, race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Dark_Queen.cfg:27
msgid ""
"The evil Queen Asheviere has terrorized Wesnoth for many years. Her "
"knowledge of magic makes her a worthy foe in combat, although her power is "
"mostly derived from those she commands."
msgstr ""
"邪恶的女王艾什薇尔将韦诺陷于恐怖之中已经有很多年了。在战斗中，她的魔法知识使"
"得她成为了一名战斗好手，虽然她的力量最主要地还是来自于她麾下的部队。"

#. [attack]: type=impact
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Dark_Queen.cfg:32
msgid "scepter"
msgstr "权杖"

#. [attack]: type=blade
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Dark_Queen.cfg:43
msgid "stiletto"
msgstr "短剑"

#. [attack]: type=cold
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Dark_Queen.cfg:58
msgid "raging blizzard"
msgstr "狂怒暴雪"

#. [variation]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Dark_Queen.cfg:141
msgid "defeated"
msgstr "败战的"

#. [unit_type]: id=Delfador, race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Delfador_Elder_Mage.cfg:8
msgid "Elder Mage"
msgstr "老法师"

#. [unit_type]: id=Delfador, race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Delfador_Elder_Mage.cfg:24
msgid ""
"After years of careful study and hard-won experience, the knowledge and "
"wisdom of an Elder Mage have grown beyond compare. Though the ravages of "
"time have seen their power a little diminished, an Elder Mage nevertheless "
"retains a dominating presence on the battlefield, calling devastating blasts "
"of lightning down upon their foes."
msgstr ""
"经过多年悉心研习与艰辛历练，老法师的学识与智慧已变得无可比拟。纵然岁月侵蚀使"
"他们的力量略有衰退，老法师在战场上仍拥有压倒性的威势，能召来毁灭性的闪电轰击"
"敌人。"

#. [dummy]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Delfador_Elder_Mage.cfg:71
msgid "levitate"
msgstr "飘浮"

#. [dummy]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Delfador_Elder_Mage.cfg:72
msgid ""
"This unit ignores most movement costs, bypasses Zone of Control, and always "
"has at least 50% defense."
msgstr "此单位忽略大部分移动消耗，无视控制区域，并且防御力始终至少为50%."

#. [leadership]: id=summoner
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Delfador_Elder_Mage.cfg:84
msgid "summoner"
msgstr "召唤者"

#. [leadership]: id=summoner
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Delfador_Elder_Mage.cfg:85
msgid ""
"This unit is a skilled summoner. Adjacent allied elementals deal +100% "
"damage and gain +100% experience."
msgstr ""
"此单位是娴熟的召唤师。相邻的友方元素生物造成的伤害+100%，获得的经验+100%."

#. [leadership]: id=summoner
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Delfador_Elder_Mage.cfg:87
msgid "Recruited elementals dissipate at the end of each scenario."
msgstr "征募的元素在每个场景结束时消散。"

#. [attack]: type=impact
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Delfador_Elder_Mage.cfg:146
msgid "staff"
msgstr "法杖"

#. [attack]: type=fire
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Delfador_Elder_Mage.cfg:155
msgid "lightning"
msgstr "闪电"

#. [dummy]: id=chain
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Delfador_Elder_Mage.cfg:163
msgid "chain"
msgstr "连锁"

#. [dummy]: id=chain
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Delfador_Elder_Mage.cfg:164
msgid ""
"This attack can be used multiple times on offense, but consecutive uses "
"strike one fewer time."
msgstr "此攻击在进攻时可多次使用，但每次连续使用都会少进行一次攻击。"

#. [unit_type]: id=Injured Lieutenant
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Injured_Lieutenant.cfg:7
msgid "Injured Lieutenant"
msgstr "负伤尉官"

#. [dummy]: id=smoke
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Jeniver.cfg:264
msgid "smoke"
msgstr "烟雾"

#. [dummy]: id=smoke
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Jeniver.cfg:265
msgid ""
"Hit or miss, this attack creates a cloud of cloying, caustic smoke on the "
"targeted hex. Any unit inside suffers halved chance-to-hit and can no longer "
"enforce a zone of control. The cloud lasts until the start of this unit’s "
"next turn."
msgstr ""
"无论命中与否，此攻击都会在目标六角格上制造一团黏腻的腐蚀性烟雾。任何位于其中"
"的单位命中率减半，且无法再维持控制区域。烟雾持续到该单位下个回合开始时。"

#. [dummy]: id=smoke
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Jeniver.cfg:267
msgid "<i>Magical</i> attacks are unaffected by smoke."
msgstr "<b>魔法</b>攻击不受烟雾影响。"

#. [dummy]: id=smoke
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Jeniver.cfg:268
msgid ""
"This unit’s attacks create clouds of caustic smoke, halving chance-to-hit "
"and nullifying zone of control for any unit caught inside."
msgstr ""
"该单位的攻击会制造腐蚀性烟雾，使陷入其中的任何单位命中率减半，并令其控制区域"
"失效。"

#. [unit_type]: id=Alchemist, race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Jeniver.cfg:274
msgid "Alchemist"
msgstr "炼金术士"

#. [unit_type]: id=Alchemist, race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Jeniver.cfg:290
msgid ""
"In contrast with more overtly magical fields of scholarship, practitioners "
"of alchemy are concerned with the study of physical matter — especially "
"herbs, minerals, and the four humors."
msgstr ""
"与那些更具魔法色彩的学术领域不同，炼金术士关注的是对物质本身的研究——尤其是草"
"药、矿物和四种体液。"

#. [unit_type]: id=Alchemist, race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Jeniver.cfg:292
msgid ""
"The ultimate aim of such practice is, of course, the transmutation of lead "
"into gold. Though several have claimed to have achieved this milestone in "
"the past, no conclusive evidence has ever been presented, and the practice "
"as a whole is often derided as the pastime of frauds — at least in the eye "
"of the more traditional orders of magery."
msgstr ""
"这种技艺的终极目标，当然是将铅转变为黄金。尽管过去有数人声称已达成这一里程"
"碑，却从未有人提出确凿证据；而整体而言，这门技艺常被讥为骗子的消遣——至少在更"
"传统的法师教团眼中如此。"

#. [dummy]: id=transmutation
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Jeniver.cfg:299
msgid "transmutation"
msgstr "转化"

#. [dummy]: id=transmutation
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Jeniver.cfg:300
msgid "This unit generates 5 gold each turn."
msgstr "该单位每回合产生5枚金币。"

#. [attack]: type=fire
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Jeniver.cfg:307
msgid "flashpowder"
msgstr "闪光粉"

#. [attack]: type=pierce
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Jeniver.cfg:321
msgid "blowgun"
msgstr "吹箭筒"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L1.cfg:4
msgid "Fighter"
msgstr "战士"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L1.cfg:21
msgid ""
"Young and brash, Fighters attack with a sword, and are vulnerable to more "
"seasoned enemies. At this early age, their greatest value is their potential."
msgstr ""
"战士年轻而又性急，他们使用剑来攻击，很容易受到更有经验的敌人的伤害。在如此年"
"少之时，他们最大的价值便是自身的潜力。"

#. [variation]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L1.cfg:87
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L2.cfg:128
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L3.cfg:126
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L4.cfg:138
msgid "with axe"
msgstr "持有斧头"

#. [variation]
#. [variation]: race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L1.cfg:95
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L2.cfg:137
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L3.cfg:134
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L4.cfg:146
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Lisar_Princess.cfg:62
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Lisar_Warrior_Princess.cfg:101
msgid "with sceptre"
msgstr "持有权杖"

#. [variation]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L1.cfg:103
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L2.cfg:146
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L3.cfg:142
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L4.cfg:154
msgid "with axe and sceptre"
msgstr "持有斧头和权杖"

#. [unit_type]: id=Sleeping_Fighter, race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L1_Sleeping.cfg:5
msgid "Sleeping Fighter"
msgstr "沉睡的战士"

#. [unit_type]: id=Unarmed_Fighter, race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L1_Unarmed.cfg:5
msgid "Unarmed Fighter"
msgstr "徒手战士"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L2.cfg:4
msgid "Captain"
msgstr "队长"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L2.cfg:21
msgid ""
"In the elven school of thought, Captains should be trained in navigating "
"small skirmishes rather than large-scale battles, and are often observed to "
"lead through camaraderie rather than coercion. These commanders typically "
"lead small units that remain together for extended periods of time, allowing "
"them to personally mentor and befriend their troops. Honing their mind and "
"body alike, the most capable of these elf-trained leaders complement their "
"improved swordsmanship with an uncanny accuracy at archery."
msgstr ""
"在精灵的军事理念中，队长应当接受应对小规模遭遇战、而非大规模会战的训练；人们"
"也常看到他们以袍泽情谊而非威逼胁迫来统率部众。这类指挥官通常率领小股部队长期"
"共处，因而能亲自指导部下，并与他们结为友人。他们心智与体魄并修；在这些受精灵"
"训练的领袖中，最出众者不仅剑术精进，还能以匪夷所思的箭术精准与之相得益彰。"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L3.cfg:4
msgid "Prince"
msgstr "王子"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L3.cfg:22
msgid ""
"The most talented captains undergo extensive training in various military "
"styles, including those of the elves and orcs. Well seasoned in the art of "
"war, they are unorthodox but brilliant strategists who can direct even the "
"freshest recruits to strike strategically against imposing odds and emerge "
"victorious. Outfitted in finely-made weapons and armor, these leaders are a "
"force to be reckoned with in both warfare and single combat."
msgstr ""
"最具才华的队长们会接受多种军事风格的全面训练，其中包括精灵与兽人的战法。他们"
"久经战阵、深谙兵法，虽不循常规，却是杰出的战略家，能指挥哪怕最新招募的士兵，"
"在敌众我寡的劣势下发动巧妙打击并最终取胜。他们配备精良的武器与盔甲，无论在战"
"阵交锋还是单打独斗中，都是不容小觑的力量。"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L4.cfg:4
msgid "Warrior Prince"
msgstr "战士王子"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L4.cfg:22
msgid ""
"Princes bear one of the most esteemed titles in human society. Trained "
"rigorously in the combat arts even in times of peace, a prince in times of "
"war makes for an awe-inspiring sight on the battlefield. These royal "
"commanders have survived many trials by fire, proving both their tactical "
"wit and their considerable mettle at personal combat."
msgstr ""
"王子是人类社会中最受尊崇的头衔之一。即便在和平年代，他们也要接受严格的战斗技"
"艺训练；当战火燃起，王子在战场上的英姿足以令人敬畏。这些王室指挥官历经无数战"
"火洗礼，既证明了他们的战术智慧，也证明了他们在个人搏杀中非凡的胆魄。"

#. [variation]: race=human
#. [unit_type]: id=Princess, gender=female, race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Lisar_Princess.cfg:4
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Lisar_Princess.cfg:64
msgid "female^Princess"
msgstr "公主"

#. [variation]: race=human
#. [unit_type]: id=Princess, gender=female, race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Lisar_Princess.cfg:30
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Lisar_Princess.cfg:88
msgid ""
"A noble by birth, the Princess has learnt swordplay with the greatest "
"generals and battle tactics with the greatest sages, making her both a great "
"combatant and a leader. The units of lower level around the Princess will "
"fight better due to her presence."
msgstr ""
"公主是天生的贵族。她师从于最伟大的将军们，学会了剑术，又从最伟大的贤者那里，"
"学会了战术。这让她成为了一位伟大的战士和领袖。由于公主的存在，在她身周的较低"
"等级的单位将能够更好地战斗。"

#. [unit_type]: id=Bound Princess, gender=female, race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Lisar_Princess_Bound.cfg:4
msgid "female^Bound Princess"
msgstr "受缚公主"

#. [unit_type]: id=Bound Princess, gender=female, race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Lisar_Princess_Bound.cfg:30
msgid ""
"Asheviere’s fearless princess now marches in chains, a prisoner of Konrad "
"and his rebels."
msgstr "艾什薇尔的无畏公主如今身披锁链行进，沦为科纳德及其反抗军的阶下囚。"

#. [variation]: race=human
#. [unit_type]: id=Warrior Princess, gender=female, race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Lisar_Warrior_Princess.cfg:4
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Lisar_Warrior_Princess.cfg:103
msgid "female^Warrior Princess"
msgstr "战士公主"

#. [variation]: race=human
#. [unit_type]: id=Warrior Princess, gender=female, race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Lisar_Warrior_Princess.cfg:29
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Lisar_Warrior_Princess.cfg:126
msgid ""
"A noble by birth, the Princess has learnt swordplay with the greatest "
"generals and battle tactics with the greatest sages, making her both a great "
"combatant and a leader. Now battle-hardened and strong of will, she can aid "
"those around her in the art of combat."
msgstr ""
"公主是天生的贵族。她师从于最伟大的将军们，学会了剑术，又从最伟大的贤者那里，"
"学会了战术。这让她成为了一位伟大的战士和领袖。现在，她历经无数战斗，磨练出了"
"坚强的意志，可以在作战中协助她身边的战友。"

#. [unit_type]: id=Shackled Mage, gender=male, race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Mage_Shackled.cfg:7
msgid "Shackled Mage"
msgstr "受缚法师"

#. [unit_type]: id=Shackled Mage, gender=male, race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Mage_Shackled.cfg:15
msgid ""
"These mages have heavy manacles on their wrists and ankles, slowing their "
"movement and restricting their magic."
msgstr "这些法师的手腕和脚踝上戴着沉重的镣铐，行动迟缓，魔法也受到限制。"

#. [attack]: type=impact
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Mage_Shackled.cfg:26
msgid "kick"
msgstr "踢"

#. [female]: gender=female
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Mage_Shackled.cfg:35
msgid "female^Shackled Mage"
msgstr "受缚法师"

#. [unit_type]: id=Warrior of Light, race=human, gender=male
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Moremirmu_Warrior_of_Light.cfg:4
msgid "Warrior of Light"
msgstr "光之战士"

#. [unit_type]: id=Warrior of Light, race=human, gender=male
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Moremirmu_Warrior_of_Light.cfg:21
msgid ""
"After years of experience, the most devout of warriors develop vast "
"spiritual powers. By strict devotion to the path of the light, they can call "
"upon its aid to chase away the shadows of the night."
msgstr ""
"历经多年历练，最虔诚的战士会修得强大的精神力量。凭着对光明之路的坚定虔信，他"
"们能呼唤其助力，驱散黑夜的阴影。"

#. [unit_type]: id=Warrior of Light, race=human, gender=male
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Moremirmu_Warrior_of_Light.cfg:23
msgid ""
"No matter how foul the pit from whence darkness crawls, there too will you "
"find these champions of light working tirelessly to cleanse evil from the "
"troubled world in which they live."
msgstr ""
"无论黑暗爬出的坑穴多么污秽，你也总会在那里找到这些光明勇士，不知疲倦地涤净他"
"们所处乱世中的邪恶。"

#. [attack]: type=arcane
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Moremirmu_Warrior_of_Light.cfg:44
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Moremirmu_White_Warrior.cfg:42
msgid "lightbeam"
msgstr "光束"

#. [unit_type]: id=White Warrior, race=human, gender=male
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Moremirmu_White_Warrior.cfg:4
msgid "White Warrior"
msgstr "白袍战士"

#. [unit_type]: id=White Warrior, race=human, gender=male
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Moremirmu_White_Warrior.cfg:20
msgid ""
"Not every white mage is content to merely wander the world, ministering to "
"sickness and injury. Magi of a more martial bent are often driven to seek "
"out villainy wherever it lies, delving into dark places and cleansing them "
"of evil."
msgstr ""
"并非每位白袍法师都甘于只游走世间、救治疾病伤痛。性情更尚武的法师常会主动追寻"
"邪恶，无论它藏在何处；他们深入黑暗之地，涤除其中的罪恶。"

#. [unit_type]: id=White Warrior, race=human, gender=male
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Moremirmu_White_Warrior.cfg:22
msgid ""
"Armed with a blessed sword and channeling their light towards the mending of "
"their own wounds, such a warrior proves a potent ally against all things "
"unnatural."
msgstr ""
"凭借受祝福之剑，并将圣光引向治愈自身伤口，这样的战士足以成为对抗一切非自然之"
"物的有力盟友。"

#. [unit_type]: id=Caravan, race=mechanical
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Mechanical_Caravan.cfg:5
msgid "Caravan"
msgstr "大篷车"

#. [unit_type]: id=Caravan, race=mechanical
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Mechanical_Caravan.cfg:19
msgid ""
"Caravans are used to carry gold or supplies across long distances. Because "
"of the immense weight of the cargo this caravan carries, it is not nimble, "
"but the driver can still try to drive off attackers with his whip."
msgstr ""
"大篷车经常长距离运输黄金或是供给品。由于装载的货物非常沉重，大篷车并不灵活，"
"但司机还是可以用辫子赶走袭击者。"

#. [attack]: type=impact
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Mechanical_Caravan.cfg:29
msgid "whip"
msgstr "鞭子"

#. [unit_type]: id=Granite Golem, race=monster
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Mechanical_Golem.cfg:4
msgid "Granite Golem"
msgstr "花岗岩魔像"

#. [unit_type]: id=Granite Golem, race=monster
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Mechanical_Golem.cfg:21
msgid ""
"Towering over the battlefield, these enormous earthen constructs represent "
"the pinnacle of elemental magic. Though painfully clumsy and impossible to "
"transport across long distances, their vast bulk renders them nigh-immune to "
"most forms of damage."
msgstr ""
"这些庞大的土石构装体高耸于战场之上，代表着元素魔法的极致。尽管它们笨拙得令人"
"痛苦，几乎无法长距离运输，但其巨大的身躯使它们几乎免疫大多数形式的伤害。"

#. [attack]: type=impact
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Mechanical_Golem.cfg:63
msgid "fist"
msgstr "拳头"

#. [unit_type]: id=Quintain, race=mechanical
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Mechanical_Quintain.cfg:4
msgid "Quintain"
msgstr "刺靶"

#. [unit_type]: id=Quintain, race=mechanical
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Mechanical_Quintain.cfg:15
msgid "Quintains are used to practice swordplay and jousting on."
msgstr "刺靶可用于练习剑术和马上长枪比武。"

#. [unit_type]: id=Wagon, race=mechanical
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Mechanical_Wagon.cfg:5
msgid "Wagon"
msgstr "货车"

#. [unit_type]: id=Wagon, race=mechanical
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Mechanical_Wagon.cfg:22
msgid ""
"Caravans are used to carry gold or supplies across long distances. This one "
"is laden only lightly with hay, instead concealing Konrad and his soldiers."
msgstr ""
"大篷车通常用于长途运送黄金或补给。这一辆只轻载着干草，实则藏匿着科纳德和他的"
"士兵。"

#. [unit_type]: id=Cave Wall, race=mechanical
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Mechanical_Wall.cfg:5
msgid "Cave Wall"
msgstr "洞穴墙"

#. [unit_type]: id=Cave Wall, race=mechanical
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Mechanical_Wall.cfg:17
msgid ""
"A crudely hewn cave wall, weakened by recent cave-ins. Experience gathered "
"from mining is of little use on the battlefield."
msgstr ""
"一堵粗凿而成的洞穴墙，因最近的塌方而变得脆弱。采矿积累的经验在战场上几乎派不"
"上用场。"

#. [unit_type]: id=Gryphlet, race=gryphon
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Monster_Gryphlet.cfg:4
msgid "Gryphlet"
msgstr "幼年狮鹫"

#. [unit_type]: id=Gryphlet, race=gryphon
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Monster_Gryphlet.cfg:18
msgid ""
"Juvenile gryphon are covered with white and gray feathers, softer and more "
"luxurious than those of their adult relatives. By the time they learn to "
"fly, most have already grown larger than a wolf, and are more than capable "
"of defending their nests from intruders."
msgstr ""
"幼年狮鹫身披白灰相间的羽毛，比成年同类更为柔软华美。待到学会飞翔之时，它们大"
"多已长得比狼还大，完全有能力保卫巢穴，抵御入侵者。"

#. [unit_type]: id=Sleeping Gryphon, race=gryphon
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Monster_Sleeping_Gryphon.cfg:4
msgid "Sleeping Gryphon"
msgstr "沉睡狮鹫"

#. [unit_type]: id=Sleeping Gryphon, race=gryphon
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Monster_Sleeping_Gryphon.cfg:20
msgid "Shhhh! The gryphon is sleeping! You’d better not wake it up!"
msgstr "嘘！这只狮鹫睡着了！您最好还是不要吵醒它！"

#. [unit_type]: id=Barrow Wight, race=undead
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Undead_Horse_Barrow_Wight.cfg:4
msgid "Barrow Wight"
msgstr "古墓尸妖"

#. [unit_type]: id=Barrow Wight, race=undead
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Undead_Horse_Barrow_Wight.cfg:18
msgid ""
"Perpetually haunted by the fading memory of its former life, a Barrow Wight "
"wanders aimlessly in a delirium of darkness and despair. Their chill essence "
"is shrouded behind cloak and bone, shielding them from most magic."
msgstr ""
"古墓尸妖永远被生前逐渐消逝的记忆所纠缠，在黑暗与绝望的迷乱中漫无目的地游荡。"
"它们冰冷的精魄藏匿于斗篷与枯骨之后，使其免受大多数魔法的侵扰。"

#. [resistance]: id=shroud
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Undead_Horse_Barrow_Wight.cfg:33
msgid "shroud"
msgstr "冥幕"

#. [resistance]: id=shroud
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Undead_Horse_Barrow_Wight.cfg:34
msgid "While defending, this unit has 50% fire and arcane resistance."
msgstr "防御时，此单位具有 50% 火焰与奥术抗性。"

#. [unit_type]: id=Vampire Lady, gender=female, race=undead, description=
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Undead_Vampire_Lady.cfg:4
msgid "female^Vampire Lady"
msgstr "吸血贵妇"

#. [attack]: type=blade
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Undead_Vampire_Lady.cfg:27
msgid "blood kiss"
msgstr "血之吻"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/bigmap.cfg:22
msgid "It is spring; the next scenario will have normal days and nights."
msgstr "现在是春季；下一场景将会有正常的昼夜。"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/bigmap.cfg:28
msgid "It is summer; the next scenario will have unusually long days."
msgstr "现在是夏季；下一场景的白昼将异常漫长。"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/bigmap.cfg:34
msgid "It is autumn; the next scenario will have normal days and nights."
msgstr "现在是秋季；下一场景将会有正常的昼夜。"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/bigmap.cfg:40
msgid "It is winter; the next scenario will have unusually short days."
msgstr "现在是冬季；下一场景的白昼将异常短暂。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/bigmap.cfg:67
msgid ""
"This port has many small boats for us to use! I won’t be able to travel "
"through deep water, but I can certainly reach the coastal islands and reef."
msgstr ""
"这个港口有许多小船供我们使用！我没法穿越深水，但肯定能到达沿海的岛屿和礁石。"

#. [time]: id=spring{NOWEATHER}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/schedule.cfg:176
msgid "Spring"
msgstr "春季"

#. [time]: id=summer{NOWEATHER}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/schedule.cfg:188
msgid "Summer"
msgstr "夏季"

#. [time]: id=autumn{NOWEATHER}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/schedule.cfg:201
msgid "Autumn"
msgstr "秋季"

#. [time]: id=winter{NOWEATHER}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/schedule.cfg:213
msgid "Winter"
msgstr "冬季"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:50
msgid ""
"I hope Delfador is well. We could have used his help in this battle, but I "
"know what he’s doing is important."
msgstr ""
"我希望德法多一切安好。这场战斗本可以借他一臂之力，但我知道他正在做的事很重"
"要。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:54
msgid ""
"The attack on the Aethenwood was bad enough. Elensefar must surely be even "
"more fierce..."
msgstr "对艾森丛林的袭击已经够惨烈了。埃仁撒伐肯定更加凶猛……"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:71
msgid ""
"I hope our rewards from this battle are worth the time we’re spending to "
"fight it. We may have plenty of time to roam the Great Continent right now, "
"but we won’t always. We should make every battle count."
msgstr ""
"我希望这场战斗的回报值得我们花时间打下去。眼下我们或许有充足的时间漫游泰陆，"
"但不会永远如此。每一战都不能白打。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:86
msgid "My hand tingles with power... Burn in the name of the kings of Wesnoth!"
msgstr "我的手因力量而发麻……以韦诺诸王之名，燃烧吧！"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:102
msgid ""
"I am glad to see that you have been taking good care of my familiar, Konrad. "
"Blackwing and I have been through many trials together."
msgstr ""
"我很高兴看到你把我的魔宠照料得如此周全，科纳德。黑翼与我一同经历过许多试炼。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:106
msgid ""
"Thank you for entrusting me with him! He has become a valuable member of our "
"team."
msgstr "谢谢你把他托付给我！他已经成为我们队伍中宝贵的一员。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:119
msgid ""
"Seimus, I am glad that you still stand with us. I fear you would have gone "
"down a dark path had Konrad and I not come to Alduin that day."
msgstr ""
"西穆斯，我很高兴你仍与我们并肩。我担心如果那天我和科纳德没到奥渡因，你恐怕会"
"走上黑暗之路。"

#. [message]: speaker=Seimus
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:123
msgid ""
"Oh yes, don’t remind me. I’m trying not to think too much about all that."
msgstr "哦，是啊，别提醒我。我正尽量不去多想那些事呢。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:141
msgid "Fool girl! You shall meet the same fate as did your brother!"
msgstr "蠢丫头！你将落得与你哥一样的下场！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:162
msgid ""
"Lord Kalenz, I am grateful for your help. But when you made your journey to "
"come join me, could you not have brought an elvish army along with you? I "
"know you’re a powerful lord and greatly loved by your people."
msgstr ""
"卡雷兹领主，我感激你的帮助。但你前来与我会合时，难道不能带一支精灵军队一起来"
"吗？我知道你是强大的领主，深受族人爱戴。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:166
msgid ""
"Even only a few elvish warriors could have made a great difference in our "
"quest! Your kin are many, and I know firsthand their great skill at sword "
"and bow."
msgstr ""
"哪怕只有少数精灵战士，也能对我们的使命产生巨大影响！你的族人数目众多，我亲眼"
"见识过他们高超的剑术与弓术。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:170
msgid ""
"Not so many as we once were, Konrad. And one elf alone can quietly travel "
"through human lands far easier than can an army or war-band."
msgstr ""
"不如往昔那般众多了，科纳德。而一名精灵独自悄然穿越人类土地，远比一支军队或战"
"团容易得多。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#. this is a hint that there's a special reward if you bringing Kalenz to Lintanir forest
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:175
msgid ""
"But should we ever make our way east back to my home in the Lintanir, my "
"subjects will certainly be ready to offer gold and supplies. Especially "
"after Asheviere’s crimes in the Aethenwood. A victory for you is a victory "
"for all elves."
msgstr ""
"但若我们有一天东行，回到我在林塔尼尔的家乡，我的臣民必定会乐于献上黄金与补"
"给。尤其是在艾什薇尔于艾森丛林犯下罪行之后。你的胜利，便是所有精灵的胜利。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:189
msgid ""
"Kalenz, did you ever know my father? Delfador has told me many things about "
"Prince Arand, and Delfador’s regrets regarding him. I feel I would very much "
"have liked to have met him."
msgstr ""
"卡雷兹，你认识我父亲吗？德法多告诉过我许多关于阿兰德亲王的事，以及德法多对他"
"的悔恨。我觉得我一定会非常愿意见到他。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#. Kalenz knows that Arand is not Konrad's father. Konrad does not. Technically, everything Kalenz says here is true.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:194
msgid ""
"Your father? No, I did not know your father, nor any of your family. "
"Delfador and I have spoken about your parentage, and there is nothing for me "
"to add."
msgstr ""
"你的父亲？不，我既不认识你的父亲，也不认识你家族中的任何人。德法多与我谈过你"
"的出身，我没有什么可补充的。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#. Kalenz speaks about the events of LoW
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:213
msgid ""
"It is sad to see what Wesnoth has fallen to, Konrad. Do not make the same "
"mistakes as did my people."
msgstr "看到韦诺沦落至此，令人悲伤，科纳德。不要重蹈我族人的覆辙。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#. Konrad speaks about the events of LoW
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:218
msgid ""
"I know something of the history of the elves. Delfador says that you once "
"lived as if in a dream, untroubled by even the rumor of strife. That sounds "
"an envious life."
msgstr ""
"我对精灵的历史略知一二。德法多说你们曾如生活在梦境中，连争斗的传闻都不曾困扰"
"你们。那听起来是令人羡慕的生活。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#. Kalenz speaks about the events of LoW
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:224
msgid ""
"Indeed. But then man came. And with man came the orcs, chasing after the "
"very sceptre that your cousin now holds."
msgstr ""
"确实如此。但后来人类来了。随人类而来的是兽人，他们追逐的正是如今由你表姐持有"
"的那柄权杖。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#. Kalenz speaks about the events of LoW
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:230
msgid ""
"Indeed. But then man came. And with man came the orcs, chasing after that "
"very sceptre you now hold."
msgstr ""
"确实如此。但后来人类来了。随人类而来的是兽人，他们追逐的正是你如今持有的那柄"
"权杖。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#. Kalenz speaks about the events of LoW
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:236
msgid ""
"In those days we fought battles great and terrible. Armies of elves marched "
"across the open plain to make war, first against the orcs, then against each "
"other. Now so few of us remain."
msgstr ""
"在那段岁月里，我们打过许多宏大而恐怖的战役。精灵的军队穿越开阔平原奔赴战场，"
"先是与兽人作战，后来又彼此厮杀。如今，我们残存者寥寥无几。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#. Kalenz speaks about the events of LoW
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:242
msgid ""
"The Aethenwood is younger; I am glad that many of their number walk with "
"you, Konrad. But some scars do not heal. I hope your civil war will end "
"better than did mine."
msgstr ""
"艾森丛林更为年轻；我很高兴他们中有许多人追随你，科纳德。但有些伤痕永不愈合。"
"我希望你的内战结局比我的更好。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#. Kalenz speaks about the events of LoW
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:248
msgid ""
"The Aethenwood is younger; I am glad that you were raised among them, "
"Konrad. But some scars do not heal. I hope your civil war will end better "
"than did mine."
msgstr ""
"艾森丛林更为年轻；我很高兴你是在他们之中长大的，科纳德。但有些伤痕永不愈合。"
"我希望你的内战结局比我的更好。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#. Delfador and Chantal first met in The Deceiver's Gambit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:266
msgid ""
"Chantal, it has been a long time since we first met in the Lintanir. I have "
"grown old. You are as young as ever."
msgstr ""
"香黛尔，自从我们初次在林塔尼尔相遇，已经过去很久了。我已老去。你却依旧如此年"
"轻。"

#. [message]: speaker=Chantal
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:270
msgid ""
"I am young in body, at least. Do I detect a hint of jealousy in the voice of "
"Delfador the Great? Hah — I am glad to have your company once again."
msgstr ""
"至少我的身体还年轻。我是不是从德法多大师口中听出了一丝嫉妒？哈哈——我也很高兴"
"能再次与你同行。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:274
msgid ""
"Jealousy? Banish the thought. It is good to travel with you as well. I am "
"sure you will enjoy getting to know our lively band of warriors."
msgstr ""
"嫉妒？打消这个念头。能与你同行也很好。我相信你会喜欢认识我们这支生气勃勃的战"
"士队伍。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:290
msgid ""
"Haldiel, you fought in Garard’s war against the orcs. Did you know my father?"
msgstr "哈尔迪尔，你曾参加伽拉德对抗兽人的战争。你认识我父亲吗？"

#. [message]: speaker=Haldiel
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:294
msgid "Prince Arand? No, I was a member of King Garard’s Royal Cavalry."
msgstr "阿兰德亲王？不，我当时是伽拉德国王皇家骑兵队的一员。"

#. [message]: speaker=Haldiel
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:298
msgid ""
"I was but a young man when your father fell, barely come of age. Garard "
"bestowed much favor upon the Horse Clans, but only so long as we trained "
"ever-greater numbers of young men for his cavalry."
msgstr ""
"你父亲战死时我还只是个年轻人，刚刚成年。伽拉德曾对马上氏族恩宠有加，但前提是"
"我们不断为他训练更多年轻人加入骑兵。"

#. [message]: id=Haldiel,Simyr
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:317
msgid "Sir Kaylan sends his regards, Lords of the Clans."
msgstr "凯兰爵士向诸位致意，氏族的领主们。"

#. [message]: speaker=second_unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:321
msgid ""
"We do not send ours. Kaylan defies the will of the Horse Clans by supporting "
"the upstart prince. What of his duty to his kin?"
msgstr ""
"我们不回敬他的致意。凯兰支持那个僭越的王子，违抗马上氏族的意志。他把对亲族的"
"责任置于何地？"

#. [message]: id=Haldiel,Simyr
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:325
msgid ""
"What of justice for Garard? What of our honor? Once, the Clans stood for "
"those ideals. How far you have fallen."
msgstr ""
"那伽拉德的公道呢？我们的荣誉呢？曾几何时，氏族正是这些理想的捍卫者。你们已经"
"堕落到何等地步。"

#. [message]: speaker=second_unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:329
msgid "Bah! Impudence! We have nothing more to speak about."
msgstr "呸！放肆！我们没什么可说的了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:349
msgid ""
"I’m grateful for your commitment, Elrian. Few are accepted into Alduin, and "
"even fewer choose to leave it. You gave up everything to fight alongside me."
msgstr ""
"我很感激你的付出，艾尔利安。能进入奥渡因的人很少，而选择离开的人更少。你为了"
"与我并肩作战放弃了一切。"

#. [message]: speaker=Elrian
#. this is a hint that there's a special event if Konrad brings Elrian to Tath
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:357
msgid ""
"To be honest, studying magic was more my family’s dream than mine. My "
"grandparents are “new money”; wealthy merchants from the east side of Tath. "
"(As an aside — we should visit them if we’re ever in the area.)"
msgstr ""
"说实话，学习魔法与其说是我的梦想，不如说是我家族的梦想。我的祖父母是“新贵”；"
"来自塔斯东侧的富商。（顺便一提——如果我们哪天到了那一带，应该去拜访他们。）"

#. [message]: speaker=Elrian
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:363
msgid ""
"To be honest, studying magic was more my family’s dream than mine. My "
"grandparents are “new money”; wealthy merchants from the east side of Tath. "
"You’ve already been there and met them."
msgstr ""
"说实话，学习魔法与其说是我的梦想，不如说是我家族的梦想。我的祖父母是“新贵”；"
"来自塔斯东侧的富商。你已经去过那里，也见过他们了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Elrian
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:369
msgid ""
"They sent their eldest grandson — me — to Alduin in the hopes of building "
"connections and making inroads with Wesnoth’s more established elites. I "
"suppose that hasn’t really worked out, seeing as I’m now a rebel and all."
msgstr ""
"他们把他们最年长的孙子——也就是我——送到奥渡因，希望能建立人脉，打入韦诺那些更"
"有根基的精英圈子。不过嘛，现在看来这事没怎么成，毕竟我现在已经是个反抗军了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:386
msgid ""
"That “Provost Seimus” we fought at Alduin seemed like a powerful mage. It’s "
"a shame he decided to side with Asheviere instead of joining us as you did, "
"Elrian."
msgstr ""
"我们在奥渡因交过手的那个“教务长西穆斯”看起来是个强大的法师。他决定站在艾什薇"
"尔一边，而不是像你一样加入我们，真是遗憾，艾尔利安。"

#. [message]: speaker=Elrian
#. this is a hint that Konrad can recruit Seimus if he brings Delfador to speak with him. That can't happen in this playthrough anymore; only on a future playthrough.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:391
msgid ""
"I think Seimus is a good man, deep down. But he’s convinced himself that the "
"only way Alduin can survive is by bending the knee. It would probably take a "
"talking-to from Delfador himself to convince him otherwise..."
msgstr ""
"我认为西穆斯骨子里是个好人。但他说服了自己，奥渡因要存续下去，唯一的办法就是"
"屈膝臣服。恐怕得德法多亲自去跟他谈谈，才能让他改变主意……"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:407
msgid ""
"Hello Seimus, my old master. I’ll bet you regret expelling me now, don’t you!"
msgstr "你好啊，西穆斯，我的老导师。我敢打赌，你现在后悔当初把我逐出师门了吧！"

#. [message]: speaker=Seimus
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:411
msgid ""
"Err, are you— who are you again? Many aspire to join the ranks of the magi, "
"but few have the skill."
msgstr ""
"呃，你是——你又是谁来着？许多人都渴望跻身法师之列，但很少有人有这份本事。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:434
msgid ""
"Moremirmu, I’ve met White Mages before, but never someone quite like you. "
"Where do you hail from?"
msgstr "莫密尔姆，我见过白袍法师，但从没见过像你这样的人。你来自哪里？"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#. this is a hint that there's a special event for bringing Moremirmu to the monastery in the Gryphon Mountains
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:439
msgid ""
"From the great monastery of the seal, good Konrad! It is by the grace of the "
"Light that I was rescued and raised there, high in the Gryphon Mountains. We "
"ought to visit there someday."
msgstr ""
"我来自圣印大修道院，好科纳德！正是蒙圣光恩典，我才在高高的狮鹫山中被救起，并"
"在那里长大。有朝一日，我们应当去那里看看。"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:443
msgid ""
"Now, I have taken up the sword and ventured forth in search of evil to "
"smite. And lo! You and I united, and lo! Now we quest together against the "
"evils of Asheviere."
msgstr ""
"如今，我已拿起剑，外出寻找邪恶予以制裁。看哪！你我相聚；看哪！如今我们一同讨"
"伐艾什薇尔的邪恶。"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:459
msgid ""
"What strange magic you wield, Kalenz. It is light, yet it is not of the "
"Light! What manner of unhallowed spells do you weave?"
msgstr ""
"你施展的是何等奇异的魔法，卡雷兹。它是光，却不属于圣光！你编织的是何种不圣洁"
"的法术？"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:463
msgid ""
"This is magic of the faerie. It is similar in some ways to your Light, but "
"it is natural to the elves. Few are the male elves permitted to learn it. "
"And no outsiders, for it is an art inherited only by my kind."
msgstr ""
"这是仙灵魔法。它在某些方面与你的圣光相似，却是精灵与生俱来的。获准修习此术的"
"男性精灵寥寥无几。外族更无可能，因为这是一门只由我族血脉相传的技艺。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#. this is a reference to the events of LoW, where Kalenz gained his magic after drinking an invisibility potion brewed by Crelanu
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:468
msgid ""
"Although I gained my magic in a different manner than do most of my kind, it "
"is now as much a part of me as is my blood."
msgstr ""
"尽管我获得魔力的方式与大多数同族不同，如今它已如我的血液一般，成为我的一部"
"分。"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:481
msgid ""
"You wield your lightning with a nigh-supernatural skill, Delfador. Truly you "
"have been blessed by the Light."
msgstr "德法多，你驾驭闪电的技艺近乎超乎自然。你确然蒙受了圣光的赐福。"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:485
msgid ""
"But what of your skill with the sword? Our foes are not content to loiter at "
"a distance and await their destruction. Enemies of evil must stand ready to "
"fight with steel!"
msgstr ""
"可你的剑术又如何？我们的敌人不会安于远远游荡，坐等毁灭。与邪恶为敌者必须随时"
"准备以钢铁作战！"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:490
msgid ""
"I need little strength of body, Moremirmu, for I wield the magical flaming "
"sword of the Lintanir. A mighty boon, and one I am well grateful for."
msgstr ""
"莫密尔姆，我无需多少体魄之力，因为我手持林塔尼尔的魔法烈焰神剑。这是强大的恩"
"赐，我深怀感激。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:495
msgid ""
"I am an old man, Moremirmu. My magic serves me where my body has failed. I "
"shall trust in you, Konrad, and our allies to carry the steel."
msgstr ""
"我已是老人，莫密尔姆。当我的身体不济时，魔法便为我效力。我就指望你、科纳德，"
"以及盟友们来挥剑了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:514
msgid ""
"Accede not your souls to the unclean, my fellow warriors! We shall cleanse "
"these dead in holy fire!"
msgstr "勿将你们的灵魂交给不洁者，我的战友们！我们要以圣火净化这些亡者！"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:533
msgid ""
"You have turned from the Light, men of Wesnoth! Hark to my words! Atone for "
"your crimes! Return to the Light, or soon shall come the black soot over "
"Weldyn and the death of all men!"
msgstr ""
"韦诺的人们，你们背离了圣光！听我之言！为你们的罪行赎罪！重返圣光，否则不久之"
"后，黑灰便将笼罩维尔帝，人类尽皆灭亡！"

#. [message]: speaker=Harper
#. Harper and Konrad discuss the events of Liberty
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:552
msgid ""
"Konrad, how come you never asked me just how we all came to live on the "
"Three Sisters? It be a powerful story, an’ one that matters for how you’re "
"fightin’ Asheviere too! I’ve been excited to tell you!"
msgstr ""
"科纳德，你怎么从来没问过俺，咱们到底是怎么住到三姐妹群岛上的？那可是个了不得"
"的故事，跟你如今对抗艾什薇尔也大有关系！俺一直都很想讲给你听！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#. Harper and Konrad discuss the events of Liberty
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:557
msgid ""
"Oh, the others already explained it to me! Asheviere took over, you ran from "
"your homes, destroyed Halstead, and ended up on the islands. Just like that, "
"right?"
msgstr ""
"哦，其他人已经跟我讲过了！艾什薇尔夺了权，你们从家乡逃走，摧毁了哈尔斯特德，"
"最后流落到群岛上。就这么回事，对吧？"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:561
msgid ""
"... err, but you can still tell me again. Your parts especially, Harper! I’d "
"always be happy to listen."
msgstr ""
"……呃，不过你还是可以再讲一遍嘛。尤其是你经历的那些部分，哈珀！我总是乐意听"
"的。"

#. [message]: speaker=Somf
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:574
msgid ""
"You ne’er seemed one for princes or kings, Harper. We fought pretty hard t’ "
"get away from th’ queen. Why’re you fightin’ for this “Konrad” now, an’ "
"draggin’ me into it too?"
msgstr ""
"你可从来不像是个会追随王子国王的人，哈珀。咱们可是拼了老命才从女王手下逃出来"
"的。你现在干嘛又为这个“科纳德”打仗，还把俺也拖下水？"

#. [message]: speaker=Harper
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:578
msgid ""
"We never fought just to get away. Baldras fought fer a better life fer all "
"of us, an’ fer everyone!"
msgstr ""
"咱们打仗从来就不只是为了逃命。巴尔德拉斯是为了让咱们所有人，也为了让所有人都"
"过上好日子！"

#. [message]: speaker=Harper
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:582
msgid ""
"Konrad’s a good person. He wants what’s best fer everyone too. And he saved "
"my life from a lich! That’s gotta be worth somethin’."
msgstr ""
"科纳德是个好人。他也想让所有人都过得好。而且他还从巫妖手里救了我的命！这总该"
"有点分量吧。"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#. stay in your graves, you rotting heaps of bones
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:603
msgid "Stay in yer graves, ye rottin’ heaps o’ bones!"
msgstr "给俺老实待在坟里，你们这帮烂骨头堆！"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#. ah, insulting these dead ones is just no fun. They can't understand me...
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:610
msgid ""
"Ah, insultin’ these dead’uns is jus’ no fun. They cannae understand me..."
msgstr "唉，骂这些死鬼真是一点意思都没有。他们压根听不懂俺说话……"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#. And stay down!
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:629
msgid "An’ stay down!"
msgstr "给俺躺好了！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:641
msgid ""
"Ulfdain, how did you find yourself in Wesnoth? Delfador always told me that "
"the dwarves preferred to keep their own company in Knalga, except for their "
"human friends at the Doors."
msgstr ""
"乌尔夫戴恩，你是怎么来到韦诺的？德法多总告诉我，矮人喜欢在纳尔迦与族人相伴，"
"只有他们在矮人之门的人类朋友例外。"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:645
msgid ""
"Aye, tha’s true. Not the most outgoin’ o’ folks, we dwarves ain’t. Heads "
"harder than a’ troll’s half th’ time, and more stubborn too! But t’ tell ye "
"the truth, there ain’t much hope left in Knalga, least not that I’ve heard "
"about."
msgstr ""
"是啊，没错。俺们矮人可不是最外向的民族。脑袋有一半时候比巨魔还硬，脾气也更"
"倔！可跟你说实话，纳尔迦已经没剩多少希望了，至少俺没听说过。"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:649
msgid ""
"Ah’m ashamed to admit it, Konrad, but I left. An Ulfserker ain’t afeared o’ "
"no troll or orc, but watchin’ my home slowly fall to pieces around me? My "
"friends dyin’ one by one? I fled our dyin’ home in search o’ a better life "
"elsewhere."
msgstr ""
"俺羞于承认，科纳德，但俺离开了。一个狂狼战士不怕什么巨魔或兽人，可眼睁睁看着"
"家乡在俺周围一点点垮掉？看着朋友们一个接一个死去？俺逃离了那垂死的家园，去别"
"处寻找更好的生活。"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:653
msgid ""
"An ye see how that ended up. A great galumphing gallow-fool I’ve been. If ye "
"hadn’t helped me miners and I when ye did..."
msgstr ""
"你也看到结果了。俺一直是个笨手笨脚、蠢得该上绞架的大傻瓜。要是你当初没及时帮"
"俺和那些矿工……"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:666
msgid ""
"This fight’s good an’ all, but when’re we getting t’ Weldyn? Ah cannae wait "
"to show tha’ dew-beatin’ gobermouch excuse for a queen exactly what I think "
"o’ her!"
msgstr ""
"这场仗打得倒痛快，可咱们啥时候才能到维尔帝？俺等不及要让那个淋点露水就蔫的蠢"
"货、也配叫女王的家伙，好好知道俺对她的看法！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:671
msgid ""
"We shall find ourselves in Weldyn sooner rather than later, I suspect. We "
"have come a long way together since you first joined us, Ulfdain — now even "
"the princess is on our side!"
msgstr ""
"我想，我们抵达维尔帝的日子不会太远了。乌尔夫戴恩，自从你最初加入我们以来，我"
"们一同走过了一段漫长的路——如今连公主也站在我们这边了！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:676
msgid ""
"I appreciate the enthusiasm, but we’re in no state to confront Asheviere "
"anytime soon! For now we should focus on surviving and building up our "
"strength."
msgstr ""
"我很感激你这份热情，但我们眼下还远没有能力去正面挑战艾什薇尔！现在我们应该专"
"注于活下来，并积蓄力量。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:693
msgid ""
"You are an alchemist, Jeniver? That is a brave choice, for your craft is not "
"looked kindly upon by Alduin. There are some who think it hogwash and "
"superstition."
msgstr ""
"珍妮芙，你是炼金术士？这选择可真勇敢，因为奥渡因并不待见你的技艺。有些人认为"
"那全是胡扯和迷信。"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:697
msgid ""
"Superstition?! No, no, no! That’s a common misconception, born of— of— dumb "
"ignorance! Alchemy is just— it’s the future! There’s so much for us to "
"learn, it’s—"
msgstr ""
"迷信？！不，不，不！那是个常见的误解，源于——源于——愚昧无知！炼金术只是——它是"
"未来！我们还有太多东西要学，它——"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:701
msgid ""
"No offense meant, my lady. Perhaps we can discuss your studies in more depth "
"at another time."
msgstr "无意冒犯，女士。也许改日我们可以更深入地讨论你的研究。"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:731
msgid ""
"Oh! Is that another giant spider? I could use some more spider poison, err, "
"venom — I suppose it’s not really poison — for my blowdarts. Can you kill "
"one for me?"
msgstr ""
"哦！那又是只巨型蜘蛛吗？我的吹镖正需要更多蜘蛛毒，呃，毒液——我想那其实算不上"
"毒药——你能替我杀一只吗？"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:739
msgid "Wonderful, the spider is dead! Just, ah, just give me a moment here..."
msgstr "太好了，蜘蛛死了！只要，啊，只要给我一会儿……"

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:821
msgid "Improved Blowgun"
msgstr "强化吹箭筒"

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:822
msgid "Jeniver’s “<i>blowgun</i>” attack can now be used twice each turn!"
msgstr "珍妮芙的“<b>吹箭筒</b>”攻击现在每回合可使用两次！"

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:842
msgid "Improved Flashpowder"
msgstr "强化闪光粉"

# Translated by openai with model deepseek-flash.
#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:843
msgid "Jeniver’s “<i>flashpowder</i>” attack can now be used twice each turn!"
msgstr "珍妮芙的“<b>闪光粉</b>”攻击现在每回合可使用两次！"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:860
msgid ""
"Konrad, I had no idea you had a troll with you! What was his name? Dosh? "
"Dosh, CAN. YOU. UNDERSTAND. ME?"
msgstr ""
"科纳德，我都不知道你身边还有个巨魔！他叫什么来着？多什？多什，你。能。听。"
"懂。我。说。的。话。吗？"

#. [message]: speaker=Dosh
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:864
msgid "Dere sometin’ wrong wit’ your head, girl? You talkin’ real funny."
msgstr "你脑袋是不是有毛病，丫头？你说话怪得很。"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:868
msgid ""
"Oh! Oh, well then, Dosh, can I trouble you for a few pieces of your flesh? "
"It’ll grow back, I’m sure. I have this, err, theory I want to try with "
"regeneration, you see..."
msgstr ""
"哦！哦，那好吧，多什，能麻烦你给我几块你的肉吗？它肯定会长回来的。你知道，我"
"有个，呃，关于再生的理论想试试……"

#. [message]: speaker=Dosh
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:872
msgid ""
"You want some pieces of Dosh? Dere definitely sometin’ wrong wit’ your head. "
"But okay. Here you go."
msgstr "你想要多什身上的几块肉？你脑袋肯定有毛病。不过好吧。给你。"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:896
msgid ""
"Oh, a troll! Err, Konrad, you know, they say trolls have amazing powers of "
"regeneration... in fact, I have something of a theory about the curative "
"properties of troll-flesh..."
msgstr ""
"哦，一个巨魔！呃，科纳德，你知道，他们说巨魔有惊人的再生能力……事实上，我对巨"
"魔肉的疗效有个理论……"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:907
msgid ""
"The troll’s dead? Oh, wonderful— yes, yes there’s something I’ve been "
"meaning to try with regeneration..."
msgstr "那巨魔死了？哦，太好了——对，对，我一直想拿再生能力试点什么……"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:922
msgid ""
"Mix with one vial of frostbone... infusion of boar... heat over an open "
"flame..."
msgstr "与一瓶霜骨混合……加入野猪浸液……在明火上加热……"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:935
msgid "Oh! Oh Light, that’s foul! That stings! It blew up in my face!"
msgstr "哦！哦，圣光啊，太恶心了！好疼！它在我脸上炸开了！"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:939
msgid ""
"I was— well, I was <b><i>trying</i></b> to unlock the secrets of the rapid "
"curation of venoms; the curing of poison and bolstering of the body and so-"
"on. But trollish regeneration seems, err, well— incompatible with my methods."
msgstr ""
"我本来——好吧，我本来<b><i>试图</i></b>解开快速净化毒素的奥秘；也就是解毒、强"
"身之类的。可巨魔的再生能力似乎，呃，嗯——和我的方法不相容。"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#. this is a hint that Jeniver will get a bonus if you bring her to Underground Channels (with Woses)
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:944
msgid ""
"Although, if you could someday find some other species of regenerating "
"creature for me to take a sample of..."
msgstr "不过，要是你哪天能找到别的某种具有再生能力的生物，让我取个样本……"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#. "from below" implying that dwarves believe that they end up in some underworld after death
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:974
msgid ""
"Ah can’t believe yer expecting me to fight side-by-side with some half-wit, "
"bog-handed, mumblecrest o’ a troll, Konrad. I kin feel my ancestors laughin’ "
"at me from below!"
msgstr ""
"科纳德，俺真不敢相信你竟指望俺跟这么个半吊子、泥巴手、满嘴嘟囔的巨魔并肩作"
"战。俺都能感觉到祖宗们在地底下笑话俺！"

#. [message]: speaker=Dosh
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:978
msgid ""
"Hey, who you calling... uhh... thing. Not like Dosh been killin’ hundred "
"dwarves or nothin’ like that."
msgstr "嘿，你叫谁……呃……玩意儿。多什又没杀过一百个矮人什么的。"

#. [message]: speaker=Dosh
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:982
msgid ""
"Dosh only ever kill two, small ones, an’ dey not even fight back. Dwarves "
"not hard to kill. You probably not hard either."
msgstr ""
"多什只杀过两个，还是小个子，而且他们都没还手。矮人又不难杀。你大概也不难。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:986
msgid ""
"Enough, both of you! Behave, or you’ll find yourselves needing to fight me, "
"too."
msgstr "够了，你们两个！规矩点，不然你们就会发现自己也得跟我打一场。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:999
msgid ""
"I am not well-accustomed to fighting alongside trolls, Dosh. In the past I "
"have fought against your kind instead. I hope there will be no tension "
"between us."
msgstr ""
"多什，我不太习惯与巨魔并肩作战。过去我反倒是与你的族人为敌。我希望我们之间不"
"会生出嫌隙。"

#. [message]: speaker=Dosh
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:1003
msgid ""
"Nah, Dosh excited to be fightin’ with Delfador. Da orcs and trolls all be "
"telling stories about all da big battles you fought back when. Now soon dey "
"telling stories about Dosh too!"
msgstr ""
"没事，多什可兴奋能跟德法多并肩作战了。兽人和巨魔都在讲你当年打过的那些大战。"
"很快他们也会讲多什的故事了！"

#. [message]: speaker=Dosh
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:1018
msgid "You bad troll, bad! Bad trolls be getting hit with big sticks!"
msgstr "你这坏巨魔，坏！坏巨魔就得挨大棒子！"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:1035
msgid ""
"I never thought I’d be fighting alongside the very wizard who killed my "
"brother. I never had a chance to meet him. Thanks to you."
msgstr ""
"我从没想过自己竟会和杀死我哥哥的那个巫师并肩作战。我从未有机会见到他。多亏了"
"你。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:1039
msgid ""
"You never had a chance to meet your father, either. I think Garard would be "
"proud of you. You have his skill with the sword."
msgstr ""
"你也从未有机会见到你的父亲。我想伽拉德会为你骄傲。你继承了他使剑的本领。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:1043
msgid ""
"But as for your brother... I have no doubt that Asheviere puffed Eldred up "
"with flattery and lies, but it was his hand and his hand alone that slew the "
"old king. Your brother sealed his own fate that day, Li’sar."
msgstr ""
"至于你的兄长……我毫不怀疑艾什薇尔用奉承和谎言把埃雷德捧得忘乎所以，但杀死老国"
"王的，是他自己的手，也仅仅是他自己的手。莉莎，你的兄长那日便已亲手注定了自己"
"的命运。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:1047
msgid ""
"Save your breath. You’re not making this any easier. Let’s just do what "
"needs to be done."
msgstr "省省你的口舌吧。你并没有让这事好受一点。我们只管做该做的事。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:1062
msgid "A powerful magic awakens in my hands. Behold the Sceptre of Fire!"
msgstr "一股强大的魔法在我手中苏醒。看哪，圣火权杖！"

#. [message]: id=$defector1.id
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:1177
msgid "Is that... the Sceptre of Fire?! Ye gods, it’s real!"
msgstr "那是……圣火权杖？！众神在上，它居然是真的！"

#. [then]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:1184
msgid "The legends are true! The true queen has come!"
msgstr "传说都是真的！真正的女王来了！"

#. [then]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:1185
msgid "Spare me, madam, and I will pledge myself into your service!"
msgstr "饶我一命，女士，我愿宣誓为您效劳！"

#. [then]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:1187
msgid "The legends are true! The true king has come!"
msgstr "传说都是真的！真正的国王来了！"

#. [then]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:1188
msgid "Spare me, sir, and I will pledge myself into your service!"
msgstr "饶我一命，先生，我愿宣誓为您效劳！"

#. [message]: id=$defector2.id
#. [message]: id=$defector1.id
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:1206
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:1211
msgid "And I!"
msgstr "还有我！"

#. [dummy]: id=exacting
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/specials_and_abilities.cfg:9
msgid "exacting"
msgstr "严苛训练"

#. [dummy]: id=exacting
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/specials_and_abilities.cfg:10
msgid ""
"Li’sar has drilled her infantry to perfection. Though few in number, each of "
"her soldiers possesses skills not usually seen on others of their type."
msgstr ""
"莉莎将她的步兵操练得尽善尽美。尽管人数不多，但她麾下的每名士兵都拥有同类士兵"
"通常不具备的技能。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/specials_and_abilities.cfg:62
msgid ""
"I studied Li’sar back in the Aethenwood. Though her personal company is not "
"large in number, they are exactingly trained — each of them possesses one "
"ability not usually seen on others of their type."
msgstr ""
"我在艾森丛林时就研究过莉莎。她的私人部队虽然人数不多，却受过极其严苛的训练——"
"他们每个人都拥有一种同类士兵通常不具备的能力。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/specials_and_abilities.cfg:77
msgid ""
"Look there: one of Li’sar’s personal company! I studied them back in the "
"Aethenwood. Though not large in number, they are exactingly trained — each "
"of them possesses one ability not usually seen on others of their type."
msgstr ""
"瞧那边：那是莉莎私人部队的一员！我在艾森丛林时就研究过他们。他们虽然人数不"
"多，却受过极其严苛的训练——每个人都拥有一种同类士兵通常不具备的能力。"

#. [dummy]: id=rejuvenate
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/specials_and_abilities.cfg:92
msgid "rejuvenates"
msgstr "复元"

#. [dummy]: id=rejuvenate
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/specials_and_abilities.cfg:93
msgid ""
"This unit will heal itself and adjacent allied units for 4 HP each turn. "
"This ability cannot cure poison, however, only delay its effect."
msgstr ""
"该单位每回合为自身及相邻友方单位提供4点生命值的治疗。不过，此能力无法治愈中"
"毒，只能延缓其效果。"

