msgstr "凉鞋"

#. [dummy]: id=sandals
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/specials_and_abilities.cfg:331
msgid "This unit has 40% defense and full movement on water, swamp, and snow."
msgstr "该单位在水域、沼泽和雪地上拥有 40% 防御力，并能全速移动。"

#. [dummy]: id=horn
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/specials_and_abilities.cfg:386
