msgstr "兽人号角"

#. [dummy]: id=horn
#. "ally" includes both the player's units and allied units. "living" excludes Delfador's elementals. When one ally dies, other allies gain the "regenerates" ability for one turn.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/specials_and_abilities.cfg:388
msgid ""
"Whenever one living ally dies, all others gain regeneration for one turn."
msgstr "每当一名有生命的盟友死亡死亡，其他所有盟友获得持续一回合的再生效果。"

